<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Arum Bibleh translation</book>
  <para style="h">Ndohmoh amboh tohmoh mboh</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ndohmoh amboh sa tohmoh mboh</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ndo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ndo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ndohmoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Amboh Sa Tohmoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Amgbasho ndohmoh amboh ble tsifa nana mboh reh, atsifa ma ikpi amboh tufa Yeso mboh amboh jijii ata huru zanana ta ka a tsana mboh aki reh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Huru Nnoh A gu Yeso A ka A na Inza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Nnoh Tiyofilus, amgbasho amya ata jiji reh, meh ŋa ma ikpi awumu amboh ata Yeso ta ka a jiji a leh a lisa mboh tasa ata ta ka a jiji a leh a tsana mboh za reh, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />a gu ka a na ibi ata tama ka a gu ŋoh a na inza reh. Neh maa hehreh a gu ŋoh a na inza reh kpeh, a bleh tsifa ma amboh sa tohmoh nana ŋoh nza a seh mboh reh, ma aki huru zanana Nnoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Ibi agrumavoh dida aniye nza ma ka a gǝga neh kǝ kwo hinga, ka a gyuru ka a kate mboh ma akeki vara ata a tsana la a bu na fene yama. Ma a nza ŋoh, ka a tsifa na amoh ma ikpi akpo afiya Nnoh ata inza reh. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Ibi-anyi neh, ŋoh ka a buti rya irya mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh, ka a bleh mboh tsifa areh la, &lt;&lt;Kama ta nnoh Urushalima kpeh, ti tuma bana nnoh andromboh ata Nnoh Ada amya nza a bleh a gya la ŋoh a nati nga nnoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Ayohana neh a wra kyangwri mboh batisma na amwo, a nati a yanda kpeh neh ma nati a wra nnoh batisma ni Huru zanana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso bleh mboh nza maka a dohsohna nambri reh, maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Agba mbohroh, a bu nehnehreh ŋa ni nati gyuru nga kpra Agohmoh ma Israila mboh mata a de reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Wina ibi ha ameh a bu na wuwana Ada ŋoh tsene, ata areh a bu amohnoh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Mohnoh neh ni nati sa nnoh wuwana ameh ata Huru zanana kǝ ba na amohnoh.&gt;&gt; Ni nati bu noh amboh bleh kyangwri ma ikpi amya andromboh ata ni nza noh ma Urushalima, tasa Yahudiya tasa Samariya, tasa inziyo na agba ma.<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Yeso nza ka atsifa ka tre, Nnoh ka a gu ŋoh a na inza ma iyo amoh, tasa avereh anyi ka a hama ŋoh ma a nza ŋoh za kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Maka shi ka a nza avereh inza nza leh a na ŋoh reh. Ma a huru heri kyangwri afri ma shi na kuri atatasaa ma inda amoh. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Kyangwri afri reh ma bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh kyangwri Galili,&gt;&gt; Ni shi were nnoh iyo nza noh avereh inza reh tsifa umbo? Yeso ata areh, nza ma a gu ŋoh anyi na mohnoh a na inza reh, a nati gyuru a ba ŋoh Ika ata nza a na a ŋoh inza reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A seh Matiyas ta A sa Ndohmoh Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Amboh sa tohmoh Nana Yeso a bleh nza ma a gyuru anyi agbohgboh akpehngeh a ba amoh Urushalima, ma a gu ibi asabar masa a hehndeh anyi akpo afiya reh, ma a hehndeh a na gbugba kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Nza maka a ba ba aniye ma akpo afiya reh, maka a ka ka a na amoh ma ida inza maka aniye nimeh ida ata nza ma a bu reh. amboh nza ma a yama ma a huru reh ma bu Abitrusu, tasa Ayohana,tasa Yakubu, tasa Andarawus, tasa Filibus, tasa Toma, tasa Bartalomi, tasa Amatiyu, tasa Yakubu amehreh Halfa, tasa Siman Zaloti, tasa Yahuda amehreh Yakubu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka a dohsohna nambri ma amoh na agohsoh anyimbehreh a leh a kwere Nnoh, mboh ma ifiya mboh tasa Maryamu akre Yeso, tasa za mboh ma atsini mboh.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Na ameh wohroh reh Abitrusu ka a hinga a shi na hohroh amboh tufa mboh, amboh ata ma a kira na isa Yeso reh, ma bu mboh kyangwri 120. <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ambohroh mboh, tsifa nza ma a ŋa a gya na amgbasho Nnoh reh kǝ su ata Huru zanana ta ka a bleh ni kpikpi ŋoh reh ma aniye Dawuda ni ikpi Yahuda, ŋoh ata nza a tsana aki ma amboh de Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Ŋoh Yahuda reh tana bu anyimbehreh nimeh ambohroh, tama a seh ŋoh la ta a te ndohmoh ambohroh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Nza maka nga ŋoh ivoh ndohmoh agugu a ŋoh reh, Yahuda ka sa kpra Agohmoh; ka a hwa ni ikpi na a huru, yira a ŋoh ka a hwrana, mara yira a ŋoh za ka a sangrana ma inziyo. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />amboh ta nza ma a yama ma Urushalima ma a sehreh andromboh ata nza a hunji Yahuda reh, maka a fi sa kpra Agohmoh reh na mgba amoh la Akaldama, a ka bu kpakpranda imya.<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Abitrusu ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza a bu dehreh&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho Zabura reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">&lt;&lt;Atsifi tuma anzoh ta bu afiya atono;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">akyo ta za a wina tuma ma a huru za kpeh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">tasa ma a ŋa za la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">&lt;Akyo anyi ta ka a gyuru a gu ndohmoh a ŋoh reh ka a de.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Nza a bu dehreh a zohhoh mata a seh akyo anyi nimeh kyangwri amboh areh, ata nza a bu na ambohroh nza a gu anyi ameh ata Ada Yeso ta ka a leh a hehndeh ma ambohroh reh, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />nza ka a gu ka anyi na wra batisma Ayohana reh ka a gu ka ba na ameh ata Yeso ta ka a yi reh ata a na ŋoh inza reh. Anyimbehreh nimeh kyangwri amboh areh a nati a shi ta a bleh ma ikpi hinga a ŋoh anyi ma kwo na ambohroh reh. <verse eid="ACT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Tasa za maka a de kyangwri afri ba: Yusufu ata maka a fi ŋoh la Barsaba maka a fi ŋoh za la Yustus, tasa Matiyas. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Amboh sa tohmoh nana reh maka a kwere Nnoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, ni wina agohsoh ambohroh mboh reh nambri. tsana reh nimeh amboh afri areh a bu atamaa meh nati seh <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />ta ka a te ndohmoh sa tomo nana reh aniye Yahuda, ata ŋoh ta ka ata ta ŋoh ta a na ŋoh akpo atsifi a ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Maka a were seh, maka a seh Matiyas, maka a gu ŋoh la bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso, mboh ma mgbiri agrumavoh a hwa anyimbehreh reh.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ba Huru Zanana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Ibi kira Fentiko nza ka a ba reh, amboh tufa mboh reh nambri ma amoh maka yama ma akpo anyimbehreh. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ma hwana anyimbehreh, maka a sehreh gohroh ka anyi inza tswanza gohroh inyo agba ka a su nimeh afiya ata mboh nza ma a yama reh nambri. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Ma huru Maka a nza andromboh amboh anyi tswanza arimi shira reh tsi leh gafana ma ikpi amoh mboh. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Huru zanana reh ka a tamba a ba mboh nambri ma amoh, maka a leh atsifa na arimi atsetse tswanza huru nza a bleh mboh reh.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ma Urushalima na ameh wohroh reh, Yahudawa amboh anyi ma a yama amboh tufa Nnoh maka anyi akpokpo atsifi mboh ma inziyo areh nambri. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Nza maka a sehreh gohroh reh, duma maka a ba ba a dohsohna ma atsi tuma amboh tufa mboh reh amoh reh, la nambri ma amoh ma a leh atsi sehreh mboh atsi tsifa na arimi amoh mboh. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Maka a leh a ŋara aniye, maka luhu la, &lt;&lt;Amboh areh ma bu kyangwri Galili mboh kpeh? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />A bu lele feh mbohroh meh sehreh mboh ma leh atsifa arimi ambohroh mboh? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />mbohroh neh meh bu Fartiyawa, tasa mediyawa, tasa Elamawa, tasa kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu ma akpo afiya Mesofotamiya, tasa ata Yahudiya, tasa ata Kafadokiya tasa ata Fantus, tasa ata Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />tasa ata Firijiya, tasa ata Famfiliya, tasa ata Masar, tasa za nza ka a goh Sayirin ata akpo afiya Libiya nza bu ma nda Sayirin; kawa sehneh mboh nza ma anyi Romawa reh. <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Kawa Yahudawa mboh tasa amboh ata nza ma a gyuruna a tufa Yahudawa mboh reh; tasa mbohroh Kiritawa, tasa Larabawa, mbohroh meh sehreh mboh ma a leh atsifa ma ikpi agbugba ndohmoh Nnoh reh na arimi ambohroh mboh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Maka a leh a ŋara aniye ni kohnoh, tasa za maka a leh luhu itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a ka bu umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Mgbiri neh maka a leh a te mboh inyi la, &lt;&lt;Ma a wa amwo mara agbeh inabi gaga neh ka a te mboh fiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abitrusu Atsifa na Duma Mboh ma ibi Fentiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Abitrusu ka a de a hinga ka a shi na mgbiri agrumavoh a hwa anyimbehreh reh, ka a vuru agba ka a bleh ma duma mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ambohroh mboh Yahudawa mboh tasa mohnoh mgbiri nza ni yama nnoh ma Urushalima reh, ta meh ti bleh noh yehlehleh; tuma ti sehreh noh andromboh ata mya nza ni nati bleh noh reh. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Kyangwri amboh areh ma te fiya kpeh, tswanza nza ni gu mboh nnoh reh, nehnehreh a treh bu noh atehrehkifi na aniye ata nerebi fya! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Mma, ata areh a bu andromboh ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh ma aniye Yowel kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh reh:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />&lt;Nnoh a bleh la, areh a bu andromboh ata meh nati lisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Meh nati were Huru amya reh ba ma kyangwri mboh nambri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Mara anzoh kawa nyifa anzoh mboh ma a nati a nza tohmoh a bleh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">kafa kyangwri mboh ma a nati a nza yafa mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Agbugba kyangwri za ma a nati a te wono.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Tasa ahwra amya mboh za, kawa ahwra tsifa tasa ahwra ifya mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Meh nati were huru amya na mboh ibi amboh wohroh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">tasa za ma a nati a bleh tsifa ma ikpi amya.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Meh nati tsana noh ndohmoh ŋara aniye ma avereh inza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">tasa za meh ti tsana noh kpra mboh ma inziyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Imya tasa shira tasa inzo hungwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Nnoh a nati a gyuru a hungwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">tasa za nara a nati a gyuru a te imya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">a treh feh ibi agba ata Nnoh nza a nati a ba reh.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Tasa akyo ata nza a nati a fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">isa Ada reh a nati anvara.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />&lt;&lt;Mohnoh kyangwri Israila mboh reh, sehreh noh tsifa ata areh: Yeso ata Nazaret tana a bu kyangwri ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh noh a shimba la ŋoh wa a kira na a ŋoh reh. Nnoh a tsana areh ma aki agbugba ndohmoh a ŋoh, tasa ata ndohmoh ŋara aniye a ŋoh mboh, ata Nnoh nza a lisa na amohnoh nimeh isa Yeso, a tswanza mohnoh nza ni wina noh na ikpi amohnoh reh <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Nnoh kǝ gya ma agohsoh ŋoh na kira ŋoh ta nga noh Yeso kyangwri ata areh, ni mla nnoh shebiri ma aki kira amboh agugu ma ta ka a kpa ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Nnoh neh ka a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo, ta ka sa ŋoh a hwana nyi ni iya ata kwo, la a nati a tswa kwo ta a de ŋoh a gya kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Dawuda za atsifa ni ikpi a ŋoh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Meh tini nza Ada reh na tutu ma tohmoh amya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">la ŋoh reh a yama ma ivoh rya a kpa amya.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Nza a bu dehreh neh, agohsoh amya ta a nza nana tasa za aniye amya ta a johjoh na anzoh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">itoh amya za a nati a tuma gya agohsoh na anzoh,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />la ni nati ta fene amya ta a na ma kpi nyifo kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">ha neh ti ta kyangwri zanana a ŋoh ta a kwo a hwina kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Ni tsana meh aki ata meh nati hunji fene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">ni nati nga meh nana agohsoh ma tohmoh anzoh reh.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Abitrusu ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Ambohroh mboh, meh tswa meh ti bleh noh na agohsoh anyimbehreh ma ikpi Ada mbohroh Dawuda na kiri, la tana a kwo neh maka anyifo ŋoh, ikpi nyifo a ŋoh a yama na ambohroh nehnehreh. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ŋoh Dawuda neh tana a bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh, a wina la Nnoh reh tana a gu faku a bleh ŋoh a gya la ŋoh a nati a gu alohsoh a ŋoh anyi a gya Agohmoh tswanza ta ka a gu Dawuda a gya ma kpra Agohmoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Ŋoh Dawuda nza ka a nza dehreh reh, ka atsifa ma ikpi hinga Kristi anyi ma tsiyo reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">ma a nati a yi ŋoh ata nimeh kpi nyifo kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">ha neh itoh a ŋoh ta a hwina kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Nnoh neh ka a yiri Yeso anyi ma kwo, mbohroh nambri meh nza na iyo ambohroh meh ti bleh ma ikpi la ŋoh Yeso reh a gyuru a bu na fene. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Ma a gu ŋoh a ka nza na ivoh rya a kpa Nnoh, ŋoh ka sa huru zanana anyi na Nnoh ata Ada ta ka a bleh a gya reh, a ka a sangra ma iyo amohnoh ti nza noh, tasa ti sehreh noh za. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Dawuda feh ma a gu ŋoh a ka a na ma inza kpeh, ŋoh neh ka a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">&lt;Nnoh ka a bleh ma Agba amya:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">Tuma na ivoh rya a kpa amya<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />meh nati lisa amboh ata ma a fi noh ma tohmoh reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">kpra gya hwana anzoh ti huhuya mboh.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Nza a bu dehreh neh la kyangwri Israila mboh na agba ma amoh mata a wina zizi ata areh: La Yeso ata mohnoh nza ni kpa nnoh ma agbeh reh, Nnoh neh kǝ gu Yeso reh a gya ta a bu Ada tasa Kristi&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Kyangwri mboh reh nza maka a sehreh dehreh, tsifa reh ka a bara mboh ma agohsoh tasa maka a bleh ma Abitrusu tasa mgbiri amboh ble tsifa nana reh la, ambohroh mboh, meh nati lisa lele?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Abitrusu ka a kira la, Ta nnoh aki agugu amohnoh reh mata a wra nnoh batisma, nambri ma amohnoh, nimeh isa Yeso Kristi reh la mata a te kohhroh na kpakpana amohnoh. Tasa za ni nati sa nnoh ngǝnga ata Huru zanana. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Tsifa ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh a bu amohnoh tasa mara amohnoh mboh, tasa amboh ata ma bu gbugba na anzoh, mboh amboh ata Ada Nnoh ambohroh a nati a fi mboh a ba na a ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Abitrusu ka a leh akpi mboh ashotoh na mgbiri vara tsifa mboh; a ka a gyuru a kwere mboh za la, &lt;&lt;Ti nvara nnoh ikpi amohnoh nyi nnoh na agugu ika amboh ata ameh ata areh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Amboh ata nza ma sa tsifa Abitrusu reh a kira neh maka a wra mboh batisma, Kyangwri gaga ma bu dubu atatoh nza ma a mishi mboh ibi wohroh reh.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuma amboh tufa mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Maka a kasa atsi leh sehreh tsana amboh sa tohmoh nana reh, tasa za maka a leh dohsohkpi a lisa awumu amoh mboh reh agba anyi, maka a leh a gafa rya irya tasa kwere Nnoh ma akpo anyimbehreh.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Nambri ma amoh maka a nyiri nimeh agohsoh amoh mboh, na ndohmoh ŋara aniye tasa kpra amboh ble tsifa nana mboh nza ma a leh a tsana reh. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Amboh nza ma sa tsifa a kira reh maka a bu ma akpo anyimbehreh tasa za maka a leh a gafa awumu amoh mboh ma itoh amoh. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Maka a fira awumu amoh mboh a rifa nambri, maka a gafa hungroh za ma amboh ata nza ma a kira reh. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Maka a leh a dohsohna ni tutu nimeh ida Nnoh reh, maka a rya irya za ma akpo anyimbehreh ma afiyafiya amoh mboh, ma a rya mata a wa ni johjoh, tasa na agohsoh anyimbehreh. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Maka a leh ariri Nnoh tasa za kyangwri ma a nza lisa alindeh amoh. Ada neh ka a leh a mishi mboh amboh nza ma a nati anvara reh na tutu.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Abitrusu A nga Wuwana Ma Kyangwri Agugrutu Hwana Anyi ata ka Kwere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Ibi-anyi Abitrusu mboh ma Ayohana ma buti na ida Nnoh na ameh a kwere Nnoh, ni nnoh atatoh ata mgba nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Kyangwri anyi ma a gu ŋoh a na anida ida Nnoh ata maka a fi la anida alindeh, kyangwri reh a bu na grugutu hwana anyi avoh nza ma a mara ŋoh, maka a gu ŋoh a na ni bibi la ta ka a kwere na amboh nza ma a na ida Nnoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />nza ka a nza Abitrusu mboh ma Ayohana atsi niye na ida Nnoh reh, a ka kwere mboh hungroh. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Abitrusu mboh ma Ayohana reh maka a nza ŋoh ka na kyokyohroh, Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza reh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Kohnoh a ŋoh ka a na na amoh nambri, a ka a gu la ŋoh wa a nati a hunji andromboh na amoh.<verse eid="ACT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Abitrusu neh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bu na kpakpa hungroh ata ahungwri kpeh, andromboh ata meh bu na wohroh meh nati nga nnoh. Nimeh isa Yeso Kristi ata Nazaret, hinga ti hende.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Abitrusu ka a de ivoh rya a kpa a ŋoh, ta ka a de ŋoh a ka ma inza, ma a huru heri ambasa hwana tasa chuhu mgba a ŋoh mboh maka a wuwana a ba. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Ka a tsyumuna ni hwana a ŋoh ta ka a jiji a hehndeh. A ka a wa mboh aniye a na nimeh ida Nnoh reh, tasa za ka ariri Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Kyangwri mboh nambri nza maka a nza ŋoh atsi hende riri Nnoh reh, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />maka a nza ŋoh a wina la a bu kyangwri ata nza ka a tuma a kwere ma anida ida Nnoh nza maka a fi la anida alindeh reh, maka a ŋara aniye nambri ma amoh na andromboh ata nza a hunji ŋoh reh.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa Abitrusu ma Anida Sulemanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Kyangwri agugrutu hwana nza a hunji wuwana a ŋoh reh ka a de Abitrusu tasa Ayohana, kyangwri mboh gaga maka a leh a ŋara aniye tasa za maka a ba na amoh ma kpakpranda ata maka a fi la anida Solomon reh. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Abitrusu nza ka a nza dehreh, ka a bleh mboh la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri Israila mboh, ni kǝ leh ŋara nnoh aniye tsifa umbo? Ni kǝ leh nza turoh tsifa umbo, ha neh ni nza noh la a bu wuwana ambohroh tasa lisa alindeh ambohroh ŋa nza meh bleh kyangwri ta a hehndeh reh? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Nnoh ata Ibrahim, tasa ata Ishaku, tasa ata Yakubu, tasa Nnoh ata Ada ambohroh mboh, nza nga agba ma ahwra ŋoh Yeso. Ni gu noh Yeso reh nga mboh noh la tama a mla ŋoh a kwo, tasa za ni gyuru leke nnoh Yeso reh ma tohmoh Bilatus, ŋoh Bilatus reh tana a bleh la tama ata ŋoh avoh ta a na ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Mohnoh ni leke nnoh zanana ata nza a bu yehlehleh ti gyuru bleh noh la ma a gu kyangwri ata ka a mla kyangwri mboh a kwo nga nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Ni mla nnoh akyo ata nza bu chuhu fene reh ta nnoh avoh, Nnoh neh ka a gyuru ka a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo, mbohroh za meh nza areh na iyo ambohroh. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />A bu nimeh wuwana isa Yeso, kyangwri ata nza ni nza noh ti wina noh nza a hunji wuwana reh. A bu sa Yeso tasa nga agohsoh ata nza a ba ma aki ŋoh nza nga ŋoh wuwana reh nambri. Ma a lisa amboh areh ma iyo amohnoh nambri.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />nehnehreh, ambohroh mboh, meh wina la ni lisa noh ata areh nimeh kpakpana, tswanza agbugba amohnoh mboh tama a lisa reh. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />A bu ma aki ata areh tsifa Nnoh reh ta a su ma aniye amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh reh, la kristi a nati a wa iya. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Nza bu dehreh, ti ta nnoh aki agugu amohnoh reh, ti gyuruna ba nnoh ni Nnoh, la tama a te kohhroh ni kpakpana amohnoh mboh, Nnoh ni ikpi a ŋoh a nati a hwara nnoh agohsoh amohnoh mboh, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />ameh ata Ada a nati nga nnoh wuwana reh wa a ba, a nati a tohmoh Kristi, ata ta maka a seh ŋoh a gya nnoh na kiri reh, a ka bu ŋoh Yeso reh. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Ŋoh a nati a tuma ma inza kanga, a tswa ameh ata ma a nati a de awumu mboh reh nambri a te Afehfeh, tswanza Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya na kpikpi ma aniye amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh mboh nza ma a bu na zanana reh. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Musa za tana a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ada Nnoh amohnoh a nati a gu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh anyi a ba noh anyi nimeh kyangwri amohnoh mboh; a nati a tswanza mya reh, ni nati sehreh noh andromboh ata ŋoh nza a nati a bleh noh reh. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Akyo ata nza a sehreh tsifa kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh kpeh reh, ma a nati a gu ŋoh a kate anyi nimeh kyangwri a ŋoh mboh.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />&lt;&lt;Meh ti bleh noh zizi, amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh tama a nza tohmoh reh a wina, nza ka a gu anyi na Samaila tasa mgbiri amboh ata nza ma a ba ma nyina tama atsifa ma ikpi ibi amboh ata areh za. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Tsifa ata Nnoh nza bleh gyaa ma aki amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh, ma bu tsifa amohnoh, tasa za ni gafa nnoh gohmoh ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh gya na ada amohnoh mboh reh. Tswanza ta ka a bleh ma Ibrahim reh la, &lt;Nza a nati anyi ma alohsoh anzoh kyangwri mboh nambri ma inziyo areh ma a nati a hunji te atoh.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Nnoh nza ka a gu ahwra a ŋoh a kate, aka a jiji a tohmoh ŋoh a ba na amohnoh ta a ba ba te noh atoh ta a gyuru nnoh la ti ta nnoh akeki agugu amohnoh mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Abitrusu Tasa Ayohana ni Tohmoh amboh Hwra Akpi Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Abitrusu tasa Ayohana mboh nza maka buti tsifa ni duma mboh reh, firist mboh tasa agbugba amboh sumu ida Nnoh reh tasa Sadukiyawa mboh za maka a ba na a ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Maka a nyiri la amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ma a leh a tsana ma duma mboh la amboh ata nza ma a kwo reh, ma a nati a gyuru a hinga ni fene tswanza ŋoh Yeso za nza a gyuru a hinga reh. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Maka a de Abitrusu tasa Ayohana, maka a ka mboh ma ida ka la nerebi ta a yanda feh, la nvishi kǝ ba. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Mgbiri vara kyangwri mboh nza ma a sehreh tsifa reh neh maka a sa tsifa reh a kira, kyangwri mboh nza ma a leh a ba gaga reh ma bu dubu atungu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Ibi nza ka a yanda reh agohgohmoh mboh, tasa agbugba mboh, tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh maka a dohsohna ma Urushalima. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Hannana, ŋoh nza bu Agba Firist, a yama mboh ma Kayafa, tasa Ayohana, tasa Alekzanda, tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu alohsoh firist agba reh. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Maka a de Abitrusu tasa Ayohana ka ba ma tohmoh amoh, maka a leh a luhu mboh tsifa mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;A bu anyi a nga noh wuwana ha a ka a bu nimeh isa anyi ni leh lisa nnoh ata areh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Abitrusu feh, kǝ bu na huru zanana reh gaga, a ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Agohgohmoh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Nza ni leh luhu turoh andrehmeh reh ma ikpi ndohmoh alindeh ata mbohroh mi te ma kyangwri agugrutu hwana reh, tasa za ni kǝ luhu nnoh la a hunji wuwana a ŋoh reh lele? <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />mohnoh ti wina noh ata areh, tasa kyangwri Israila mboh: A bu nimeh sa Yeso ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh ata Nazaret, ata ni kpa nnoh ma agbeh, Nnoh neh ka a gyuru a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo, a bu tsifa a ŋoh reh kyangwri nza a shi ma tohmoh amohnoh reh a hunji wuwana. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Ŋoh a bu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">&lt;&lt;kpakpa ata amboh mina nza ma a leke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ata ma a gyuru a gu a gya ma chuhu ida.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Ma a nati a hunji nvara anyi na akyo tse kpeh, isa anyi a yama ma inziyo areh ata meh nati hunji nvara kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Nza maka a nza wuwa agohsoh Abitrusu tasa Ayohana reh, ma a gu la ma a bu ni lomo kpeh, ma bu kyangwri amboh te iya ma, maka ŋara aniye tasa za maka a nza mboh a wina la tama bu mboh ma Yeso mboh. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Agbugba mboh nza maka a nza kyangwri bishi nza a hunji wuwana atsi shi na amoh reh, ma a za a wina a bleh andromboh za kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Agbugba mboh reh maka a bleh la ma a fira mboh a kate anyi ma atsi hwra akpi reh, maka a leh atsifa ma itoh amoh. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Maka luhu la,&lt;&lt;Bu mboh meh nati lisa ni kyangwri amboh areh?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;amboh ata nza ma a yama ni Urushalima ma a wina la ma a lisa awumu nga nyiri, mbohroh meh nati wina tana areh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Mbohroh meh nati za kira mgbiri kyangwri tama a sehreh tsifa areh za kpeh, meh nati kpi ashotoh ma kyangwri amboh reh tama za atsifa na akyo anyi nimeh sa reh za kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Maka a gyuru a fi mboh maka akpi mboh ashotoh la tama za atsifa nimeh sa Yeso reh za kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Abitrusu mboh ma Ayohana neh maka a sa mboh aniye la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh nza noh na ikpi amohnoh ti hwra noh akpi reh ha a zohhoh ma tohmoh Nnoh timi sehreh tsifa amohnoh ha timi sehreh tsifa Nnoh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Mbohroh neh, meh nati wina bu gbalala ni ikpi andromboh ata mbohroh mi nza, tasa ata mi sehreh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Maka a gyuru akpi mboh ashotoh feh ma sa ka ata mboh avoh. Ma fa akeki ata ma a nati a nga mboh iya reh, la duma ma a leh ariri Nnoh ni ikpi andromboh ata ma a lisa reh. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Kyangwri ata nza ma a lisa ŋoh ta a hunji wuwana reh, a bu na ahushi agrumavoh ida anneh.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">amboh Tufa Mboh ma A kwere Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Nza maka ata mboh avoh reh, Abitrusu mboh ma Ayohana maka a gyuru a na amoh ni kyangwri amoh mboh, maka a bleh mboh andromboh ata Agba Firist tasa agbugba mboh nza ma a bleh mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a vuru agba mama nambri ma amoh atsi leh kwere Nnoh. Maka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Ada Mbohroh&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ata nza a lisa inziyo areh nambri tasa fini mboh, tasa mgbiri awumu mboh nza ma a yama ma inziyo reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Ni huru zanana ti ni tsifa na ahwra anzoh, Ada Mbohroh Dawuda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">&lt;A bu mboh a te feh amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh ma a te gofo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Kyangwri ma a leh a kohnoh awumu wusu ma agohsoh amoh umbo?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Agohgohmoh ata inziyo mboh ma a shi a bana tefe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">tasa agbugba amoh mboh ma a nati a dohsoh ikpi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">mata a fi Nnoh ma tohmoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">tasa ŋoh ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />meh ti bleh noh zizi, Hirudus tasa Buntus Bilatus ma a dohsoh ikpi amoh mboh na akpo afiya reh, mboh ma amboh ata ma a wina Nnoh kpeh tasa kyangwri Israila mboh ma a dohsoh aniye ni ikpi ahwra zanana anzoh Yeso, ata nnoh nza ni seh ŋoh gya ta a sa reh a hwana. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ma a dohsohna tama a lisa andromboh ata nza ni bleh la a nati a bu dehreh reh, ni wuwana anzoh tasa ni kira anzoh. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Nehnehreh za, Nnoh, nnoh ni nza nza ma a kira tama a ha reh ndohmoh reh. Nnoh ti nga ahwra anzoh mboh wuwa agohsoh tama a bleh tsifa anzoh tama kama a nyiri kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Ti gu ivoh anzoh ka ti nga mboh wuwana nyi ma bishi, tasa za ti lisa awumu nga nyiri nimeh sa ahwra zanana anzoh Yeso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Nza maka a kwere Nnoh reh ka a treh, atsi ata nza ma a dohsohna reh ka a zuzuna. Nambri ma amoh maka a hunu ni huru zanana Nnoh reh feh ma sa ka a bleh tsifa Nnoh reh ni wuwa agohsoh.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">amboh Tufa Mboh ma A gafa Awumu Amoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Amboh tufa mboh reh nambri ma amoh nza ma sa tsifa a kira reh, ma bu na kohnoh anyimbehreh tasa agohsoh anyimbehreh. Akyo nimeh amoh a nati a wina gu la awumu a ŋoh a bu a ŋoh kpeh, maka a gafa awumu nza ma a bu na wohroh reh nambri ma amoh. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Ni wuwana agba ata amboh ble tsifa nana nza ma a bu na wohroh reh, tama ka a seh mboh reh maka a leh atsifa ma ikpi hinga Ada Yeso anyi ma kwo, tasa za Nnoh ka a teh mboh atoh gaga nambri ma amoh. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Akyo a sohroh a chi andromboh nimeh amoh kpeh. Amboh nza ma a bu na ayeye mboh tasa afiyafiya mboh maka a fira mboh ka a rifa a de hungroh ŋoh a ba, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />maka a gya hungroh reh na amboh sa tohmoh nana tufa Yeso tama ka a seh mboh reh, maka a leh a gafa ma amboh ata nza ma a bu na wohroh kpeh reh.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Yusuf, anyi alohsoh Alawi, ŋoh bu kyangwri Sayifurus, ata amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso reh maka a fi ŋoh la Barnaba (la &lt;&lt;Amehreh wuwa agohsoh&gt;&gt;), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />ŋoh za ka a rifa na aye ŋoh a ka a de hungroh a ŋoh reh a ba ma tomo amboh sa tohmoh nana ama ka a seh mboh reh.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Hananiya tasa Safiratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Kyangwri anyi a yama isa a ŋoh a bu Hananiya, mboh ma afya ŋoh Safiratu, a rifa na andromboh ata nza a bu na wohroh. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />A ka a huho mgbiri hungroh reh ni kira afya ŋoh, ka a de ashidi ma a ba na amboh ble tsifa nana mboh reh.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh Hananiya, a bu lele feh agugu a su nnoh ma agohsoh neh ni kǝ huru tsifa Ma huru zanana Nnoh, nnoh ni gyuru huho mgbiri hungroh inzi nnoh nza ni rifa reh ma ikpi anzoh? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Aye reh tana a bu anzoh feh si rifa kpeh? Tasa za nnoh nza ni rifa tre reh, hungroh reh a bu na anzoh kpeh? A bu lele feh ni kohnoh kira ti lisa andromboh ika ata areh nimeh agohsoh anzoh? Ni sohroh huru tsifa ma kyangwri kpeh nnoh neh ni huru tsifa ma Nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Hananiya nza ka a sehreh tsifa reh. a ka a hwa a kwo.Nyiri ka a de amboh ata nza ma a sehreh andromboh ata nza a hunji Hananiya reh. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Mara kafa mboh maka a ba ba a gu ŋoh a kakama ma hwashi kuri, maka a gu ŋoh a na na anyifo.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />A yanda kpeh, a tswa atsi bu noh atatoh neh afya a ŋoh ka a ba, a kama a wina andromboh ata nza ahushi atsifa reh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Abitrusu ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Bleh meh, ata areh a bu guma hungroh ata nnoh tasa Hananiya ni rifa nnoh inzi reh?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">A ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ha&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ata areh a bu guma hungroh reh&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni lisa nnoh lele feh ni kira ti sara huru Nnoh nza noh? Nza! amboh ata nza ma anyi atsi gu atsifa anzoh nyifo ma a bu ma anida, Ma a nati a gu nnoh a kate ika wohroh za.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Na a huru heri ka a hwa kwo na hohroh hwana a ŋoh. Mara kafa mboh nza maka a ba reh, maka a hunji ŋoh kǝ kwo, maka a gu ŋoh a na na anyifo ma inda atsifa reh. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Nyiri agba ka a de amboh ata maka a na ida Nnoh reh tasa mgbiri amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa reh.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">amboh Kpehkpehteh nza ma a seh mboh reh ma A nga Kyangwri mboh gaga Wuwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Amboh ble tsifa nana nza ma a seh mboh reh ma a lisa awumu nga nyiri tasa ata ŋara aniye nimeh kyangwri mboh. Amboh tufa mboh reh nambri maka a ba ba a kwere Nnoh nimeh dasa Solomon reh. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Akyo a kama a na ma nda amoh mbimbi kpeh, kyangwri mboh neh ma nga mboh agba gaga. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Nza bu dehreh reh ma, ifiya tasa tsifa mboh amboh nza ma a kira ni Nnoh reh maka a leh a bu gaga. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Nza ma a nza dehreh, kyangwri maka a leh a fira amboh bishi mboh a ba ba a were na atakpa ni kpi aki la ha lulu Abitrusu nza a nati a gǝga reh neh ta ka a bara mgbiri amoh mboh. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Vara kyangwri mboh reh maka a leh a ba anyi akpokpo afiyafiya ata nza ma a goh Urushalima reh, maka a leh atsi fira amboh bishi mboh tasa amboh ata huru agugu nza a leh a nga mboh iya reh, nambri ma amoh maka a hunji wuwana.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">amboh Kpehkpehteh nza ma a seh mboh reh ma A wa Iya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Agba firist reh neh ka a hinga mboh ma amboh ata ma bu mboh ma amoh, mboh reh neh ma a tufa Sadukiyawa mboh, ma a te vene na amboh tufa Yeso reh. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Maka a de amboh sa tsifa nana a ble ata Yeso reh a ka ma ida ka. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh Ada anyi ni shini ka a vuru mboh anida ida ka mboh reh ta ka a fira mboh a kate. <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />Ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Na nnoh, ti na ni shi nnoh nimeh ida Nnoh reh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ti bleh noh ma kyangwri mboh tsifa mboh reh nambri ata fene afeh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Ibi nza ka a yanda neh maka aniye nimeh ida Nnoh reh, a tswanza tama ka a bleh mboh reh, maka a leh a tsana kyangwri mboh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Agba firist mboh ma amboh ata ma bu mboh ma amoh reh maka a ba, maka a fi tuma mboh ma amboh hwra akpi tasa agbugba Israila mboh, maka a tohmoh a na ma ida ka reh la mata a fira amboh sa tohmoh nana reh a ba mboh. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Mboh neh nza maka a na ma atsi ka reh, agba amoh reh a sohroh a nza mboh na a huru kpeh. Maka a gyuru a na na a bleh mboh, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Mbohroh mi nza ida ka kyangwri mboh reh a shi ni ika ma, amboh sumu mboh reh ma a shi ma anida mboh reh; Mbohroh neh nzimi vuru anida mboh reh, mi sohroh nza akyo nimeh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Agba amboh sumu ida Nnoh reh tasa Agba Firist mboh nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a nyiri, maka a leh a kohnoh la mboh ma a wina andromboh ata areh kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Akyo anyi ka a gbo a ba ba a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza nnoh! Kyangwri amboh ata nza ni ka mboh nnoh nimeh ida ka reh ma a buti shi nimeh ida Nnoh atsi leh tsana kyangwri mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Nza maka a nza dehreh, agba amboh sumu mboh reh maka a na na a gyuru a wa amboh ata nza ma a ka mboh reh a ba, ma a za a bleh mboh ni wuwana za kpeh, ma a nyiri la kyangwri mboh tama ada mboh ni kpakpa.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Nza maka a de amboh sa tohmoh nana reh a ba mboh, maka a bleh mboh la ma a shi ma tohmoh amboh hwra akpi mboh reh, la Agba Firist reh ta a luhu mboh tsifa, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh kpi nnoh ashotoh na wuwana la ti za tsana noh nimeh isa ata areh za kpeh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Nza ka bu akpi amohnoh reh ma kǝ tre Urushalima na agba ma, tasa za ni buti fa nnoh akeki la mbohroh meh ti fira vari imya Kyangwri ata reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Abitrusu tasa mgbiri amboh ble tsifa nana mboh reh maka kira la: &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh nati tufa tsifa ata Nnoh nza a ble reh, timi leke tsifa ata kyangwri nza ma a ble! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Nnoh ata ada ambohroh mboh a yiri Yeso anyi ma kwo, ata mohnoh ti kǝ mla nnoh kwo ma atsi koro ma agbeh. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />A bu Nnoh nza a gu ŋoh a gya na ivoh rya a kpa a ŋoh la ŋoh ta bu agba tasa akyo ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana, la mata a nga aki ma kyangwri Israila mboh mata gyuruna ata aki agugu amoh, tasa za mata te kohhroh na kpakpana amoh. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />mbohroh meh nza awumu amboh areh na iyo ambohroh, tasa huru zanana ata Nnoh nza nga ma amboh ata ma a kira tsifa a ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Agbugba mboh nza maka a sehreh dehreh reh, maka a te gofo tasa za ma a kira la mata a mla mboh a kwo ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Kyangwri Farisiye anyi, isa a ŋoh a bu Gamaliyel, ŋoh a bu kyangwri tsana amgbasho Musa, Kyangwri nambri maka a nga ŋoh agba, a ka a de a hinga a shi ma atsi hwra akpi reh ka atsifa la tama a hehreh a fira kyangwri mboh reh a na ma inziyo shidi. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Ŋoh ka a bleh ma amboh hwra akpi reh la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri Israila mboh, lisa nza noh ve andromboh ata nza ni kira nnoh ti lisa nnoh ma kyangwri amboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Ahushi amboh gǝga, kyangwri anyi tana a yama sa a ŋoh a bu Tudas, a ka a gu ikpi a ŋoh la ŋoh wa a bu andromboh, kyangwri deri aniye ma a goh ŋoh. Maka a mla ŋoh a kwo, maka a katsi amboh ata maka a bu mboh ma amoh reh, ata areh a ka bu trina a ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Ata areh nza ka a trina, na ameh ata ta maka a leh a ble kyangwri mboh reh a nza reh, kyangwri Galili anyi a yama sa a ŋoh a bu Yahuda, kyangwri gaga za tama a tufa ŋoh, ŋoh za ma a mla ŋoh a kwo, amboh ata ma a bu mboh ma amoh reh maka a te atsetse. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Nehnehreh, meh bleh noh, ni ikpi tsifa kyangwri amboh areh ta mboh nnoh mboh tsimoh! tama a na amoh! Nza andromboh ata mboh nza ma a lisa ha kohnoh amoh reh anyi ni kyangwri, a nati a druhuna, <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />nza ndohmoh amoh reh anyi na Nnoh zizi neh, ni nati wina mla nnoh kyangwri amboh areh keh kpeh; mohnoh ni nati leh mlana nnoh ni Nnoh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Maka a tufa tsifa a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Tsifa a ŋoh reh maka a sa a kira. Maka a fi amboh sa tohmoh nana mboh reh a kate neh maka a mla mboh. Maka a hwa mboh la tama za a tsana kyangwri mboh nimeh isa Yeso za kpeh, maka ata mboh avoh.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Amboh sa tohmoh nana reh maka ata amboh hwra akpi mboh reh, maka a leh johjoh la mboh ma tswa tama a wa iya ma ikpi isa Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Ni tutu, ha nimeh ida Nnoh, ha na afiyafiya, ma a sohroh ta tsana ma kyangwri mboh tasa bleh tsifa nana la Yeso a bu kristi reh kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Ma A seh amboh Ndohmoh Mboh Atehrehkifi Na Anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Na ameh wohroh reh, amboh tufa te ndohmoh atsi gafa irya Yeso reh maka a leh a ba gaga, Yahudawa mboh amboh sehreh Helenanci, maka a leh atsifa alulu ma ikpi Ibraniyawa mboh la maka a sohroh a nza ifiya mboh amboh ata tsitsifa amoh mboh maa a kwo reh, ala ma asohroh a nza mboh a wina ma atsi gafa irya na tutu reh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh maka a fi amboh tufa Yeso reh nambri neh maka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A nati a zohhoh mbohroh timi ta ndohmoh Nnoh, timi gyuru niye na ma atsi gafa irya kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Nza a bu dehreh reh, ambohroh mboh, seh nnoh nimeh amohnoh kyangwri atehrehkifi na anyi amboh ata ma bu na huru tasa lomo. Mbohroh meh nati ta mboh mata a te reh ndohmoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Mbohroh neh meh ti hunji aki ata meh nati leh kwere Nnoh tasa za meh ti leh tsana tsifa Nnoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Duma mboh maka a sa tsifa amoh reh a kira nambri ma amoh. Maka a seh Istifanus, kyangwri reh a bu na nga agohsoh tasa ni huru zanana; tasa Filibus, tasa Burokoras, tasa Nikanar, tasa Timan, tasa Barminas, tasa Nikolas kyangwri Antakiya ŋoh reh tana a gyuruna a tufa Yahudawa mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Maka a fira kyangwri mboh reh a ba na amboh sa tohmoh nana reh, maka a fira ivoh a ka mboh ni inza a kwere mboh Nnoh.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Tsifa Nnoh neh ka a treh atsifi. amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh ma Urushalima maka a leh a bu gaga, tasa vara firist mboh za maka a leh a kira ni tsifa amoh reh.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A de Istifanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />nehnehreh Nnoh a te atoh ma Istifanus, tasa za ka nga ŋoh wuwana, ata lisa awumu agbugba ata nga nyiri tasa kpra ata ŋara aniye nimeh kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ibi anyi mgbiri kyangwri mboh ma anyi ida Nnoh, ata maka a fi la ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh ata tavoh ahwra mboh reh maka a ba ba a leh Hwa aniye na Istifanus, kyangwri amboh areh ma bu Yahudawa mboh nza ma anyi Sayirin tasa Alekzandiriya, tasa amboh ta nza ma anyi kilikiya, ata Asiya. Kyangwri amboh areh maka a leh a rifa a na na na Istifanus, <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />mboh neh ma a wina a shi ni lomo ha ni huru ata ŋoh nza atsifa reh kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Maka a leh ata kyangwri mboh na aniye na ayuhu la tama a bleh la,&lt;&lt;mbohroh meh sehreh Istifanus atsi leh kya Musa nza bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh tasa za a leh a bleh atsifa rina ni Nnoh.<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Kyangwri mboh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh maka a te gofo. Maka a de ŋoh ka a na ma tohmoh amboh hwra akpi mboh. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Maka a de amboh ata ma a ba atsi bleh huru tsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata areh na tutu ka a leh a bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi atsifi zanana ambohroh reh tasa ma ikpi amgbasho Musa reh. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />mbohroh meh sehreh ŋoh atsi bleh la Yeso ata Nazaret reh a nati a wina druhu atsi areh ta a gyuru a sehneh lomo ata Musa ta ka nga reh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Amboh ata nza ma a tuma na atsi hwra akpi reh nambri ma amoh maka a fira iyo mboh a ka a nza Istifanus reh, maka a nza la tohmoh ŋoh a tswanza tohmoh Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata amgba.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Tsifa Istifanus ma tomo amboh Hwra Akpi Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Agba firist reh ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Tsifa mboh nza ma a leh a bleh ma ikpi anzoh reh a bu zizi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Istifanus ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh atsi mya tasa Ada mya mboh, sehreh ma nnoh! Nnoh ata nza ma nga ŋoh agba tana a gu ikpi a ŋoh a kate a ba na Ada mbohroh Ibrahim ta ka a treh a yama ni Mesofotamiya, neh kǝ hehreh ba Haran kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Nnoh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Hinga ta akpo afya anzoh tasa kyangwri anzoh mboh,&gt; &lt;tasa za la ti na inzi ata meh nati tsana noh.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />&lt;&lt;Ŋoh ka a hinga ata inzi Kaldiyawa a na ŋoh ni tuma ma Haran. Alehmeh nza ka a kwo a treh feh, Nnoh ka a gyuru a tohmoh ŋoh a na inzi ata mboh nza ma a tuma nehnehreh. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Nnoh a sohroh a nga ŋoh inzi ata ikpi a ŋoh na a huru kpeh. Nnoh neh ka a bleh ŋoh a gya la, inzi a nati a bu ŋoh tasa mara a ŋoh mboh, na ameh wohroh neh ŋoh Ibrahim kǝ heri bu na amehreh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Nnoh neh ka atsifa na a ŋoh ma aki ata areh: &lt;Alohsoh amohnoh ma a nati a bu sehneh ma inzi ata a bu amohnoh kpeh, ma a nati a bu ahwra ma akpo afiya reh, ma a nati nga mboh iya tswa tsi bu ahushi deri anneh. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Nnoh ka a bleh la, mya neh meh nati hwra noh akpi ma kyangwri amboh ata nza ni nati krumusu mboh noh reh, atre fe alohsoh Ibrahim ma a nati a kate a ba mata a krumusu Nnoh ma a huru. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Neh ŋoh ka a nga Ibrahim tsifa bleh gya ata shimba kpanda. Ibrahim ka mara Ishaku maka a shimba ŋoh kpanda neh kǝ bu ibi atsiyatsiya ni mara. Ishaku ka a mara Yakubu, Yakubu neh ka a mara ada mbohroh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Ada mbohroh mboh reh neh, ma a bu na vene ni Yusufu, tama a rifa ŋoh a na akpo afiya Masar ta bu ahwra. Nnoh neh ka a bu na a ŋoh, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />maka a gu ŋoh a kate anyi ma iya ata ŋoh nza a leh a wa reh. A ka nga lomo tasa za ka lisa alindeh ma Yusuf, tasa za Firauna Agohmoh Masar ka a kira na a ŋoh; a ka a gu ŋoh a gya Agohmoh Masar tasa kyangwri a ŋoh mboh nambri.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />&lt;&lt;Inyo anyi ka a kate ma akpo afiya Masar tasa Kaana, iya agba ka a de mboh, ada mbohroh mboh tama a hunji rya kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Yakubu nza ka a sehreh la rya a yama ni Masar, a ka a tohmoh ada ambohroh mboh la mata a jiji a na. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Na amoh na afri neh Yusufu ka a bleh ma atsini mboh akyo ata ŋoh nza a bu. Firauna neh ka a wina atsi ata atsini mboh ma anyi reh. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Areh a treh neh Yusufu ka a tohmoh a na la mata a wa alehmeh a ba ŋoh tasa atsini mboh, nambri ma amoh ma bu kyangwri agrumavoh ida atehrehkifi na anyi a hwa atungu. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Yakubu ka a na ŋoh akpo afiya Masar. A ka a na na a kwo na a huru mboh ma ada ambohroh mboh. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Maka a gyuru a fira kohmoh amoh mboh a na Shekem, maka a na na a were mboh nimeh ikpi nyifo ata Ibrahim ta ka a sa na hungroh gaga anyi na mara Hamor mboh ma Shekem.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Ameh ata tsifa Nnoh nza a bleh a gya ma Ibrahim reh kǝ ba nda, kyangwri ambohroh mboh nza ma a bu ma masar reh maka a mara a su tasa za maka bu gaga. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Agohmoh afeh anyi ka a kate ma Masar, a wina andromboh la Yusufu tana bu Agohmoh ni Masar kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Agohmoh afeh reh nga iya ma kyangwri tasa ada ambohroh mboh veve kpeh, mata za a de mboh ni wuwana la ma a fira amehreh akǝkehreh atisha a gya mboh ma inziyo, la tama a kwo.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />A bu na ameh wohroh tama ka a mara Musa reh, amehreh reh a zohhoh nza alindeh, a gu nara atatoh nza ma a leh nga ŋoh behneh na ayuhu ma afiya alehmeh. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Nza maka a gu ŋoh a kate ma inziyo, anyifa Firauna ka a na na a gu ŋoh, a ka afyoh ŋoh tswanza a bu amehreh a ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Ŋoh Musa ka a hunji tsana lomo ata kyangwri Masarawa mboh reh, tasa za a ka a wina shi tsifa a wuwana ta ka a lisa awumu mboh.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />&lt;&lt;Musa nza ka bu na ahushi agrumavoh da aniye, a ka a kohnoh ma agohsoh a ŋoh la ŋoh ta a na na a nza amoh mboh kyangwri Israila mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />A ka a nza kyangwri Masar anyi atsi leh nga atohngoh iya, a ka a na na a sa ŋoh aniye, a ka a mla ŋoh a kwo. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Musa reh a gu la, kyangwri a ŋoh mboh reh ma a nati a wina la Nnoh a nati a te ndohmoh na a ŋoh ta a sa mboh a hwana, mboh neh ma a wina kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ibi na afri za, Musa ka a gyuru a nza Israilawa amboh afri anyi atsi leh gohroh, a ka a na la ŋoh ta a na na a suhru mboh a de tuma alindeh a bleh mboh, ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;Kyangwri mboh, ni bu noh anyimbehreh; ni kǝ leh gohroh nnoh tsifa umbo?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata nza a leh nga atohngoh iya reh ka a wa Musa reh a na ni nda neh ta ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;Anyi a gya nnoh Agohmoh tasa kyangwri hwra akpi ma kpi ambohroh? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ni kira ti mla meh kwo ika ata nnoh nza ni mla kyangwri Masar anyi kwo ni mole reh?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Musa nza ka a sehreh dehreh reh neh, a ka gbo a na ŋoh inzi Midiyan, a ka a na na a tuma tswanza sehneh ma a huru ta ka a mara amehreh afri.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />&lt;&lt;Ahushi agrumavoh ida aniye nza ka a gǝga, Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi ka a kate ma Musa nimeh arimi shira, atsi leh fya ameh agbeh ma akpo bini anyi nza a bu ma nda agbohgboh Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musa nza ka a nza dehreh, a ka a ŋara aniye na andromboh ata ŋoh nza a nza reh, a ka a kpusu ka a na ma nda la ŋoh ta a lisa a nza, a ka a sehreh agba Nnoh atsi tsifa la: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />&lt;mya meh bu Nnoh Ada amohnoh mboh, Nnoh Ibrahim, tasa Nnoh Ishaku, tasa Nnoh Yakubu.&gt; Itoh Musa ka a nyiri a za a wina nza a na za kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />&lt;&lt;Ada ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Fufa akpehtreh hwana anzoh; atsifi ata nnoh nza ni shi reh a bu inzi zanana. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Mya meh nza iya ata kyangwri amya mboh nza ma a leh a wa ma Masar reh. Mya meh sehreh goh amoh tasa za meh ba meh ti sa mboh hwana .Ba nehnehreh, meh nati gyuru tohmoh nnoh ti na Masar.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />A bu ŋoh Musa wohroh tama ka a leke ŋoh tama a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Anyi a gya nnoh Agohmoh tasa kyangwri hwra akpi ma kpi ambohroh?&gt; A bu Nnoh na kpi a ŋoh tana tohmoh ŋoh la ta a bu mboh Agohmoh amoh tasa akyo ata nza a nati a sa mboh a hwana, a bu Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata amgba ta ka a kate ŋoh na hohroh bini reh. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />A bu ŋoh Musa reh ta ka a fira mboh a kate anyi Masar tasa tana a lisa awumu ŋara aniye tasa awumu nga nyiri ma akpo afiya Masar, tasa fini agba atisha, tasa ahushi agrumavoh ida anneh ma hohroh bini.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />&lt;&lt;A bu ŋoh Musa wohroh ta ka a bleh ma Israila mboh la, &lt;Nnoh a nati a tohmoh kyangwri sa tohmoh a ŋoh a ba na amohnoh tswanza ŋoh nza a tohmoh meh reh. A nati anyi nimeh kyangwri anzoh mboh a ba.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ŋoh tana a bu mboh ma kyangwri Israila mboh ma inzi a tuhwara, tasa za tana a bu mboh ma Ada ambohroh mboh tasa Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata ta ka atsifa na a ŋoh ma agbohgboh Sinai reh, a bu ŋoh ta ka a sa tsifa Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene a de a ba reh.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Ada ambohroh mboh neh tama a sa tsifa a ŋoh reh a leke, mboh neh ma a leke ŋoh na agohsoh amoh maka a leh a kohnoh la mata a gyuru a na amoh Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Maka a bleh ma Haruna la, &lt;Lisa reh nnoh anyi ata nza a nati a hwa reh ma tohmwo. Musa ata nza a nati a wa reh a kate anyi ma inzi Masar reh, mbohroh meh wina andromboh ata nza a hunji ŋoh kpeh!&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />A bu ameh wohroh reh tama ka a lisa nnoh a tswanza ameh londo. Maka a de awumu ngǝnga ata nana agohsoh ka a ba ma nnoh akǝkehreh reh tasa za maka a leh a johjoh na andromboh ata ivoh amoh mboh nza ma a lisa reh. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Nnoh neh ka a gyuru mboh nyina, a ka a fira mboh a gya na ma atsi leh krumusu nara tasa akpukpa mboh ma inza. ata areh a tswanza andromboh ata tama ka a ŋa a gya nimeh amgbasho amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">&lt;Mohnoh ni de noh awumu nana agohsoh tasa ngǝnga ba meh noh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ahushi agrumavoh da aniye ma hohroh bini, mohnoh kyangwri Israila umbo?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Mohnoh ni gu nnoh dasa ata nnoh akǝkehreh kyangwri Molek mboh leh hende noh na wohroh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">tasa akpukpa nnoh anzoh Refan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">nnoh ata nza ni lisa mboh nnoh la ti krumusu nnoh reh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Nza a bu dehreh meh nati tohmoh nnoh na afya iya nza bu mi tohmoh ni Babila reh.<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />&lt;&lt;Ada ambohroh mboh ni kiri tama ka la dasa ata ta ka a tsana la Nnoh a bu na amoh ma kpra Agohmoh a tuhwara. Tama a lisa tswanza Nnoh ta ka a tsana Musa, la ta a lisa ikata ŋoh nza a tsana ŋoh reh yehlehleh. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />A bu dasa ata ada ambohroh mboh tama ka a bu na wohroh reh, nza ma a gu a de ba akpo inzi ata areh ameh ata Yoshuwa ta ka a treh a de mboh reh. A bu ameh wohroh tama ka sa akpo atsifi reh ta bu amoh reh, ata Nnoh ta ka a katsi amboh ata tama ka a jiji a bu ma a huru reh. Dasa reh ka a bu na amoh a gu ka a ba ameh ata Dawuda ta ka a de Agohmoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Dawuda neh ka lisa alindeh ma tomo Nnoh, a ka luhu Nnoh la ta a kira ŋoh ta a mina atsi tuma ma Nnoh ata Yakubu. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Tana a bu solomon ŋa ta ka a mina ŋoh ida reh. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Nza bu dehreh reh ma, ŋoh Nnoh ata mbohroh mi nga ŋoh agba a nati a wina tuma nimeh afiya ata kyangwri nza a mina kpeh. A tswanza kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh ta ka a bleh reh la,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />&lt;Inza a bu kpra Agohmoh amya, Ada reh a bleh dehreh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">inziyo neh a bu kpra gya hwana amya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">A bu afiya ika atamaa ni nati mina meh noh?</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="ACT 7:49">A bu Nnoh ka a bleh dehreh.<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />A bu mya ŋa mi lisa awumu mboh reh nambri kpeh?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Istifanus ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh kyangwri amboh wuwa ikpi, tasa mohnoh amboh ata agohsoh amohnoh mboh nza a zohhoh kpeh, ni sehreh noh tsifa Nnoh kpeh, ni leke ti tufa nnoh huru zanana reh ni tutu, a tswanza Ada amohnoh mboh tama ka a lisa reh, mohnoh za ni lisa noh ika wohroh. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Nimeh amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh reh, ha amboh ata ada amohnoh mboh tama ka nga mboh iya reh ma a yama kpeh? Ma a mla amboh ata nza ma a bleh tsifa ma ikpi kyangwri tufa yehlehleh reh, mohnoh ni gu nnoh rifa, ti gyuru mla nnoh kwo. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />mohnoh tini sa nnoh akpi nyi nnoh na amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh, mohnoh neh ni sohroh tufa nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A dadafa Istifanus ni Kpakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Nza maka a sehreh dehreh reh, maka a te gofo tasa za maka a rya anyini na a ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Istifanus neh, ka a bu na Huru zanana, nza ka a nza inza a ka neh a ka a nza zohhoh Nnoh, tasa Yeso za a shi ni mgba ivoh rya a kpa Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Istifanus ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mi nza inza a vuruna tasa amehreh kyangwri a shi ni mgba ivoh rya a kpa Nnoh<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Nza maka a sehreh dehreh reh maka a hama ashotoh amoh mboh tasa maka a sesenge a kpa ashotoh amoh mboh, maka a ka ŋoh ma a hwana anyimbehreh. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Maka a de ŋoh a na mgba inziyo, maka a leh a dadafa ŋoh na kpakpa. amboh nza ma a bleh ma ikpi a ŋoh reh maka a fufa akuri amoh mboh a gya na kafa amehreh anyi isa a ŋoh nza bu Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Nza ma a leh a dadafa ŋoh reh, Istifanus ka a kwere Nnoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada Yeso, sa huru amya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />A ka a hwa a leh na agboro ta ka a kpanga la, &lt;&lt;Ada, kama gu kpakpana amoh ma ikpi amoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; nza ka a bleh tsifa areh a treh neh a ka a hwa a leh mla.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Tasa Shawulu tana a yama ma a huru, nga agohsoh la ma a mla ŋoh a kwo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Shawulu nga ma amboh tufa Yeso mboh iya maka a gbo a te atsetse</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Ibi wohroh maka nga iya agba ma amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh ma urushalima, maka a gbo a treh atsifi Samariya tasa Yahudiya, a ka a hwa amboh sa tohmoh nana reh ma a huru. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />amboh nyiri Nnoh amboh anyi ma anyifo Istifanus, maka a tuma kunu ma ikpi kwo a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Shawulu neh ka buti nga ma amboh tufa mboh iya gaga, ka a leh aniye afiya fiya mboh, ka a leh a kpikpi tsifa mboh tasa fya mboh a were a na ida ka.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filimon Ka A leh Ahwra Tsifa Nnoh A bleh ma Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Amboh mata ka a gbo a te atsetse reh maka a leh a bleh tsifa Nnoh a treh atsifi ma akpokpo atsifi mboh nza a na. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filimon ka a tamba a na akpo afiya agba ma Samariya ta ka a hwra tsifa kristi ma a huru. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Duma mboh maka a kya ashotoh a sehreh Filimon atsi leh tsifa reh, tasa za maka a nza kpra ndohmoh agbugba ata nza leh a lisa reh. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Huru agugu mboh maka a leh ka a kate anyi ma itoh kyangwri mboh gaga, tasa amboh luhutu itoh mboh tasa amboh gbo na a gboro maka a hinga a hunji wuwana. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Amboh akpo afiya agba wohroh reh maka a johjoh gaga.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Siman Kyangwri Tsara Akagba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Kyangwri anyi, sa a ŋoh a bu Siman a ka a tsara akagba ma akpo afiya agba reh kyangwri Samariya mboh nambri maka a shi a ŋara aniye ma. Ta ka a rya itoh la ŋoh bu akyo agba, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Kyangwri mboh nambri, agba tasa akehreh, maka nga ŋoh agba, mata ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata areh a bu agba ata zizi, a bu na wuwana ata nza anyi na Nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Kyangwri mboh reh maka a leh tufa Siman tsifa la kǝ yanda atsi leh lisa mboh andromboh ata shi ŋara aniye ma na akagba a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Mboh neh nza maka nga agohsoh na tsifa nana Filibus nza a buti bleh ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh Nnoh tasa ata isa Yeso kristi reh, maka a fira mboh a wra batisma, atsifa tasa afya. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Siman ni ikpi a ŋoh nga agohsoh a ŋoh mata ka a wra ŋoh batisma. Ta ka a tufa Filibus a hehndeh a treh atsifi, nza a nza agbugba kpra mboh tasa agbugba ndohmoh mboh ata ŋara aniye.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Amboh sa tohmoh nana nza ma a yama ma urushalima nza maka a sehreh Samariya mboh ma sa tsifa Nnoh, maka a tohmoh Abitrusu tasa Ayohana a na na amoh. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Nza maka a ba, maka a kwere Nnoh la mboh mata a sa huru zanana, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />la huru zanana reh kǝ hehreh ba ma anyi amoh kpeh; ma a za ka a wra mboh batisma ma a na nimeh isa Ada Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Ma a huru Abitrusu mboh ma Ayohana maka a gya mboh ivoh itoh, maka a sa huru zanana reh.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Siman nza ka a nza la huru zanana reh ma nga ma amboh tufa mboh, ameh ata amboh sa tohmoh nana mboh nza ma gya mboh ivoh ma ikpi reh, amboh de tohmoh tsifa nana ba reh. A ka nga hungroh ma Abitrusu tasa Ayohana, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nga meh noh wuwana amohnoh reh za, mya za nza meh gya ivoh amya ma itoh ha a bu anyi ta a hunji huru zanana reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Abitrusu neh a ka a kira la: &lt;&lt;Nnoh tasa hungroh anzoh na ni kwo nnoh, ni bleh anzoh la ha maka a sa ngǝnga Nnoh na hungroh! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Fufa kohnoh anzoh kate ma andromboh reh, tsifa la agohsoh anzoh bu yehlehleh na Nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ta aki agugu agohsoh anzoh reh ta, ti kwere Ada la ta a te kohhroh na anzoh tsifa ata nza ni bu na abibi kohnoh ika ta areh ma agohsoh anzoh. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Mya meh nza la agohsoh anzoh reh a su na vene abibi, agugu kǝ de noh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Ma huru Siman ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Kwere meh noh Ada la andromboh ata nza ni bleh noh ma ikpi mya reh ta a hunji meh kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Abitrusu tasa Ayohana nza maka a bleh mboh tsifa ma ikpi Ada Yeso reh, maka ahwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh mboh, maka a gyuru a ba amoh urushalima, maka a leh atsi bleh tsifa nana reh a treh akpokpo afiyafiya Samariya mboh.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filibus mboh ma Kyangwri Itiyofiya Anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh Ada anyi ka a bleh ma Filibus la, &lt;&lt;Hinga, ti na mgba afo, tufa aki nza anyi Urushalima a na Gaza,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />A ka a hinga a na ŋoh, nza ka a bu ma aki na reh a ka a hunji kyangwri Itiyofiya anyi kǝ kpiri te agba, a de kpra agba ata Kandis, ata gya hungroh Agohmoh afya ata Itiyofiya reh. Kyangwri reh tana a ba Urushalima atsi krumusu Nnoh, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />nza ka a buti gyuru a na ŋoh afiya reh, ka tuma ma ikpi gbogblondo nyama reh, ka a leh a bleh amgbasho Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Huru Nnoh reh ka a bleh ma Filibus la, &lt;&lt;Na atsi gbogblondo nyama reh ti na ni shi ma nda a huru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filibus ka a gbo a na atsi gbogblondo nyama reh ta ka sehreh kyangwri reh ti bleh amgbasho Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh reh. Filibus ka luhu ŋoh&lt;&lt;Ni wina andromboh ata nza ni bleh reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Kyangwri agba reh ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati wina lele, akyo ta a tsana meh ŋa afeh reh?&gt;&gt; A ka kwere Filibus la ta a ka a ba ba a tuma mboh ma a ŋoh ma ikpi agbeh ka ata nyama reh.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Areh bu amgbasho ata agba Kyangwri nza a leh bleh reh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Ma akpi ŋoh a na tswanza atashi a na atsi fa reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">tasa za a tswanza ameh atashi ata nza bu gbalala ma ivoh amboh ata nza ma nati sisra ŋoh shina itoh a ŋoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">a sohroh a vuru anneh kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Ma a lisa ŋoh abibi mata a ha ŋoh bleh zizi a ŋoh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Bu anyi a nati wina bleh tsifa alohsoh a ŋoh mboh a wina?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Tama a gu fene a ŋoh anyi ma inziyo agba. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Agba kyangwri reh ka luhu Filibus la, &lt;&lt;Bleh meh, kavohshama, kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh ata areh ka atsifa ma ikpi anyi, ni ikpi a ŋoh ha akyo anyi tse?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Filibus ka a jiji a gu ka anyi akpo tsifa Nnoh ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho reh, ta ka a tsana ŋoh tsifa nana ma ikpi Yeso.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Nza maka a buti hende ma aki reh, maka a ba atsi amwo amboh anyi achoh reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza, amwo uwe. Mboh a te meh ti wra batisma kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filibus ka a kira la, nza ni nga agohsoh anzoh anyimbehreh, meh nati wra nnoh batisma. Agba kyangwri reh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nga agohsoh amya ma Yeso almasihu bu Amehreh Nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Ta ka bleh ma gbogblondo nyama reh la ta a shi. Na afri ma amoh maka a tamba a na nimeh amwo reh, Filibus ka a wra batisma ma achoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Nza maka a kate ka anyi amwo reh, huru Nnoh ka a te Filibus a gu ma hwana anyimbehreh a na ŋoh, agba kyangwri reh ka a za a nza ŋoh kpeh, a ka a na ŋoh ni johjoh. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filibus neh, ka a gyuru a kate ma Azotus ta ka a hehndeh a treh atsifi, atsi bleh tsifa nana ma akpokpo atsifi mboh nambri a gu a na aniye Kaisariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Gyuruna Shawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Shawulu ka a treh buti fo sono ma ikpi amboh tufa Yeso reh. A ka a na na Agba Firist <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />ta ka luhu ŋoh amgbasho la ŋoh ta a de a na na nga mboh nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh ma Dimashku, la nza ŋoh a hunji akyo ma atsi tufa aki ata areh reh, ha bu tsifa mboh ha ifiya mboh, ŋoh ta a de mboh a ba urushalima mata a lafa mboh. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Shawulu Nimeh hende a ŋoh, nza ka a ba nda ni Dimashku, a ka a hinga a nza zana anyi inza ka a goh ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Shawulu ka a hwa inzi ta ka a sehreh agba anyi nyi inza ti bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Shawulu, Shawulu, bu mboh a te ni leh nga meh iya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Shawulu ka luhu la, Nnoh ka? bu anyi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">A ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Meh bu Yeso, ata nza ni leh nga ŋoh iya reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />&lt;&lt;Yeso ka a bleh ma Shawulu la Hinga ti niye na akpo afiya agba reh, ma a nati bleh noh andromboh ata nza ni nati lisa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Kyangwri amboh nza a buti hende mboh ma shawulu mboh maka a shi ma akpo anyimbehreh a huru, ma a wina tsifa kpeh, ma a sehreh agba, ma a nza akyo kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Shawulu a ka a hinga anyi inzi neh, a ka a vuru iyo a ŋoh a wina nza andromboh kpeh. maka a de ŋoh ma ivoh a na Dimashku. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />A hama iyo a te ibi atatoh, a rya kpeh ha ta a wa andromboh kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Ma Dimashku reh amboh tufa mboh reh anyi a yama sa a ŋoh a bu Hananiya. Nnoh ka atsifa na a ŋoh Ma huru, &lt;&lt;Hananiya!&gt;&gt; a ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Haa, Nnoh,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Ada reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Hinga ti gu aki reh na yehlehleh ma afiya Yahuda ti luhu la, kyangwri anyi isa ŋoh bu Shawulu anyi Tarsus, a buti kwere Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Nimeh huru ka a nza kyangwri anyi sa a ŋoh a bu Hananiya aniye a ba, ka a gya ŋoh ivoh ta a gyuru a hunji a nza yama.<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Hananiya ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ada,&gt;&gt; Mya meh sehreh tsifa mboh gaga ma ikpi kyangwri ata areh tasa andromboh ata ka a lisa ma amboh tufa mboh ma urushalima reh. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Nehnehreh kǝ sa wuwana nyi na Agba Firist mboh la ta a hehndeh a de amboh nza maka a fi isa anzoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ada neh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Na! kyangwri reh a bu mya meh seh ŋoh ta a gu isa amya a na na amboh amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, tasa agohgohmoh mboh tasa Israila mboh. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Meh nati tsana ŋoh iya ata nza a nati wa nimeh isa amya kanga reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Hananiya neh a ka aniye a na afiya reh. Ta ka a gya ivoh a ŋoh ma itoh Shawulu, ta ka a fi ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Atsi mya Shawulu, Ada Yeso ata ta ka a kate nnoh ma aki ata ti kǝ buti ba ma areh reh a tohmoh meh la ti vuru iyo anzoh nza atsifi yama, tasa za huru zanana ta a hama nnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ma a huru heri, andromboh anyi tswanza ahohsoh kpwo atasaa ka a hwa a kate anyi ma iyo Shawulu, ta ka a nza atsifi yama. A ka a hinga a shi maka a wra a ŋoh batisma, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />tasa nza ka a rya a treh, a ka a hunji wuwana a ŋoh yama.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu Ma Dimashku tasa Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Shawulu ka a kpiri a tuma a te ibi afri na amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh ma Dimashku <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Hwana anyimbehreh ka a buti hwra tsifa Nnoh ma ida Nnoh la Yeso a bu Amehreh Nnoh.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Amboh nza ma a sehreh ŋoh ma ta ka luhu ŋoh maka a shi a ŋara aniye ma maka, &lt;&lt;A bu kyangwri wohroh ŋa nza ka a fi akpi ma urushalima ma amboh nza maka a fi sa Yeso reh kpeh? ta a ba ma atsi areh la ŋoh ta a de mboh a na tomo Agba Firist mboh la mata a ka mboh kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Tsifa Shawulu reh neh a lisa ka a keh wuwana, ta ka a leh ka a wa akpi ma Yahudawa mboh nza ma a yama ma Dimashku, a ka a bleh mboh gbigbi la Yeso a bu kristi.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shawulu a hwana avoh ma Yahudawa mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Ka a te ibi afri neh, Yahudawa mboh maka a dohsoh aniye la mata a mla a ŋoh a kwo. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Shawulu ka a wina dohsoh aniye amoh reh. Ni shini tasa ni Nnoh maka a leh ka la ŋoh ma akeki akpo afiya mboh reh la mboh mata a mla ŋoh a kwo. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ni mgba nvitsi neh amboh tufa ŋoh reh maka a gu ŋoh ma akwri, a gya a tamba a gǝga ni mgba nvitsi ida anyi ma kukuchunu akpo afiya agba.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shawulu Ka Gyuru A na A ŋoh Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Shawulu nza ka a ba Urushalima, ka a leh ayiyina la ŋoh ta aniye a na hohroh amboh tufa mboh reh, maka a nyiri ŋoh nambri ma amoh, ma a kira na a ŋoh kpeh la a bu kyangwri tufa Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Barnaba neh ka wa ŋoh na na amboh sa tohmoh nana reh. Ta ka bleh tsifa ata Shawulu nza Ada ma aki reh, tasa Yeso nza atsifa na ŋoh, tasa za Shawulu nza a bleh tsifa ni isa Yeso ma Dimashku reh, a nyiri kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />ka anyi na ameh wohroh Shawulu tasa amboh tufa mboh reh maka a hehndeh ma mboh a treh atsifi Urushalima, <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Ka a hehndeh a bleh tsifa Nnoh na agohsoh a ŋoh anyimbehreh nimeh sa Yeso. Ta ka a leh a kpa aniye na Yahudawa mboh amboh nza maka a sehreh arimi Helenanci, maka a leh la a ŋoh la ma a nati a mla ŋoh a kwo. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Amboh tufa mboh nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a ba ba a gu ŋoh a na Kaisariya, mata ka a tohmoh ŋoh a na Tarsus.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Amboh tufa mboh ma Yahudiya, Galili tasa Samariya nambri maka a hunji tuma alindeh, huru zanana a shingi kyangwri mboh reh maka a hunji wuwa agohsoh, kyangwri gaga maka a gyuruna a tufa mboh, maka a tuma nimeh nyiri Ada.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iniyasu tasa Dokas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Abitrusu nza ka a hehndeh a treh akpo afiya agba reh, a ka a na na amboh tufa mboh nza ma a yama ma Lida reh. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Ma huru a ka a hunji kyangwri anyi isa a ŋoh a bu Iniyasu, itoh a ŋoh a kwo, a buti leh ma ikpi atakpa, kǝ te ahushi atsiyatsiya. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Iniyasu,&gt;&gt; Yeso Kristi ta nga noh nana a ŋoh. Hinga shi ti gunu atsi leh anzoh,&gt;&gt; Ma huru heri Iniyasu ka a hinga. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a tuma ma Lida tasa ma Sharon nambri maka a nza ŋoh la kǝ hinga zohhoh, maka a gyuruna a tufa Ada.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abitrusu A yiri kohmoh Dokas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Ma Yofa Afiya ata ka a tufa Yeso anyi isa a ŋoh bu Dokas, nza maka a fi za la Dokas, a ka a shingi kyangwri amboh nza ma a bu na wohroh kpeh tasa za ka a lisa mboh alindeh. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Na ameh wohroh tana a leh bishi a ka a kwo, maka a wra a ŋoh, maka a gu kohmoh a ŋoh a gya a na ma ida inza. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Lida reh a bu ma nda Yofa; amboh tufa mboh reh nza maka a sehreh la Abitrusu a bu ma a huru maka a tohmoh kyangwri afri mboh a na a ŋoh, tama a kwere ŋoh la ta a ba na amoh ni gbugbo. <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Abitrusu neh ka a hinga a tufa mboh a na. Nza maka a na na aniye ma a huru maka a wa ŋoh a na ida inza reh. Ifiya mboh nambri amboh tsitsifa amoh mboh ma a kwo reh, maka a shi a goh ŋoh, maka buti kpanga ka a tsana ŋoh akuri tasa mgbiri awumu ata Dokas ta ka nga mboh neh ŋoh a treh a bu na na fene reh. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Abitrusu ka a bleh mboh la ma a kate a na inziyo nambri ma amoh, ta ka a dohnoh, ta ka a kwere Nnoh. Ka a gyuruna a nza kohmoh afiya reh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Dokas, hinga,&gt;&gt; ta ka a vuru iyo nza ka a nza Abitrusu, ka a hinga a tuma. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Abitrusu ka a de ŋoh ma ivoh ka a de ŋoh a haha a hinga a shi. Ta ka a fi amboh tufa mboh, tasa ifiya mboh amboh tsitsifa amoh mboh nza ma a kwo reh, ka a wa ŋoh nga mboh na fene. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Maka a sehreh ka a treh akpokpo atsifi ma Yofa, kyangwri gaga maka sa tsifa Ada reh a kira. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Abitrusu ka a kpiri a tuma ma Yofa a yanda, ma afiya kyangwri anyi a ka te ndohmoh lisa bina, sa a ŋoh bu Siman.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Koneliyus A fi Abitrusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Kyangwri Anyi a yama ma Kaisariya isa a ŋoh bu Koneliyus. Ŋoh a bu agba amboh de ita ata Italiya. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Ŋoh tasa mara a ŋoh mboh nambri ma a tufa yivoh tasa mata a nyiri Nnoh za gaga; a ka a nga nga na agohsoh a ŋoh anyimbehreh ma amboh ata nza ma a bu na wohroh kpeh ta ka a kwere Nnoh ni tutu. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ibi anyi ni mgba ameh atatoh ata nvishi ka a nza amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi nimeh huru, ka a kate, a ba na a ŋoh ka a fi la, &lt;&lt;Koneliyus!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Koneliyus ka a leh a nza ŋoh a nina nimeh nyiri. A ka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ada, a ka bu umbo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Kwere Nnoh anzoh tasa ngǝnga anzoh ma amboh nza ma a bu na wohroh kpeh reh kǝ gu ba bu niye inza a bu awumu kohnoh ma tohmoh Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Nehnehreh tohmoh kyangwri mboh na ni Yofa, mata a fi Siman nza maka a fi sa a ŋoh za la Abitrusu. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />A ka a tuma na Siman kyangwri lisa Bina, afiya a ŋoh a bu ma nda fini agbagbaa reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh nza ka atsifa na a ŋoh, a ka a na a ŋoh, koneliyus ka a fi ahwra a ŋoh mboh afri, tasa kyangwri shi ita anyi a ka a tufa Nnoh tana a bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh nza maka a te ŋoh ndohmoh. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Nza ka a bleh mboh andromboh nza a te reh nambri ta ka a tohmoh mboh a na Yafa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abitrusu A nza ma Huru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Ibi na afri ni mgba atsitsifi nnoh, nza maka a bu ti na amoh, maka a te ma nda akpo afiya agba reh, Abitrusu ka a ka a na ikpi tsitsi ida atsi kwere Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Inyo ka a keh ŋoh a kira la ŋoh ta ari rya, maka a treh ka a lisa rya reh dehreh neh, ka a nza Ma huru. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Ka nza inza a vuruna andromboh anyi tswanza ba lefe agba, ma a lafa a tamba a ba ni mgba aniye ata inziyo reh. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Woaye amboh hwana anneh tasa woaye amboh gbo na agohsoh ata inziyo agba areh tasa akuku mboh ata avereh ma a bu su nimeh. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Ma huru ka a sehreh agba anyi ti bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Hinga shi, Abitrusu, mla ti rya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Abitrusu neh ka a kira la, Ada! &lt;&lt;A nati bu dehreh kpeh, mya meh hehreh rya andromboh ata nza a te arishi ha ata nza a chakafana a te abibi kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Agba reh ka a gyuru atsifa na a ŋoh ata na afri, &lt;&lt;Kama fi andromboh anyi la a chakafana kpeh ata Nnoh nza kǝ lisa ŋoh na zanana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />A lisa dehreh a te aniye atatoh, maka a gu lefe agba a gyuru a na inza yama.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Abitrusu nza ka a buti kohnoh andromboh ata nza ma a tsana ŋoh ma huru reh, kyangwri mboh amboh ata koneliyus ta ka a tohmoh mboh reh maka a fa afiya Siman reh a nza maka a shi ma anida niye mgba afiya. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Maka a shi ti fi, luhu Siman ata nza ma a wina ŋoh ni sa anyi za la Abitrusu ta ka a tuma a huru.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Abitrusu ka a treh ka a buti kohnoh tsifa ma ikpi andromboh nza ma a tsana ŋoh Ma huru reh, huru ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Siman, kyangwri mboh atatoh ma a buti fa nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Hinga ti tamba na ida inzi. Kama kohnoh tseh kpeh, a bu mya meh tohmoh mboh.<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Abitrusu ka a tamba a na na a bleh ma kyangwri mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;A bu mya ni buti fa meh noh. Ni ba nnoh a bu tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Kyangwri mboh reh maka kira la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh ba na Koneliyus agba amboh de ita reh. A ka tufa yehlehleh a bu kyangwri nyiri Nnoh, ata kyangwri Yahudawa mboh nambri maka a nga ŋoh agba. Amehreh tohmoh zanana anyi a bleh ŋoh la ti ba afiya a ŋoh ta a sehreh andromboh ata nza ni nati a bleh&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Abitrusu ka a wa kyangwri mboh reh aniye a na mgba afiya a ŋoh mata a bu sene a ŋoh.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 10:23">Abitrusu Ma Afiya Koneliyus</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Ibi na afri ka a hinga, maka a na ma mboh, amboh tufa mboh amboh anyi ma anyi akpo afiya agba Yofa maka a wa ŋoh a gya aki. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Ka a te ni nerebi maka aniye Kaisariya. Koneliyus a buti gya agohsoh a ŋoh ni ba amoh reh a ka a fi alohsoh a ŋoh tasa ziza a ŋoh mboh a ba akpo anyimbehreh. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Abitrusu nza ka aniye a ba mgba afiya reh, Koneliyus ka a ba ba a hunji ŋoh ma aki ta ka a hwa ma tohmoh a ŋoh a krumusu ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Abitrusu neh a de ŋoh la ta a hinga. Ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Hinga shi&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mya ni ikpi mya mi bu kyangwri ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Abitrusu ka a buti tsifa na a ŋoh, Abitrusu ka aniye a na nimeh ka a nza dohsohna kyangwri mboh gaga. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Abitrusu ka a bleh mboh la: &lt;&lt;Ni wina noh la a sohroh a zohhoh Yahudawa akyo ta a dohsoh ikpi a ŋoh na achifi amboh anyi kpeh. Nnoh neh ka tsana meh la meh ti kama fi akyo la a bu na arishi ha la a bu na zanana kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Mya nza ni sehreh la ni fi meh, meh hinga ba meh sohroh leke kpeh. Ta meh ti luhu ni kǝ fi meh ba tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koneliyus ka a bleh la: &lt;&lt;Ibi aniye ata nza a gǝga meh buti kwere Nnoh ma afiya amya na nnoh na ameh atatoh. Ma huru heri kyangwri anyi a were akuri ryarya ka a shi ma tomwo amya, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />ta ka a bleh meh la, &lt;Koneliyus, Nnoh kǝ sere kwere anzoh tasa kǝ kohnoh ngǝnga nza ni nga ma amboh iya mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Tohmoh na Yofa mata a fi Siman ata nza maka a fi ŋoh la Abitrusu. A ba sene ma Siman kyangwri lisa bina reh, nza a leh ma akechi fini reh.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Mya kǝ tohmoh na la ma a fi noh a ba gbugbo, a zohhoh nza ni ba reh. Nehnehreh nambri ma ambohroh meh bu ma tomo Nnoh meh ti sere andromboh ata Nnoh a gya nnoh ma agohsoh ti bleh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abitrusu A bleh Tsifa Nnoh Ma afiya Koneliyus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Abitrusu a buti tsifa la: Nehnehreh meh wina a bu zizi la Nnoh ka a kira ikpi kpeh <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />A sa kyangwri a treh akpokpo atsifi mboh nambri amboh nza ma a nyiri ŋoh tasa mata a lisa andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Ni wina noh tohmoh Nnoh ta ka a tohmoh a na ma kyangwri Israila mboh reh, a bleh mboh tsifa nana ata tuma alindeh a nyi ma aniye Yeso Kristi, ŋoh ka a bu agba ambohroh nambri. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Ni wina noh andromboh nza na a te ma Yahudiya nambri, a jiji ka anyi Galili, ma nyina wra batisma ata Ayohana ta ka a hwra bleh tsifa Nnoh reh, <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />lele Nnoh ta ka awo Huru zanana ma Yeso ata Nazaret tasa wuwana, tasa lele ta ka a hehndeh ka a gohgohna ta ka a lisa ndohmoh alindeh ta ka a lisa amboh agugu nza ka a de mboh nga iya reh, Nnoh a bu na a ŋoh.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />&lt;&lt;Mbohroh ti meh nza nambri andromboh ta ka a te ma akpo inzi Yahudawa tasa ma Urushalima. Maka a mla ŋoh a kwo a gu a kohhroh ma agbeh, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Nnoh neh ka a gyuru ka a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo ibi ata atatoh tasa ka a gu ŋoh a gya mata a nza ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />A bu kyangwri mboh nambri ma a nza ŋoh kpeh, a bu Mbohroh ma, amboh ata Nnoh nza a seh reh meh ti kǝ nza reh. Mbohroh ti meh rya tasa wa ma a ŋoh, nyina hinga a ŋoh anyi kwo. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />A bleh reh la meh ti bleh tsifa Nnoh na ni kyangwri mboh tasa meh ti bleh na aniye ambohroh la a bu ŋoh ata Nnoh nza a seh ŋoh ta ahwra akpi ma amboh nza ma a bu na fene tasa amboh kwo mboh. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh nambri ma amoh maka a bleh na aniye amoh ma ikpi a ŋoh la akyo ata nza a nga agohsoh ŋoh na a ŋoh ma a na ta a gu kpakpana a ŋoh reh a te kohhroh nimeh isa a ŋoh. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Huru Zanana Ka Tamba Ma Ikpi amboh Nza Ma bu Yahudawa Mboh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Abitrusu nza ka a treh a bleh tsifa amboh areh dehreh ma neh, Huru Zanana reh ka a ba ma ikpi amboh nza ma a sehreh tsifa reh nambri. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Yahudawa mboh amboh nza ma a nga agohsoh amoh mata ka a wa Abitrusu anyi Yofa a ba reh maka a ŋara aniye ma la Nnoh nza a nga huru a ŋoh ma amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh za. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Nza ma a sehreh mboh ti tsifa na arimi tasa mata ariri Nnoh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Ma huru Abitrusu ka a bleh la, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />&lt;&lt;Akyo a tswa ta a ha mata ahwra mboh batisma na amwo? Ma a sa huru zanana tswanza Mbohroh nza ma sa reh. &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />A ka a bleh mboh la ma a wra mboh Batisma nimeh isa Yeso Kristi. Ma huru maka a kwere Abitrusu la ta a tuma na amoh a te ibi shidi.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Abitrusu A bleh tsifa Ma amboh tufa mboh Ma Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso a ba reh tasa atsi ambohroh mboh nza ma a bu ma akpo inzi Yahudiya maka a sehreh la amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh za ma a sa tsifa Nnoh za reh. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Abitrusu nza ka a na Urushalima, agbugba Yahudawa mboh amboh anyi amboh tufa tsifa shimba kpa reh, maka a shi a tsifa ŋoh, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ni niye na mgba afiya kyangwri amboh nza ma a hehreh a shimba mboh kpa kpeh tsifa umboh, tasa za ti kǝ rya na amoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Abitrusu neh ka a shi ka a bleh mboh ma aniye anyimbehreh a kate andromboh ŋoh nza na a lisa reh: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />&lt;&lt;Meh ti ni leh kwere Nnoh ma akpo afiya agba ata maka a fi la Yofa, meh kǝ nza nimeh lohtoh. Meh nza andromboh a tswanza lefe agba ma a de adoh a tamba anyi ma inza na mgba anneh ma, a ka a titamba a ba atsi ata mya nza ni yama reh. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Meh kǝ nza nimeh a ŋoh mi kǝ nza iwoaye mboh amboh hwana aniye ata inziyo agba areh, agbugba woaye mboh, amboh gbo na agohsoh, tasa akuku mboh ata avereh. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Ma huru mi kǝ sehreh agba ti bleh meh la, &lt;Hinga, Abitrusu. Mla ti rya.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />&lt;&lt;Meh kǝ kira la, &lt;Uwa, Ada! Andromboh ata nza a bu na arishi ha ata nza zanana kpeh a ka aniye ma aniye mya kpeh.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />&lt;&lt;Agba ka a gyuru atsifa anyi ma inza a te na afri la, &lt;Kama fi andromboh anyi ata Nnoh nza a lisa fyafya reh la a bu na arishi kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />A lisa dehreh a te na atatoh, ta ka a gyuru ka akpi a ka a na inza yama.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />&lt;&lt;Ma huru yehlehleh kyangwri atatoh amboh nza ma a tohmoh mboh a ba anyi Kaisariya maka a shi ma afiya atsi meh nza ni kǝ leh reh. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Huru reh ka a bleh meh la, meh ti wa mboh na, meh ti kama leke kpeh. Ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh atehrehkifi reh ma a wa meh meh kǝ na mbohroh ma mboh, meh kǝ na ni niye ma afiya kyangwri reh: <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />a ka a bleh reh ika ata ŋoh nza a nza Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh anyi nza a kate a shi ma afiya a ŋoh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Tohmoh na Yofa mata a fi Siman ata nza maka a fi ŋoh za la Abitrusu reh. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />A nati de tohmoh a ba nnoh ata nza ni nati hunji nvara nyi na a ŋoh, mohnoh ma kyangwri anzoh mboh nambri.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />&lt;&lt;Bagadi Mya nza buti bleh mboh tsifa dehreh neh, huru zanana ka a tamba a ba mboh, tswanza ta ka a jiji a tamba a ba reh. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Ma huru meh kǝ kohnoh tsifa ata Nnoh, nza a bleh la: Ayohana ta a wra nnoh na amwo, mohnoh neh ni a nati bu noh na huru zanana ma a nati wra batisma.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Tswanza Nnoh nza a nga mboh lomo a tswana yehlehleh na ata nza a lisa reh, mbohroh nza meh nga kira na Ada Yeso kristi reh, meh kǝ bu anyi meh ti ha Nnoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Nza maka a sehreh dehreh, Abitrusu, ma a za a bleh andromboh kpeh, maka ariri Nnoh la Nnoh reh nga fene za ma amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh la mboh za mata a gyuruna ata aki agugu amoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">amboh Tufa Mboh Ma Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Amboh tufa mboh amboh ata mata ka a gbo a te atsetse tsifa ata mata ka nga mboh iya gaga ma ikpi ma ta ka a mla Istifanus a kwo reh, tama a hehndeh a na akpo inzi Finikiya, tasa Sayifurus, tasa Antakiya. Ma a leh a bleh tsifa Nnoh ma kyangwri Yahudawa mboh ma tsene. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Mgbiri Kyangwri amboh Sayifurus tasa Sayirin, amboh nza ma a na Antakiya maka a bleh ma Helenawa mboh tsifa nana ma ikpi Ada Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Ivoh Nnoh ka a bu na Amoh, Kyangwri gaga maka nga agohsoh maka a gyuruna a tufa Nnoh.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Tsifa ata areh ka aniye ma ashotoh amboh tufa mboh ma urushalima, maka a tohmoh Barnaba a na Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />nza ka a ba, a ka nza andromboh alindeh ata Nnoh nza a lisa mboh, a ka a nana ŋoh agohsoh, a ka akpi mboh ashotoh nambri ma amoh la mata a shi ma ikpi nga agohsoh nimeh sa Nnoh na agohsoh amoh anyimbehreh. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Ta a bu kyangwri alindeh, huru zanana tana a bu na a ŋoh gaga tasa gya agohsoh, Kyangwri mboh gaga maka nga agohsoh Barnaba maka a gyuruna a ba ni Nnoh.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ma huru Barnaba ka a na Tarsus la ŋoh ta a na na a fa Shawulu, <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />nza ka a hunji ŋoh a ka a wa ŋoh a ba Antakiya. A gu ahushi anyimbehreh ni su, maka a dohsoh ikpi ni kyangwri amboh tufa mboh, mata ka a tsana ma kyangwri mboh gaga. A bu ma Antakiya mi mata ka a jiji a fi sa amboh tufa mboh reh la Kirista.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Na ameh ata areh mgbiri amboh sa tohmoh ni a bleh reh maka anyi Urushalima a ba Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />anyimbehreh amoh, maka a fi sa ŋoh la Agabus, A ka a hinga a shi, ka a bleh ni wuwana huru la, Inyo agba anyi a nati ba ma inziyo agba areh nambri. Tana a lisa dehreh na ameh Kalaudiyus. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Amboh tufa mboh reh ha a bu anyi ni wuwana a ŋoh maka a dohsoh aniye a gya la mboh ma a nati a tohmoh shingi amoh a na ma amboh nza ma a yama ma Yahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Maka a lisa dehreh, maka a tohmoh shingǝ amoh a na ma agbugba amboh tufa mboh nyi ma ivoh Barnaba mboh ma shawulu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Abitrusu A lalana Gbalala A kate Nyi Ma Ida Ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Tana bu na ameh ata Agohmoh Hiridus ta ka a leh a de amboh tufa mboh a nga mboh iya reh. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Hirudus ka bleh la mata a mla Yakubu, atsini Ayohana a kwo, na ambyagara. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Nza ka a nza la andromboh ata areh a nana agohsoh ma kyangwri Yahudawa mboh, a ka a gyuru a de Abitrusu za, andromboh reh ta a te na ameh kira afohfohnoh ata nza a bu na Yisti kpeh reh. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Nza maka a de Abitrusu a treh, maka a gu ŋoh a fi ma ida ka, maka a wa ŋoh a nga ivoh amboh de ita agrumavoh a hwa aniye mata ka a shi a sumu ŋoh. A bu na kohnoh la ŋoh a nati a wa ŋoh a ba ma tomo duma mboh feh sa a shimba ŋoh akpi ma inyina kira gǝga handa. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Abitrusu reh neh maka a gya ŋoh ma ida ka, amboh tufa mboh neh maka a leh kwere Nnoh ma ikpi a ŋoh.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A sa Abitrusu A hwana Nyi Ma Ida Ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Ni shini ata Hirudus ta ka a kira la ŋoh ta a wa Abitrusu a ba ma atsi hwra akpi reh, Abitrusu ka a buti leh mla ma atsitsifi amboh de ita mboh afri, ma a lafa ŋoh na njehnjehreh afri, amboh sumu mboh neh maka a shi a sumu anida ida ka reh. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Ma huruhuru anyimbehreh nimeh mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh ka a krembe a kate tasa zana anyi ka a kpanga nimeh ida ka reh. Ka ava Abitrusu ni nda ta ka a yiri ŋoh a hinga. Ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Hinga, ni gbugbo!&gt;&gt; Njehnjehreh reh ta ka a sangrana a tamba ata agba ivoh mboh ma Abitrusu. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ma huru Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &gt;&gt;Soh akuri anzoh mboh tasa akpehtreh hwana anzoh mboh. &lt;&lt;Abitrusu ka a lisa dehreh. <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Abitrusu ka a wa ŋoh a kate nyi ma ida ka reh, ŋoh neh a sohroh a wina la andromboh ata mara tohmoh Nnoh reh nza a buti te reh la a bu zizi; a bleh a ŋoh la ŋoh a buti nza wono mi. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Nza maka a gǝga amboh sumu amboh ata jiji ŋoh tasa ata na afri, nza maka a ba anida agba karafi anyi ata nza a gu a gǝga na akpo afiya agba reh, a ka a vuruna na ikpi a ŋoh, maka aniye a gǝga ma hohroh a ŋoh. Maka a hehndeh a ba aki anyi nza a ba ba a trina, ma hwana anyimbehreh Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a yi ŋoh ata. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Ma huru Abitrusu ka a gyuru ka a ba ŋoh itoh a ŋoh, &lt;&lt;Nehnehreh meh wina la a bu zizi! la a bu Ada a tohmoh mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh la ta a ba ba a sa meh a hwana nyi ma ivoh Hiridus, tasa nyi ma ivoh Yahudawa amboh nza ma a buti kohnoh agugu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Nza ka a kohnoh dehreh wina, ka a na ŋoh afiya Maryamu, akre Ayohana ata maka a fi la Markus, atsi kyangwri mboh nza ma a dohsohna gaga a kwere Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Abitrusu ka ava anida na mgba inziyo ŋoh, ahwra anyifa anyi isa ŋoh bu Roda ka a ba la ŋoh ta a vuru anida reh. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nza ka a sehreh agba Abitrusu a wina reh, ka johjoh gaga ta ka a gyuru a gbo a na ŋoh na nyina ta sohroh a vuru anida reh kpeh ta ka a kpanga a bleh la Abitrusu a bu ma anida!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Maka a bleh ma Roda la, &lt;&lt;Ikpi anzoh a gyuruna!&gt;&gt; Neh ka lisa leh a bleh la a bu ŋoh zizi. Maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A nati bu amehreh tohmoh a ŋoh mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Abitrusu neh ka a buti va anida reh, tasa nza maka a vuru anida reh maka a nza ŋoh, maka a ŋara aniye ma. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Abitrusu ka a te mboh na ivoh la mata shimba gbalala ta ka a bleh tswanza Ada nza a gu ŋoh a kate nyi ma ida ka reh. Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Bleh nnoh ma Yakubu tasa atsini mboh ma ikpi andromboh ata areh,&gt;&gt; ta ka a na ŋoh akpo anyi tse.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Ni nerebi, amboh de ita reh ma sa akpakpatana kavoh ma a sohroh a wina ha Abitrusu reh a lalana lele kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Hirudus nza ka a fa ŋoh a treh atsifi kavoh, a hunji ŋoh kpeh. Ka a luhu la maka a de amboh sumu mboh reh a mla a kwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Ma huru Hiridus ka a hinga a na a yi akpo afiya Yahudiya, ta ka a na ŋoh Kaisariya ka a tuma a te ibi afri ma a huru.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwo Hiridus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Na ameh wohroh, Hirudus a buti te gofo na kyangwri taya mboh tasa kyangwri Sidon mboh. Maka a ba na Hirudus la mboh ma a ba mata tsifa tuma alindeh, maka a fa Bilatus kyangwri kpakpranda Agohmoh ta a shi mboh inyina a ka a kira ka a shingi mboh. neh maka a na na a hunji Hirudus maka a fa tuma alindeh amoh, la mboh ma a gya agohsoh na inzi Agohmoh ata areh tsifa rya rya amoh.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Ibi wohroh ka, Hirudus ka a were akuri Agohmoh a ŋoh, ta ka a ka tuma ma ikpi kpra hwra akpi a ŋoh feh, sa tuma ahwra tsifa a bleh mboh. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Nza maka a sehreh ŋoh a treh maka a vuru agba amoh mboh a ka la &lt;&lt;Sere nnoh kyangwri ata areh reh! &gt;&gt; maka buti bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu agba Nnoh andromboh anyi mi, a bu ata kyangwri ŋoh kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Ma a huruhuru, mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh anyi ka ava ŋoh la telema feh a nga agba ma Nnoh kpeh. Mgbishi mboh maka a leh rya ŋoh a kwo.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Barnaba Mboh Ma Shawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Tsifa Nnoh neh ka a buti yangana a rya tohmoh.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Barnaba mboh ma Shawulu nza maka a te ndohmoh amoh a treh, maka a gyuru anyi Urushalima a na amoh antakiya, maka a wa Ayohana ata nza maka a fi ŋoh la Markus za a ba.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Barnaba Mboh Ma Shawulu Ma Ata mboh Avoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Nimeh Kyangwri amboh tufa mboh amboh nza ma a yama ma antakiya, amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh amboh anyi ma a yama ma a huru tasa amboh tsana mboh: Barnaba, tasa Simeyon ata maka a fi ŋoh za la amehreh hungwa tasa Lusiya ata nza anyi Sayirin, tasa Manayen, ata nza a te agba na Agohmoh Hirudus, tasa za Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Nza maka a buti krumusu Nnoh, tasa de aniye, Huru zanana ka a bleh la, ta meh Barnaba tasa Shawulu mata a te ndohmoh ata mya nza ni fi mboh. <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Nza maka a de aniye tasa kwere Nnoh reh a treh, maka a gya mboh ivoh a te mboh atoh.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Barnaba mboh ma Shawulu Ma Sayifurus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Na afri ma amoh, ata Huru Zanana nza a tohmoh mboh reh, maka a na Salukiya, nyi ma a huru neh maka aniye ma gbogblondo amwo ka a na amoh Sayifurus. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Nza maka aniye ma Salamis, maka a bleh tsifa Nnoh ma ida Nnoh Yahudawa mboh, Yahaya neh ka a buti shingi mboh.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Maka a hehndeh a treh atsitsifi wohroh nambri neh maka a ba ba aniye ma Bafos. Maka a dohsohna na kyangwri Yahuda anyi a bu kyangwri akagba tasa za a ka a huru tsifa la ŋoh ka a sa tsifa anyi na Nnoh a bleh, isa a ŋoh bu Bar Yeso, <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />ata nza ka a tufa agba kyangwri inzi reh, Sarjiyus Ablusu. A bu kyangwri wina lomo, a ka a tohmoh a na ma Barnaba tasa Shawulu la ŋoh a kira ta a sehreh tsifa Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Alimas neh kyangwri akagba reh, isa ŋoh reh a tsana dehreh, na arimi Helenanci mboh, a kpa aniye, a kira la ŋoh ta a gyuru agohsoh gomna reh la ta a sohroh a sa tsifa reh a kira kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Shawulu sa a ŋoh za nza a bu Ablusu neh, Huru zanana ka a ba ŋoh gaga, ka a nza Alimas reh a na ma iyo tatasa. <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />&lt;&lt;Nnoh bu amehreh agugu tasa ni kǝ la kpeh na andromboh nza a bu yehlehleh! Ni yama atsi te inyi tasa huru tsifa. Ni nati yi kputu akeki yehlehleh ata Nnoh reh ta kpeh? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Nehnehreh ivoh Nnoh a leke nnoh. Ni nati hama iyo, ni nati kpiri yanda shidi ni nati nza zana Nnoh kpeh,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Ma huruhuru huru andromboh tasa shini anyi maka a hama iyo a ŋoh, a ka leh ka a mohmlohna a fa akyo ata nza a nati a de ŋoh a hehndeh. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Agba kyangwri inzi reh ka a nza andromboh ata nza na a te reh, a ka nga agohsoh a ŋoh, ka a te ŋoh shi ŋara aniye ma na tsifa tsana ma ikpi Nnoh.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu mboh Ma Barnaba Ma Antakiya Ata Bisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Ablusu mboh ma iziza hende a ŋoh mboh maka a hinga anyi Bafos nimeh gbogblondo amwo, maka a na Ferga ata Pamfiliya, Atsi ata Ayohana ta ka a yi mboh ata ta ka a gyuruna a na ŋoh Urushalima reh. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Nyi Ferga maka a rya tohmoh na hende amoh a na Antakiya ata Bisidiya. Ibi asabar maka aniye nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Nza maka a bleh anyi ma amgbasho Musa reh tasa tsana ata amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh, agba amboh de ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh maka a tohmoh tsifa a na mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ambohroh mboh, nza ni bu noh na tsifa ata wuwa agohsoh ma kyangwri mboh reh, bleh mboh nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Ablusu ka a hinga a shi, ka a gu ivoh a ka la, mata a shimba gbalala, ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh atsi amya mboh amboh ata Israilawa, tasa mgbiri amboh nyiri Nnoh, nga meh noh ashotoh mohnoh! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Nnoh ata kyangwri Israilawa mboh tana a seh ada ambohroh mboh; maka a te kyangwri amboh asabara na ameh ata mata ka a yama ni inzi masar, ni wuwana agba a ŋoh ka a gu mboh a kate anyi ma akpo inzi wohroh. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />A soh ivoh yira na amoh dehreh a gu ahushi agrumavoh da aniye ma hohroh Bini. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ka a rya inzizi atehrehkifi na anyi ma gofo ma inzi Kaana, ta ka nga inzizi mboh reh ma kyangwri Israila mboh. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Areh nambri tana a gu ahushi 450.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">&lt;&lt;Ma nyina ata areh, Nnoh ka a gunu amboh hwra akpi mboh a gya mboh a gu a ba a te na ameh Samaila kyangwri sa tsifa anyi ni Nnoh a bleh reh. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Tasa Kyangwri Israilawa mboh reh maka a kwere la ma a nga mboh Agohmoh, Nnoh ka a nga mboh Shawulu amehreh Kish, alohsoh arimi Benyamin, ata nza a de Agohmoh reh a te ahushi agrumavoh da aniye. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Nza maka a fufa Shawulu a te, maka a gu Dawuda a gya ta ka a bu Agohmoh amoh. Ka a bleh na aniye a ŋoh ma ikpi a ŋoh la: &lt;Mya meh hunji Dawuda amehreh Yesse kyangwri ata nza a bu ma agohsoh amya; a nati a lisa andromboh ata mya nza kira la ta lisa.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />&lt;&lt;A ka anyi na alohsoh kyangwri reh Nnoh nza a de Yeso kyangwri nga nvara reh a ba ma kyangwri Israila mboh tswanza ta ka a bleh a gya reh, <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Ayohana tana ka a bleh tsifa Nnoh ma amboh Israilawa mboh la mata a gyuruna ata aki agugu amoh reh tasa mata a wra mboh batisma a treh feh Yeso sa ka a ba. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Na ameh ata Ayohana waka a buti nati tre ndohmoh a ŋoh, a ka bleh la: Ni kǝ nza noh la Mya bu anyi? Mya bu wohroh kpeh. Uwa, a treh a ba nyina amya, ata akpehtreh hwana a ŋoh mboh mya nati wina hingre kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />&lt;&lt;Atsi amya mboh, alohsoh Ibrahim, tasa mohnoh amboh nyiri nnoh Nnoh nza ni bu noh Yahudawa mboh kpeh, a bu Mbohroh ŋa nza ma a tohmoh tsifa nvara a ba reh reh. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Kyangwri Urushalima mboh agbugba amoh mboh ma a sohroh a wina la a bu ŋoh mi bu kyangwri de nvara ba kpeh, ma a sohroh a wina tsifa kyangwri amboh sa tsifa anyi na Nnoh a bleh nza maka a bleh na tutu ibi asabar reh kpeh. Neh maka a de ŋoh ka a nga iya la tsifa amboh sa tsifa anyi ni Nnoh bleh reh ta a su. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Ma a hunji ŋoh na kpakpana ata nza a tswa mata a mla ŋoh a kwo kpeh, kukwi maka a bleh ma Bilatus la ta mata a mla ŋoh a kwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Nza maka a lisa andromboh ata tama ka a ŋa reh ni su nambri ma ikpi a ŋoh, maka a gu ŋoh anyi ma ikpi gbohrohgboh maka a gu ŋoh a fi ma tsiyo nyifo. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Nnoh neh ka a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />A te ibi vara ka buti kate ma amboh mata ka a bu na a ŋoh ma Galili a na wurushalima reh. Nehnehreh maka a gyuruna a te amboh bleh ma ikpi tsifa Nnoh a na ni kyangwri ambohroh mboh. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />&lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh bleh noh tsifa nana reh: Andromboh ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya ma ada Mbohroh mboh reh <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />bleh tsifa a ŋoh reh a su a ba na ambohroh nza a yiri Yeso reh a hinga. Tswanza mata ka a ŋa ma Zabura ata na afri la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">&lt;&lt;Nnoh bu amehreh amya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">andrehmeh mya ma te atsiyoh.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Nnoh nza a yiri ŋoh anyi kwo, la ta a za a hwina kpeh, ta ma a ŋa nimeh tsifa amboh ata areh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">&lt;Meh nati nga nnoh zanana tasa amboh te atoh mata ka a bleh a gya ma Dawuda.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Tama a ŋa a gya ma akpo anyi la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">&lt;Ni nati kira nnoh la amboh zanana amohnoh mboh mata a hwina kpeh. &gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />&lt;&lt;Dawuda nza ka te ndohmoh ata Nnoh ta ka nga a ŋoh na ameh wohroh reh. a ka a hwa a leh mla maka anyifo ŋoh mboh ma alehmeh a ŋoh mboh amboh itoh ŋoh ta ka a hwina. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Yeso ata Nnoh nza a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo a sohroh a hwina kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />&lt;&lt;Nza a bu dehreh neh atsi amya mboh, meh kira ti wina noh la, a bu tsifa Yeso reh ŋa nza ma ahwra tsifa te kohhroh na kpakpana amohnoh reh a bleh, asohroh a bu tsifa la ni akpi Musa reh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />ka a nati anyi na a ŋoh akyo ata nza a nga agohsoh a ŋoh kǝ hunji hingrena a ŋoh nyi nimeh kpakpana mboh nambri tasa tsana tsifa amgbasho Musa reh anyina ta a wina a hingre, ha ni wina tufa nambri. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Lisa nza noh andromboh ata amboh sa tsifa nyi na Nnoh a bleh reh ta a kama a hunji noh kpeh:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />&lt;Nza nnoh, mohnoh amboh wene noh Nnoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Ni nati shi ŋara nnoh aniye, ti kwo nnoh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Meh nati lisa ndohmoh anyi ma ika amohnoh areh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ata nza nati nga nnoh agohsoh amohnoh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ha bu akyo a bleh noh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Ablusu tasa Barnaba maka a buti kate ta ida Nnoh reh neh amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh maka a ba ba kwere mboh la tama a tsana tsifa ma ikpi awumu mboh a mishi ma ibi asabar a te ba. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Kyangwri mboh nza maka a sangrana, Yahudawa mboh gaga, tasa za amboh nza ma a gyuruna tufa Yahudawa mboh ni wuwana amoh, maka a tufa Ablusu tasa Barnaba, amboh nza ma atsifa na amoh, maka a lisa a nga mboh wuwa agohsoh la mata a rya tohmoh nimeh Nnoh nza ka a nza kwini Mbohroh.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Ibi asabar anyi ka a ba Iba hwiri kyangwri mboh ma Akpo Afiya agba reh mata a dohsohna na agba ma mata a ba ba a sehreh tsifa Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Yahudawa mboh reh nza maka a nza dohsohna duma agba reh, maka a te vehneh, maka a leh la kpeh na andromboh ata Ablusu nza a buti a bleh reh ma ta ka a kya ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Ma huru Ablusu tasa Barnaba maka atsifa na amoh na wuwa agohsoh la: &lt;&lt;Mohnoh Yahudawa mboh a zohhoh meh ti jiji bleh noh tsifa Nnoh fiya. mohnoh ni leke ti sa nnoh, areh ni tsana noh la ni tswa ti hunji noh fene ata tuma atono kpeh. Mbohroh meh nati na na amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Areh a bu andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh reh:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">&lt;Meh ti lisa nnoh ni zanana ma amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">la ti de nvara ba a gu a na inziyo ta a trina.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a nza nana gaga, maka ariri tsifa Nnoh; tasa amboh nza ma a bleh la ma a nati a hunji fene ata tuma atono ma a nga agohsoh.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Tsifa Ada reh ka lisa ka a yangana a keh ma akpo inzi reh nambri. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Yahudawa mboh reh maka a leh a landa ifiya mboh amboh nza maka a nyiri Nnoh amboh nza maka nga mboh agba tasa mgbiri agbugba kyangwri akpo afiya. Maka a leh ti fa akpi na Barnaba, mata ka a katsi mboh ma afiya amoh. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Maka akpo kpo huru ma hwana amoh la mata a tsana kputu agohsoh amoh mata ka a na amoh Ikoniya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />amboh tufa mboh reh johjoh tasa huru zanana ka a su mboh.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ma Ikoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Ma Ikoniya, Ablusu tasa Barnaba maka aniye nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh tswanza nza maka a lisa reh. Maka bleh tsifa Nnoh, kyangwri Yahudawa mboh tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh gaga maka nga agohsoh amoh. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Yahudawa mboh reh amboh nza ma a leke mata nga agohsoh amoh reh, maka a leh a landa amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa kpeh reh la, mata kputu agohsoh a ba ma ikpi amboh tufa mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Ablusu mboh ma Barnaba maka a kpiri yanda ma a huru gaga, maka a buti bleh tsifa Nnoh ma a nyiri kpeh nimeh wuwana Nnoh. Ata nza a kira na tsifa ŋoh nza a kira la meh ti tsana agbugba kpra mboh tasa ndohmoh shi ŋara mboh ma. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Kyangwri mboh ma akpo afiya agba Likoniya reh maka a gafana a te afri; itswa ma a shi inyina Yahudawa mboh, mgbiri ma a shi ma inyina amboh sa tohmoh nana ba reh. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />amboh nza ma a bu Yahuda mboh kpeh reh, tasa Yahudawa mboh, ka a wa ma agbugba amoh mboh maka a lafa a gya la mboh ma a nati nga iya ma amboh de tsifa nana a ba reh, ma ta ka a dadafa mboh na kpakpa. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a gbo a na kpra Agohmoh agba Likoniya mgba Listira tasa Darbe, mgbiri inzizi amboh ata nza ma a goh ŋoh mboh, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />atsi nza maka a rya tohmoh na bleh tsifa nana reh.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma Listira tasa Darbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Ma Listira kyangwri a yama ma a huru a te hwana grugutu a wina hende kpeh avoh nza ma a mara ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />A buti sehreh tsifa Nnoh nyi na Ablusu, Ablusu ka a were iyo a nza ŋoh, a nza la kyangwri nga agohsoh a ŋoh ata nza tswa mata a lisa ŋoh <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />ta ka a fi a kate la, &lt;&lt;Hinga shi ni hwana anzoh, Kyangwri ka a hinga a tsimwona a shi ta ka a buti hende.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Duma mboh nza maka a nza andromboh ata Ablusu nza ma a lisa, maka a vuru agba a ka nambri ma amoh hwana anyimbehreh ka a bleh ni mgba Likoniya la, &lt;&lt;nnoh akǝkehreh mboh ma a tamba ba na ambohroh nimeh tohmwo kyangwri!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Maka nga isa ma Barnaba la Zeyus, Ablusu za maka a fi ŋoh la, Hermes la ŋoh bu agba kyangwri tsifa. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Agba Firist ata a soh Zeyus reh, ata ida a soh a ŋoh mboh nza ma a bu ma nyina akpo afiya reh, ka a de londo atsifaa tasa ma jimi na akru agbeh a ba ma anida akpo afiya reh, ata ŋoh tasa duma mboh mata nga ma amboh ble tsifa nana ba reh ta a bu awumu ngǝnga ata fa woaye amoh.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Amboh sa tohmoh nana mboh Barnaba tasa Ablusu nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a hwashi akuri amoh mata ka a gbo a kate aniye a na hohroh duma reh, mata a vuru agba a ka ka a bleh la, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri mboh, ni kǝ lisa nnoh dehreh tsifa umbo? Mbohroh za meh bu kyangwri mboh tswanza mohnoh reh dehreh. Mbohroh meh de tsifa nana mi ba nnoh, meh buti bleh noh la ti gyuruna nnoh ti yi aki abibi amohnoh ta, ti ba bu tufa nnoh Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene, ata nza a lisa inza tasa inzi, tasa agbugba amwo, tasa za awumu mboh nza ma a yama nimeh amoh. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ni kiri, Nnoh tana ata kyangwri mboh la mata a tufa akeki amoh mboh ika ata nza ma a kira reh. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Dehreh za, a leke ta tsana ikpi a ŋoh kpeh, tsifa la ka a lisa alindeh, ka nga noh awi anyi inza tasa yohroh awumu irya mboh na ameh amoh mboh; a ka nga reh irya gaga tasa ta a gya johjoh ma agohsoh ambohroh gaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Na tsifa amboh ata reh dehreh, amboh ble tsifa nana Nnoh reh ma a wina ha duma mboh reh mata a de awumu ngǝnga ata fa iwoaye mboh reh a ba kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Yahudawa amboh anyi neh maka anyi Antakiya tasa Ikoniya a ba, maka a leh a landa duma mboh reh. Maka a dadafa Ablusu maka akpi ŋoh a na nyina akpo afiya reh, maka a bleh amoh la ha kǝ kwo. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Amboh tufa mboh reh nza maka a dohsohna a goh ŋoh, a ka a hinga ka a gyuru a na a ŋoh nimeh akpo afiya agba reh. ka a te na nerebi Barnaba mboh ma Abitrusu maka a na amoh Darbe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Barnaba Tasa Abitrusu Maka Gyuru Na Amoh Antakiya Ma Suriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Ablusu tasa Barnaba nza maka ahwra tsifa nana a bleh ma ikpi Yeso reh, ma a huru vara kyangwri mboh ma Darbe maka bu amboh tufa mboh. Mata ka a gyuru a ba amoh Listira, tasa Ikoniya tasa Antakiya ata a bu ma Bisidiya <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Maka lisa nga wuwana ma amboh tufa mboh reh, mata akpi mboh ashotoh la mata a shi na wuwana ma ikpi nimeh nga agohsoh. &lt;&lt;Meh nati wa iya gaga kanga feh meh si niye nimeh akpo afiya Nnoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Ablusu tasa Barnaba maka a seh agbugba kyangwri mboh amboh tufa mboh ma ida Nnoh reh, nimeh kwere tasa de aniye amoh reh,maka a fira mboh nga Ada ata mboh nza ma a kira na a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Nza maka a hehndeh a treh Bisidiya, maka aniye Famfiliya, <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />tasa nza maka bleh tsifa Nnoh a treh ma Ferga, maka a tamba a na amoh Ataliya,<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Nza anyi ma huru reh, maka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo a ba amoh Antakiya, atsi ata mata ka kwere Nnoh la, lisa alindeh Nnoh reh ta a sumu mboh nimeh ndohmoh maa a lisa a treh reh. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Nza maka ba Antakiya reh, maka a dohsohna ma ida Nnoh ma akpo anyimbehreh maka bleh nambri andromboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa tsifa amoh tasa tsifa ata nza a vuru aki ma amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, mata sa tsifa reh a kira. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Maka a tuma a huru a yanda mboh ma amboh tufa mboh reh.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Tuma Agbugba Mboh ma Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Mgbiri kyangwri amboh anyi ma anyi Yahudiya a ba Antakiya, maka a leh a tsana amboh tufa mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ma shimba nnoh kpa tswanza akpi Musa nza a bu reh kpeh, ni nati hunji noh nvara.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Ablusu tasa Barnaba maka a leh a hwa aniye na tsifa kyangwri mboh reh, maka a gyuru a kohnoh a nza la mata a tohmoh Ablusu tasa Barnaba tasa mgbiri mboh ma Antakiya la mata a na Urushalima, mata a nana a nza agbugba kyangwri mboh tasa amboh ble tsifa nana mboh ma ikpi tsifa reh.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Amboh tufa mboh Nnoh mboh reh maka a wa mboh a gya ma aki, maka a na amoh, maka a gǝga a te ma Finikiya tasa Samariya, maka a leh tsifa ma ikpi Amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh nza ma a gyuruna a ba na Nnoh reh, tsifa reh ka a de nana agohsoh a ba ma amboh tufa mboh reh gaga. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Nza maka a ba Urushalima reh, amboh tufa Nnoh mboh, tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh, tasa amboh ble tsifa nana mboh reh maka a sa amboh ivoh afri, Ablusu tasa Barnaba maka a bleh andromboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa ma aki amoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Mgbiri amboh tufa mboh reh neh ma a bu na atita ata Farisiyawa mboh reh, ma a hinga a shi ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a nati shimba kpa ma amboh tufa mboh amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh kanga, tasa za mata a de mboh na wuwana la mata a tufa akpi Musa reh&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Amboh sa tohmoh nana a bleh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh maka a dohsohna mata a nza luhu ata areh. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Nza maka a rifa a nana reh a treh, Abitrusu ka a de a hinga a shi a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ambohroh mboh, ni wina noh la na kpikpi reh Nnoh tana a seh meh anyi nimeh amohnoh la, meh ti hwra tsifa nana reh bleh ma amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, la mata a sehreh mata a sa tsifa reh a kira. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Nnoh, ata nza a wina agohsoh mboh reh nambri, a bleh tsifa ma ikpi amoh, ta nga mboh huru zanana, tswanza ta ka nga reh za reh. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />A sohroh a tsana la mbohroh reh meh bu tseh na amoh kpeh, ka a hwara agohsoh amoh mboh, tsifa la ma a bu na nga agohsoh, <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Nza bu dehreh, a bu lele feh ni leh tsara Nnoh nza noh ma aki ata nza ma a gu awumu agba a gya ma a seh amboh tufa mboh, ata mbohroh tasa adada ambohroh meh ti bu na wuwana ata wina gu kpeh? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />mbohroh meh sa tsifa reh kira la, a bu ma aki lisa alindeh Ada Yeso reh meh ti hunji nvara, tswanza mboh za nza ma a hunji reh. <verse eid="ACT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Duma mboh reh nambri maka bu gbalala ma, nza ma a leh a sehreh Barnaba tasa Ablusu atsi leh bleh mboh tsifa ndohmoh ŋara aniye ata Nnoh nza a lisa ma aki amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Nza maka a treh tsifa amoh reh, Yakubu ka atsifa na amoh za la, &lt;&lt;Sehreh meh noh, atsimya mboh tasa asra amya mboh! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Siman ka a tsana mboh tsifa ata Nnoh nza a jiji a tsana kira ŋoh na Amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, ma aki ata nza a gu kyangwri amboh anyi nimeh isa a ŋoh la mata bu kyangwri a ŋoh amboh. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Ata areh a ba yehlehleh na tsifa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh mboh reh, ata nza bu ŋa gyaa la:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Ada reh ka a bleh la, &lt;A teh shidi meh nati gyuru ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">meh ti ba bu gyuru mina afiya ma Dawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">meh nati gyuru mina nyi ma hwa a ŋoh reh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">meh nati mina ta a gyuru a wuwana yama.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />La mgbiri kyangwri nza ma a bleh a hwa ma inziyo reh mata a fa meh, mya Ada.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh ata mya nza ni fi mboh nimeh isa amya reh.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Ada reh a bleh dehreh, a bleh tsifa mboh reh a kate anyi jiji reh.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yakubu neh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza amya reh a zohhoh meh ti wa aniye ma amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh nza ma gyuruna a ba amoh na Nnoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Nza bu dehreh, meh ti ŋa amgbasho bleh mboh la, mata a sohroh a rya irya abibi ata nza a nati a de mboh a te abibi kpeh, tsifa la maka nga ma nnoh akǝkehreh mboh, tasa za mata a sohroh leh ahohndoh kpeh, tasa za mata a sohroh a rya iwoaye ata nza ma a de a kama agba kpeh, ha iwo na imya kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Tsana Musa reh, tama ka a bleh mboh na kiri nimeh dida Nnoh Yahudawa mboh reh ma ibi asabar, tama ka ahwra tsifa reh a bleh mboh ma akpokpo atsifi reh nambri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A ŋa Amgbasho A na na amboh Tufa Mboh Amboh Ata Nza ma A bu Yahudawa Mboh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Neh amboh ble tsifa nana Yeso reh tasa agbugba amboh ida Nnoh, kawa amboh tufa mboh reh nambri, maka a tuma a seh kyangwri amoh mboh tasa maka a tohmoh mboh a ka a na Antakiya mboh ma Ablusu tasa Barnaba. Maka a seh kyangwri afri ata amboh tufa mboh maka nga mboh agba reh, Yahuda nza maka a fi ŋoh la Barsaba tasa Sila, <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />maka a tohmoh amgbasho ata areh a na mboh:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">&lt;&lt;Amboh sa tohmoh nana Nnoh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh, tasa atsi anzoh mboh, meh tohmoh la mata atsifa na amohnoh atsi ambohroh mboh Amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, nza ni bu noh ma Antakiya tasa Suriya, Kilikiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />mbohroh meh sehreh la mgbiri ambohroh mboh ma a leh atsifa a kputu nnoh agohsoh, ma a leh a de noh a chakafa, mbohroh neh meh sohroh bleh mboh la ma a lisa dehreh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Nza bu dehreh, mbohroh meh kira nambri ma ambohroh, la meh ti seh mgbiri kyangwri tohmoh mboh ba na amohnoh. Ma a nati a ba mboh ma a zizi iza ambohroh Barnaba tasa Ablusu, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />mboh nza ma nga fene amoh tsifa isa Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi reh. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Nza bu dehreh mbohroh meh tohmoh Yahuda tasa Sila ba na amohnoh, la mata a ba ba a lisa a bleh noh tsifa ata mbohroh nza meh ŋa ba nnoh reh na aniye amoh. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />A zohhoh ma huru zanana tasa mbohroh za meh nza la a zohhoh reh, la meh ti sohroh nga nnoh iya gaga ata nza a gǝga a keh awumu amboh ata areh kpeh: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />kama rya nnoh iwo ata nza ma a lisa ma nnoh akǝkehreh reh kpeh, ha ti rya iwo na imya, tasa za la ha ti rya iwoaye ata nza ma a de a kama agba, tasa ndohmoh hende leh ahohndoh. Nza ni de noh ikpi amohnoh ti lisa nnoh awumu amboh areh kpeh, wohroh ni lisa noh andromboh ata mya nza ni kira reh. Meh ta nnoh alindeh.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Kyangwri mboh reh maka a tohmoh mboh ka a na Antakiya, ma a huru maka a dohsoh amboh tufa mboh reh ma akpo anyimbehreh tasa maka nga mboh amgbasho reh. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Kyangwri mboh nza maka a bleh amgbasho reh, maka a nza nana ni wuwa agohsoh ata nza ma a hunji reh. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yahuda tasa Sila, mboh na ikpi amoh ma a bu amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh mboh, tama a leh a bleh amboh tufa mboh tsifa mboh gaga ata nga mboh wuwa agohsoh. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Nza maka a tuma a yanda ma a huru shidi, amboh tufa mboh reh maka ata mboh avoh la mata a na alindeh, maka a gyuru a na amoh na amboh nza ma a tohmoh mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Sila neh ka a kira ŋoh ta ka a kasa ma a huru. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Ablusu tasa Barnaba neh maka a treh a yama ma Antakiya, ma a huru mboh tasa mgbiri gaga maka a tsana tasa maka ahwra tsifa nana Ada reh a bleh.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu Mboh ma Barnaba ma A gafana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ibi anyi neh, Ablusu ka a bleh ma Barnaba la,&lt;&lt;Ba turoh meh ti gyuru na na ambohroh mboh ma akpokpo afiya fya mboh reh nambri, ma a huru meh ti hwra tsifa Ada reh bleh, tasa za meh ti nza mboh la ha ma a tuma alindeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barnaba tana a kira la ŋoh ta a wa Ayohana, nza maka a fi ŋoh la Markus za reh a de. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Ablusu neh ka a nza la a zohhoh la ŋoh ta a wa Markus reh a de kpeh, tsifa la ŋoh tana ata mboh ma akpo afiya Famfiliya, tasa za ka a leke rya tohmoh ta a te ndohmoh na amoh. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Maka a leh a hwa aniye ata wuwana ŋoh, maka a gafa na na itoh amoh. Barnaba ka a gu Markus maka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh a na amoh Sayifurus, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Ablusu neh ka a wa Sila a de a na a ŋoh, amboh tufa mboh maka a bleh la lisa alindeh Ada ta sumu mboh. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Maka a na amoh aki suriya tasa kilikiya, maka a leh nga wuwana ma amboh tufa ma a huru.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoti A na Na Ablusu mboh ma Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Ablusu ka a ba Darbe tasa za ka a ba Listira, wohroh a bu atsi ata kyangwri tufa Yeso anyi nza a yama reh isa a ŋoh a bu Timoti. Akre za tana ka a lisa yehlehleh, ŋoh tana a bu afya Yahudiya, alehmeh neh tana a bu kyangwri Helenawa. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Amboh tufa mboh nambri nza ma a bu ma listira tasa Ikoniya reh, ma a leh a bleh tsifa ma ikpi Timoti alindeh. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Ablusu tana a kira la Timoti ta a wa ŋoh a na hende, ŋoh ka a shimba ŋoh kpa. A lisa dehreh tsifa la Yahudawa mboh nza ma a tuma ma a huru reh, tama a wina nambri ma amoh la alehmeh tana bu kyangwri Helenawa. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Nza maka hende ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh reh, maka a bleh ma amboh tufa mboh andromboh ata amboh ble tsifa nana mboh, tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh ma Urushalima a kira reh,akeki ata nza ma a kira ma ikpi reh, maka a bleh ma amboh tufa mboh reh la ma a tufa mboh. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Nza a bu dehreh, amboh tufa mboh reh maka a hunji wuwana a lisa a keh nimeh nga agohsoh amoh, tasa maka a leh a ba gaga na tutu,<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu A nza Wono Ma Ikpi Makidoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Ablusu tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh maka a hehndeh ka a na akpokpo afiyafiya Firijiya tasa Galatiyawa mboh, tsifa la Huru zanana tana a kira mboh la mata ahwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh ma akpo afiya Asiya reh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Nza maka a ba ma hohnoh inzi Misiya mboh reh, maka kira la mata aniye a na akpo afiya Bitiniya, Huru Yeso reh neh a sohroh nga mboh kira kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Maka a gǝga mgba inzi Misiya, tasa maka a tamba a na amoh Toruwas. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Na shini wohroh Ablusu ka a te wono la ŋoh wa a nza kyangwri Makidoniya anyi a shi a leh a kwere ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ba anzoh akpo afiya Makidoniya reh ti ba bu shingireh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Ablusu nza ka a nza wono reh, mbohroh meh kǝ de hinga ma hwana anyimbehreh kǝ na ambohroh Makidoniya, tsifa la meh wina Nnoh a fi reh la meh ti na ni hwra tsifa nana bleh kyangwri mboh ma a huru.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lidiya A gyuruna A tufa Nnoh Ma Filibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Meh kǝ hinga nimeh gbogblondo amwo nyi Toruwas tasa meh kǝ gǝga na mbohroh Samotiras, ibi na afri neh meh kǝ na ambohroh Niyafolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Anyi ma a huru mbohroh meh kǝ te hwa na na ambohroh akpo afiya Filibi nza a bu ma akpo inzi Makidoniya, ata nza a bu Romawa mboh nza ma a de Agohmoh kpra Agohmoh reh. meh kǝ te ibi vara ma a huru.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Ibi Asabar nza ka a ba, mbohroh meh kǝ kate yi akpo afiya reh ta, meh kǝ na ambohroh akachi fini, kohnoh ambohroh reh la atsi kwere Nnoh Yahudawa mboh reh a yama ma a huru, mbohroh meh kǝ tuma tsifa na ifiya mboh amboh ata nza ma a bu ma a huru reh. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />anyimbehreh nimeh amboh ata nza a tuma a sehreh tsifa ambohroh reh, a bu afiya anyi isa a ŋoh a bu Lidiya, tana anyi Tayatira tana ka a rifa na akuri ŋana mboh ata nza bu wi ma, tasa za tana ka krumusu Nnoh, Ada ka a vuru ŋoh agohsoh la ta a sehreh tsifa Ablusu reh. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Nza maka a wra batisma ma Lidiya tasa mgbiri kyangwri mboh nza ma a tuma ma afiya a ŋoh reh, a ka a kwere reh la, &lt;&lt;Ba ti ba bu tuma noh ma afiya amya, nza ni hwra noh akpi amya la meh nga kira na Ada reh.&gt;&gt; A ka kwere reh mbohroh meh kǝ kira.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A de Ablusu Tasa Sila A fi Ma Ida ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ibi anyi mbohroh meh kǝ buti na ambohroh atsi kwere Nnoh, mbohroh meh kǝ dohsohna ma ahwra anyifa anyi ata nza a bu na huru agugu ata nza a bu na wuwana ata ka a shingi ŋoh ta a nza tohmwo a wina. Ka a hunji hungroh gaga ma agba ma atsi nza tohmwo a bleh reh. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Anyifa reh ka a leh a tufa reh tasa Ablusu, ta ka a leh a te kpiriga la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri amboh areh ma a bu ahwra Nnoh ata nza ma nga ŋoh agba a keh reh! Ma a bleh noh aki ata nza ni nati hunji noh nvara reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Ka a leh a lisa dehreh a gu ibi vara. Ablusu ka a kputu agohsoh a ŋoh gaga, a ka a gyuruna a bleh Ma huru agugu reh la, &lt;&lt;Nimeh isa Yeso Kristi kate nyi ma itoh afiya reh!&gt;&gt; Ma a huru heri ka a kate ata ŋoh.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Amboh anyifa mboh reh nza maka nza la aki gya agohsoh hunji hungroh amoh reh wa ka a nati shimbana, maka a de Ablusu tasa Sila maka a kpikpi mboh ka na kpakpranda rifa awumu na agbugba amboh hwra akpi mboh. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Maka a de mboh ka a na ma tohmoh agbugba amboh hwra akpi mboh reh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri amboh areh ma bu Yahudawa mboh, ma a leh a fa akpi ma inzi ambohroh. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Maka a leh a tsana lomo amboh anyi tse na lomo ambohroh, mbohroh meh bu Kyangwri Romawa mboh, a zohhoh mbohroh meh ti sa lomo ata areh ha timi tufa mboh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Duma mboh reh maka a ba ba a goh Ablusu tasa Sila na agba ma amoh,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">amboh hwra akpi mboh reh maka a hwahwashi akuri Ablusu tasa Sila a ŋoh tasa za maka a bleh la ma a mla mboh. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Nza maka a mla mboh gaga reh, maka a fira mboh a were a na ma ida ka, maka a bleh kyangwri sumu ida ka reh la ta a sumu mboh alindeh. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Ŋoh nza ka a sehreh dehreh reh, a ka a fira mboh a were a na ma ida ka ata meh, ta ka a lafa hwana amoh mboh na agboto agbeh agbugba.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Na atsitsifi shini Ablusu tasa sila maka a leh a kwere Nnoh tasa za maka a leh a kpa amumu ariri Nnoh, tasa mgbiri amboh ata nza ma a ka mboh za reh maka a leh a sehreh mboh. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />A yanda kpeh inzi ka a zuzuna, chuhu ida ka reh za ka a zuzuna. Anida ida ka mboh reh maka a vuruna ma hwana anyimbehreh, rishi njehnjehreh nza ma a lafa amboh ka mboh reh maka a hingrena. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Kyangwri sumu ida ka nza ka a hinga anyi ma mla reh, ka a nza anida ida ka mboh reh ma bu vurunaa, ka a wrofo ambya gara a ŋoh la ŋoh ta a mla ikpi a ŋoh a kwo, a gu a ŋoh la amboh ata nza ma a ka mboh ma a kate a gbo. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ablusu ka a vuru agba a ŋoh mama a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kama te andromboh abibi ma ikpi anzoh kpeh! mbohroh meh yama ma mareh nambri ma ambohroh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Kyangwri nza a sumu ida ka reh ka a fi la ma a de shira a ba ŋoh, ka aniye a na nimeh, ka a na na a nyiri a hwa a kpokprona ma hwana Ablusu tasa sila. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Ka a de mboh a kate a ba ma inziyo ta ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Agbugba mboh, a bu umbo meh nati lisa meh ti hunji nvara?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Sa tsifa Ada Yeso reh kira, ni nati hunji nvara, nnoh tasa mara anzoh mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Maka ahwra tsifa Ada reh a bleh ŋoh tasa mgbiri amboh ata nza ma bu ma afiya a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Na ameh ata wohroh ni shini kyangwri sumu da ika reh ka a fira mboh a na na a hwara ibla amoh mboh reh, ŋoh tasa atsini mboh nambri maka a wra mboh batisma. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Kyangwri sumu ida ka reh ka a wa Ablusu tasa Sila ka a na afiya ŋoh, ta ka nga mboh rya la ma a rya. Ŋoh tasa amboh afiya a ŋoh mboh ma a bu na johjoh gaga, tsifa la mboh reh ma a sa tsifa Nnoh a kira.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Ibi nza ka a yanda, kyangwri hwra akpi Romawa mboh reh ka a tohmoh amboh lafa chuhu yira a ŋoh mboh a ka a na na kyangwri sumu ida ka na tsifa wuwana la, &lt;&lt;Ta kyangwri mboh reh mata a na amoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Kyangwri sumu amboh ida ka mboh reh ka a bleh Ablusu la, &lt;&lt;amboh hwra akpi mboh reh ma a tohmoh a ba la nnoh tasa Sila ma ata nnoh avoh la ti na amohnoh. Nza a bu dehreh, kate ti na nnoh amohnoh, na nnoh alindeh. <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ablusu neh ka a bleh ma amboh lafa chuhu yira mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a mla reh ma inziyo ma a sohroh ahwra reh akpi kpeh, mbohroh meh bu kyangwri Romawa mboh, maka a fira reh a were a na ma ida ka. nehnehreh ma a kira la mata ata reh meh ti na ambohroh gbalala? A nati bu dehreh kpeh! Mboh agbugba kyangwri Romawa mboh reh ma a ba na ikpi amoh mata a wa reh a kate.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />amboh lafa chuhu yira mboh reh maka a gyuru a na na a bleh ma agbugba kyangwri Romawa mboh tsifa reh, nza maka a sehreh la Ablusu tasa Sila ma bu Romawa za reh maka nyiri. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ma a ba ba a kwere mboh, feh ma sa ka a fira a kate anyi ma ida ka reh, maka a bleh mboh la, ma ata akpo afiya reh. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Ablusu tasa sila nza ma a kate anyi ma ida ka reh, maka a na afiya lidiya. Ma a huru reh maka a dohsohna na amboh tufa mboh, maka a bleh tsifa ata wuwa agohsoh a treh fya ma sa ka a na amoh.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ablusu Tasa Sila Ma Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Nza maka a gǝga na akpo afiya Amfibolis tasa Afolloniya, maka a ba aniye ma akpo afiya anyi maka a fi la Tasalonika, ma atsi ata ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh a yama ma a huru. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Ablusu ka aniye a na na amoh tswanza nza ka a lisa reh, asabar atatoh ka a gu ka a na ka a leh a bleh mboh tsifa nimeh amgbasho, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Ka a leh tsana la ŋoh a tsana mboh a shimba la ŋoh ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh a nati a wa iya tasa ta a hinga anyi ma kwo. &lt;&lt;Yeso ata mya nza ni leh bleh noh reh a bu ŋoh nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh,&gt;&gt; ka a bleh la. <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Mgbiri Yahudawa mboh reh maka kira na tsifa Ablusu tasa maka tufa Ablusu tasa sila. Mgbiri Helenawa mboh gaga amboh nyiri Nnoh tasa agbugba fya mboh gaga za maka a tufa mboh.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Yahudawa mboh neh nza maka a te vene na Ablusu tasa Sila, maka a na na a hunji kyangwri amboh agohsoh abibi ma kpakpranda, maka a leh a fi akpi ma akpo afiya reh. Maka a gbo a na mgba afiya Yason maka a leh a fa Ablusu tasa Sila la tama a de mboh a ba ma tomo duma mboh. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Neh nza maka a nza mboh kpeh, maka a kpikpi Yason tasa mgbiri amboh tufa mboh reh ka a na ma tohmwo agbugba amboh hwra akpi mboh reh, maka a leh a fi mama la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri amboh reh nza ma a hehndeh a fi akpi a treh inziyo na agba ma reh ma a bu ma mareh, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Tasa Yason ka a sa mboh a gya ma afiya a ŋoh. Nambri ma amoh ma a leh a sehhrehneh tsifa Agohmoh agba Kaisar, ma a leh a bleh la, Agohmoh anyi a yama sa a ŋoh a bu Yeso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Kyangwri kpra Agohmoh reh tasa agbugba kpra Agohmoh mboh reh nza ma a ka a sehreh tsifa reh, agohsoh amoh mboh ka a hinga. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Maka a sohroh ata Yason tasa amoh mboh reh kpeh, ma a sa hungroh ma ivoh amwo feh masa ata mboh avoh.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amboh Sa Tohmoh Nana Yeso A bleh Ma Biriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Shini nza ka ba, amboh tufa mboh reh maka ata ivoh ma Ablusu tasa Sila na Biriya. Nza maka aniye ma a huru reh, maka aniye nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Nehnehreh Yahudawa amboh nza ma a yama ma Biriya reh, ma a keh amboh nza ma a yama ma Tasalonika reh agohsoh alilehndeh, la mboh maka a sa tsifa reh ivoh afri, tama a na na a gyuru a leh a tufa amgbasho reh a nza ni tutu, mata a lisa a nza la ha tsifa reh a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Nza ka a bu dehreh nimeh Yahudawa mboh reh gaga maka a sa tsifa reh a kira, tasa mgbiri ifiya Helenawa mboh, ifiya alilehndeh amboh tasa tsitsifa amwo mboh gaga. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Yahudawa mboh Nza ma a yama ma Tasalonika nza maka a sehreh la Ablusu a leh ahwra akpi tsifa Nnoh ma Biriya, maka a na ma a huru nza, maka a leh ata duma mboh reh na aniye za maka a leh a fira agohsoh amwo mboh a ka ma inza. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Ma huru heri, amboh tufa mboh reh maka a bleh Ablusu la ta na ŋoh akachi fini, Sila tasa Timoti neh maka a treh a tuma na Biriya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a wa Ablusu a gya ma aki reh, ma a de ŋoh a na Atina. Nza maka a nati a ba amoh reh, Ablusu ka a tohmoh mboh na doka a ba na Sila tasa Timoti la ma a na na a hunji ŋoh na gbugbo, maka a de a hinga a na.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu Ma Atina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Ablusu nza ka a buti bana Sila tasa Timoti ma Atina, huru a ŋoh a kputuna gaga ŋoh nza a nza la ma a fira nnoh ata lisa na ivoh a hama atsifi. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />La ŋoh reh ka a na nimeh ida Nnoh Yahudawa mboh reh atsi leh bleh tsifa Yeso reh ma Yahudawa mboh, tasa mgbiri Helenawa mboh nza amboh tufa Nnoh. Ka a leh atsi bleh ma kyangwri mboh tsifa ni tutu reh ma kpakpranda. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Amboh lomo Abikuriyawa tasa Sitokiyawa mboh maka a ba ba a leh a rifa a na na na Ablusu. Mgbiri maka luhu la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri sesenge ata areh a ka a leh a bleh la umbo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Mgbiri ma a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu a tswanza a leh a bleh tsifa ma ikpi nnoh sehneh mboh ata ma a lisa na ivoh ata a bu ambohroh kpeh.&gt;&gt;Ma a bleh dehreh la Ablusu reh a leh a bleh tsifa nana ma ikpi Yeso tasa za hinga a ŋoh anyi ma kwo. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Ma a gu ŋoh ka a ba ma atsi dohsohna ma agbohgboh Arasa, atsi ata amboh hwra akpi mboh maa a dohsohna, ma a huru maka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;A bu tsifa afeh ni nati gyuru bleh reh? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Ma a de tsifa afehfeh amboh anyi a ba ata meh hehreh sehreh kpeh. Mbohroh meh kira meh ti wina tsifa ata noh nza ni leh bleh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Kyangwri Atinawa mboh nambri tasa achifi mboh nza ma a tuma ma a huru ma a keh kira mata a sehreh tsifa afeh mata atsifa ma ikpi, a keh mgbiri.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Ablusu ka a hinga a shi na a hwana ma tohmoh agbugba amboh hwra akpi mboh reh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh kyangwri Atinawa mboh reh, meh nza la mohnoh reh ni bu noh amboh kira tufa Nnoh ma akeki vara. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Mya nza ni leh hende ma akpo afiya reh, meh nza awumu ata nza ni leh krumusu mboh nnoh reh, meh nza atsi sangra imya ata hwara vari nza ma a ŋa la, &lt;Nnoh ata ma a wina ŋoh kpeh&gt; Ata nza ni leh krumusu ŋoh reh, Nnoh ata nza ni wina noh kpeh nza ni tufa nnoh reh, meh leh bleh noh tsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Nnoh nza a lisa inziyo areh tasa awumu mboh nza ma a yama nimeh reh nambri, ŋoh bu Ada ata inza tasa ata inziyo reh, ŋoh ka a tuma nimeh afiya ata ma a lisa na ivoh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Nza a bu dehreh ma a fa la kyangwri ta a shingi ŋoh kpeh, a kira andromboh anyi na kyangwri kpeh, a bu ŋoh nza ka nga ma kyangwri fene, kawa inyo fene tasa awumu ata kyangwri a kira reh. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Anyi na kyangwri anyimbehreh nza a lisa kyangwri mboh gaga ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh reh nambri, la tama a tuma ma akpokpo atsifi mboh ma inziyo, nga mboh atsifi tasa ameh ata ma a nati a tuma reh. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Nnoh reh a lisa dehreh la mata a fa ŋoh, la ha mata a fa ŋoh a hunji, ŋoh a sohroh a bu gbugba na akyo ambohroh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />&lt;A bu na a ŋoh mbohroh meh bu na fene, meh ti yama meh ti leh hende tasa mbohroh ma bu kpi mbohroh&gt;A tswanza kyangwri kpa amumu anyi la,&lt;Mbohroh meh bu mara a ŋoh mboh.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Mbohroh nza meh bu alohsoh Nnoh reh, a zohhoh timi gu kanga la ha Nnoh reh a bu kpakpa hungroh ha kpakpa kpeh, ha yafa andromboh ata kyangwri nza a lisa na lomo a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ni kiri reh, Nnoh tana ka a te kohhroh na kpakpana ambohroh mboh, nehnehreh neh ŋoh a buti a bleh kyangwri mboh a treh atsifi la mata ata aki agugu amoh mboh. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Ŋoh kǝ gya ibi ata nza a nati a hwra akpi ma inziyo areh ni kohnoh yehlehleh ma aki kyangwri ata ŋoh nza a seh ŋoh reh. A tsana ata areh ma kyangwri mboh nambri ma aki ata ŋoh nza a yiri Yeso anyi ma kwo reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Nza maka a sehreh tsifa hinga kyangwri a gyuru anyi ma kwo reh, mgbiri maka a leh ayoho ŋoh, mgbiri neh maka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Meh kira meh ti gyuru sehreh tsifa areh za.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ma a huru Ablusu ka a yi mboh ata. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Kyangwri mboh mbimbi maka a ba a tufa Ablusu tasa maka a kira na ŋoh. Nimeh amoh tana a bu Diyonisiyusu, tasa afya anyi isa a ŋoh a bu Damaris, tasa mgbiri tswaa.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Ablusu ma Korinti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Ablusu nza ka atsifa ka a treh na agbugba mboh ma Atina a ka a na ŋoh korinti. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Ma a huru a ka a hunji kyangwri Yahudawa anyi, isa a ŋoh nza bu Akila, ŋoh reh a bu kyangwri Fontus. Akila mboh ma afya ŋoh Biriskila ma a hehreh a yanda nza ma anyi akpo afiya Italiya a ba reh, la Kalaudiyus a bleh la Yahudawa mboh ma ata akpo afiya Roma. Ablusu ka a na na amoh. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Akila mboh ma afiya reh ta maka a lisa dasa tasa ŋoh Ablusu za. A ka a tuma na amoh maka a leh a te ndohmoh reh agba anyi. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Ibi asabar nza ka a ba reh, ŋoh Ablusu ka a leh a tsana ma kyangwri amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh nimeh ida dohsohna reh.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Sila tasa Timoti mboh nza maka anyi makidoniya ka a ba amoh, Ablusu ka za a lisa dasa reh za kpeh a ka a gu ikpi a ŋoh a gya atsi bleh tsifa Nnoh, a ka a leh a bleh Yahudawa mboh la a bu Yeso nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Yahudawa mboh reh neh maka a sa tsifa Ablusu reh a leke tama a gyuru a leh a kya ŋoh. Nza ka a nza dehreh ka akpokpo huru ka a were mboh neh ta ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Vari ata imya amohnoh ta ka a bu ma agba amohnoh! Mya meh za bu na kpakpana za kpeh. Nza a gu anyi andrehmeh meh nati bleh tsifa Nnoh ma amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Ablusu ka a yi atsi dohsohna amoh reh ata ta ka a na ŋoh anida afya kyangwri anyi isa ŋoh a bu Titiyus Yustus, a bu kyangwri krumusu Nnoh, afiya a ŋoh a bu ma nda ida Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kirisbus za, a bu agba amboh de ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh, a ka a nga agohsoh a ŋoh ma Nnoh, ŋoh tasa kyangwri mgba afiya a ŋoh nambri. Korintiyawa amboh anyi gaga nza maka a sehreh tsifa Ablusu reh, maka a nga agohsoh ma Nnoh, maka a wra mboh batisma.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Na shini anyi Ada ka atsifa na Ablusu ma wono la,&lt;&lt;Kama nyiri kpeh; rya tohmoh na tsifa, kama bu gbalala kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Mya reh meh bu na anzoh. Tasa akyo a nati a shwa nnoh ha ta a lisa nnoh andromboh kpeh, la mya meh bu na kyangwri mboh gaga ma akpo afiya reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Ablusu ka a tuma ma a huru a gu ahushi anyimbehreh na mgbiri atsi leh tsana mboh tsifa Nnoh reh.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ameh ata Galiyo neh ta ka bu Agohmoh agba ma akpo afiya Akaya, Yahudawa mboh maka a dohsoh aniye neh maka a gyuru a de Ablusu a na ma tohmoh amboh hwra akpi mboh. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Maka a bleh ma Galiyo la&lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata areh a kira ta a bleh Kyangwri mboh la ma a tufa Nnoh ma aki anyi tse ata akpi nza a ha reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Ablusu waka a nati tsifa neh, Galiyo ka a bleh ma Yahudawa mboh reh la,&lt;&lt;A bu kpakpana ha andromboh abibi atamaa ŋoh nza a lisa reh, ti bleh noh meh ti sere nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />ata areh neh a bu rifa a nana ma ikpi tsifa tasa isa mboh, tasa tsana amohnoh, mohnoh kǝ tsifa nnoh ma itoh amohnoh, mya meh nati wina hwra noh akpi ata areh za kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ka a katsi mboh a kate anyi ma ida hwra akpi reh. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Nambri ma amoh maka a de Sostanus, agba amboh de ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, maka a mla ŋoh ma tohmoh ida hwra akpi reh. Galiyo neh a kama a lisa andromboh ma ikpi kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu a gyuru a na ŋoh Antakiya Tasa Suriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Ablusu a tuma a yanda shidi ma korinti, a treh feh sa ka a hinga ata amboh tufa mboh ta ka aniye ma gbogblondo amwo ka a na ŋoh akpo afiya Suriya mboh ma Biriskila tasa Akila. Neh kǝ hehreh a hinga kpeh, Ablusu ka a fa shina ikpi a ŋoh ma Kankiriya, ata areh a tsana la ŋoh tana a gu faku na Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Maka a ba ba aniye ma Afisa, ma a huru Ablusu ka a yi Biriskila tasa Akila ata ma a huru. Ŋoh ni ikpi a ŋoh ka aniye ka a na a ŋoh ida Nnoh ta ka a na na a leh atsifa mboh ma Yahudawa mboh. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Maka kwere ŋoh la ta tuma na amoh a te ibi afri, ŋoh neh ka a kira kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Ŋoh neh nza ka a na a ŋoh, a ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza Nnoh a kira la meh ti gyuru ba reh, meh nati gyuru ba na amohnoh&gt;&gt; Ŋoh ka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh a na a ŋoh Afisa. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Nza ka a ba ba aniye ma Kaisariya reh, a ka a na na a hehndeh atsifa na amboh tufa mboh reh a treh feh sa a na ŋoh Antakiya.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Nza ka a tuma a yanda shidi ma Antakiya, Ablusu ka a hinga a leh a hehndeh a treh tsifa ma akpokpo afiyafiya Galatiyawa tasa Firijiya mboh, a ka a leh a nga wuwa agohsoh ma amboh tufa mboh ma a huru.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />A yanda kpeh Yahudawa anyi isa a ŋoh a bu Afolosu a bu kyangwri nza ni Alekzandiriya, a ba Afisa. A bu kyangwri a wina amgbasho gaga, a wina lomo amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Ma a tsana ŋoh akeki tufa Nnoh mboh reh nambri, tasa ka a kira ta a leh atsifa gaga na kyangwri mboh ma ikpi Yeso, ŋoh neh a wina wra batisma Ayohana tsene ma. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Ka a jiji a leh atsifa ni wuwa agohsoh ma atsi dohsohna amoh Nnoh reh. Biriskila tasa Akila nza maka sehreh ŋoh reh, maka afi ŋoh la ta a wa mboh a na afiya amoh, la mata a na na lisa a tsana ŋoh aki Nnoh reh yehlehleh.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Afolo nza a ka a nati a na a ŋoh Akaya, amboh tufa mboh maka a nga ŋoh wuwa agohsoh tasa za maka a ŋa amgbasho a na na amboh tohmoh Nnoh mboh la mata a sa ŋoh alindeh. Nza ka a na na aniye ma a huru reh, a shingi amboh ata nza ma a gya agohsoh na Nnoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ŋoh ka rya tohmoh nimeh tsifa a ŋoh na Yahudawa mboh ma tohmoh duma mboh, a ka a leh a bleh mboh anyi nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh la Yeso bu ŋoh ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Ablusu ma Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Na ameh ata Afolosu ta ka a bu ma Korinti, Ablusu ka a hehndeh a treh akpokpo afiyafiya mboh reh ma Afisa, na a huru ka a na a hunji amboh tufa Yeso amboh anyi, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh ni sa nnoh huru zanana ameh ata mohnoh nza ni sa tsifa kira nnoh reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Maka a kira la,&lt;&lt;Uwa, mbohroh meh heri sehreh la ha huru zanana andromboh anyi a yama kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Ablusu ka luhu la, &lt;&lt;A ka bu wra baptisma ika atamaa ma a za a wra Nnoh reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Maka a kira la, &lt;&lt;A bu biroh wra batisma ika ata Ayohana a ŋoh,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Ablusu ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Wra batisma Ayohana a bu wra batisma ata meh nati gyuruna ta agugu ambohroh mboh. Ka a bleh kyangwri mboh reh la mata a kira na ata nza a nati a ba ma nyina a ŋoh reh, a ka bu ŋoh Yeso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Nza maka a sehreh dehreh, maka a wra mboh batisma nimeh sa Ada Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Ablusu nza ka a gu ivoh a ŋoh a ka ma ikpi amoh,Huru zanana ka a tamba ma ikpi amoh mboh, maka a leh atsifa na arimi atsetse tasa maka a leh a bleh andromboh ata nza a nati a bu ma tohmoh za. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Ma a bu mboh kyangwri agrumavoh a hwa afri nambri ma amoh.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Ablusu ka aniye a na ida Nnoh ta ka a leh a bleh mboh tsifa Nnoh reh ni wuwa agohsoh a tswa atsi gu nara atatoh, ka a leh a bleh mboh tsifa akpo afiya Nnoh ata inza reh kwikwi. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Mgbiri neh ma a sa tsifa Ablusu reh a kira kpeh, ma a leke na tsifa ata nza ma a leh a bleh mboh ma ikpi Yeso reh. amboh mgbiri neh maka a leh a bleh tsifa abibi ma aki Ada Yeso reh, ŋoh Ablusu a za atsifa za kpeh ma atsi dohsohna reh, a ka a na ŋoh mboh ma amboh tufa mboh reh ta ka a leh a tsana mboh nimeh ida tsana reh ma Tiranus. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Ablusu a gu ahushi afri atsi leh tsana kyangwri mboh reh, na ameh wohroh reh, kyangwri mboh nza ma a yama ma akpo afiya Asiya reh maka a sehreh tsifa Ada reh, akawa Yahudawa mboh tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nnoh ka a leh a shingi Ablusu ka a leh a lisa agbugba ndohmoh mboh. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Nza ka a bu dehreh, nza hwashi kuri ha kuri a ŋoh a bara akyo bishi maka a hunji wuwana, huru agugu reh ka ata mboh.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Yahudawa amboh anyi ma a hehndeh a leh a treh atsifi. Maka a leh a katsi huru agugu a kate ma itoh kyangwri mboh.Mgbiri amoh ma a kira mata a gu isa Ada Yeso a leh a te ndohmoh reh ni wohroh. Maka a leh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh nimeh isa Yeso ata Ablusu nza a leh atsifa ma ikpi reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Nimeh amoh mara tsifa amboh anyi ma a bu mboh atehrehkifi na anyi, ma bu mara agba Firist Yahudawa anyi, Sa a ŋoh a bu Sikeba, nambri ma amwo maka a lisa dehreh. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ibi-anyi huru agugu reh a ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Yeso mi wina, tasa za meh wina tsifa Ablusu, mohnoh nnoh neh ni kǝ bu noh anyi umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Kyangwri ata nza a bu na huru agugu reh ka a tsyumuna, ta ka a ka mboh, neh ta ka a keh wuwana amoh nambri. Ma a wa mla neh maka a gbo ata afiya reh na ngbigbi chuhu, tasa za maka a hunji ibla ma itoh amoh mboh.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Yahudawa mboh tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh, nza ma a tuma na Afisa nza maka a sehreh tsifa ata areh, nyiri ka a de mboh, maka a krumusu isa Ada Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Nimeh amoh gaga, amboh ata nza ma a sa tsifa Yeso a kira reh, maka a ba ba a leh a bleh kpakpana amoh mboh. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Kyangwri mboh gaga nza maka a te ndohmoh akagba mboh reh, maka a leh a fira amgbasho a soh amoh mboh reh ba ba afiya shira ma tohmoh duma mboh. Hungroh awumu a soh amoh mboh reh a bu kpakpa hungroh 50,000 <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Ma aki ata areh tsifa Ada ka a yangana te agba ta bu na wuwana.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Amboh areh nza maka a gǝga, Ablusu ka a gya ma agohsoh a ŋoh la, ŋoh wa nati na ŋoh Urushalima, a nati gǝga Makidoniya tasa Akaya. &lt;&lt;Nza meh na ma a huru reh, meh nati hende nza akpo afiya Romawa reh nambri kanga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Na ameh wohroh reh, Timoti tasa Erastus maka shingi Ablusu na ndohmoh a ŋoh. Ablusu ka a tohmoh a na Makidoniya neh ŋoh ta ka a kasa ma akpo afiya Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Na ameh wohroh reh agǝshi agba ka a hinga ma Afisa, la tsifa aki Ada Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Agǝshi reh a jiji a hinga ma ikpi kyangwri anyi isa a ŋoh a bu Dimitiriyus ata nza ka a te ndohmoh tandara na azurfa ka a lisa awumu mboh nza a stwanza ida nnoh amoh mboh ata maka a fi ŋoh la Artemis, ŋoh tasa amboh ndohmoh mboh reh maka a hunji firoh gaga. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Ka a fi mboh a gya ma akpo anyimbehreh tasa amboh te ndohmoh ika wohroh, a ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh kyangwri mboh ni wina noh la a bu ndohmoh tandara reh mbohroh meh hunji asabara na wohroh. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Mohnoh za ni nza ti sehreh noh andromboh ata Ablusu nza a leh a lisa reh, mohnoh ni sehreh noh tsifa a ŋoh reh. a bu ma akpo afiya Afisa tsene kpeh, tasa ma akpo afiya Asiya za, kyangwri gaga ma a kira tsifa Ablusu reh, a bleh mboh la nnoh ata ma a lisa ni ivoh reh a bu noh abibi. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Hwa agba a yama, ma a nati a nasa isa ndohmoh ambohroh reh. A bu wohroh ma tsehneh kpeh, a nati a mishi ida nnoh agba ata afya nnoh akehreh Artemis reh, a nati a bu andromboh za kpeh, tasa za ma a nati a lofo agba a ŋoh reh, ma a nati krumusu afya nnoh akehreh ma Asiya tasa inziyo reh nambri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Nza maka a sehreh ata areh, gofo ka a de mboh gaga, maka a vuru agba mama nambri ma amoh la,&lt;&lt;Agba a bu na anzoh nnoh Artemis ata Afisawa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />A mehheh neh Akpo afiya reh na agba ma amoh maka a leh a fi agǝshi neh maka a leh a gbo a na atsi dohsohna reh, maka a de Gayus tasa Aristarku, ma bu kyangwri Makidoniya mboh, a bu mboh nza ma a bu ziza hende Ablusu reh. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Ablusu a kira ta a na atsi ata duma mboh nza ma a dohsohna reh, amboh tufa mboh neh ma a kira kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Agbugba Romawa amboh anyi nza ma a yama ma a huru reh ma bu ziza Ablusu mboh. Ma a tohmoh a na ŋoh la, ta a kama a na atsi dohsohna reh za kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Kyangwri mboh nza ma a yama ma atsi dohsohna reh nambri ma amoh maka a leh a sesenge mama. Maka a leh a sesenge ma astetse. Mgbiri amoh mboh ma a wina andromboh ata nza a de mboh a na ma a huru reh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Yahudawa mboh maka a yi Alekzanda a fi ma tohmoh, ŋoh ka a gu ivoh ka a ka ma inza ta ka a bleh mboh la bu gbalala la; nnoh ta a lisa a bleh mboh tsifa. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Mboh neh nza maka a wina la Alekzanda reh a bu Yahudawa, maka a leh a vuru agba reh a nina nambri ma amoh ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Agba a bu anzoh nnoh kyangwri Artemis tasa Afisawa mboh!&gt;&gt;Maka a te dehreh a na hungroh nnoh afri.<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Ni trina ŋoh kyangwri ŋa ata akpo afiya reh ka a hwa duma mboh reh la ma bu gbalala, ka a bleh, la: &lt;&lt;Mohnoh kyangwri Afisa mboh! A bu kyangwri atamaa nza a wina la a bu Afisawa mboh maka a lisa a nza ida Nnoh agba ata Artemis, tasa ata kpakpa nza a hwa anyi ma inza kpeh? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Nza ka a bu dehreh, tsifa mboh reh ma a za bu ata ma a nati a tana za kpeh, lisa nza! ti gbo lisa andromboh abibi kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ni de noh kyangwri amboh reh ba nnoh ma mareh, ma a sohroh a te ayuhu andromboh ma ida Nnoh ha tama a kya nnoh ambohroh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Nza Dimitiriyus mboh ma amboh ndohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh, ma a kohnoh la akyo kǝ lisa mboh andromboh abibi. Nza ma a kohnoh dehreh reh, ma ata kyangwri hwra akpi ta a kohnoh a nza. Ida hwra akpi reh a yama inyo, tasa amboh hwra akpi za ma a yama, mohnoh de noh akpi amohnoh mboh na nnoh na amoh. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Nza andromboh anyi a yama ata ni kira ti tsifa ma ikpi za reh, a nati a zohhoh ta a bu ma tohmoh agbugba amboh hwra akpi mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Andrehmeh areh, duma ma a leh a sesenge a mlana. Agohmoh Romawa mboh a nati a sehreh andromboh ata nza bu reh. Ma a nati a bleh la meh lisa andromboh abibi. Meh nati wina bleh andromboh ata nza a de mlana reh a ba kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />ata areh a bu andromboh ata kyangwri ŋa Agohmoh nza a bleh duma mboh reh, la ma a na amoh afiya. nambri ma amoh maka a na amoh.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Ablusu A gyuru A na ŋoh Makidoniya Tasa Hellas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Agǝshi nza ka a kukuna reh, Ablusu ka a tohmoh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh tasa, nza ka a nga mboh wuwa agohsoh, ka a bleh mboh la ŋoh kǝ na ŋoh, ta ka a na ŋoh Makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Ka a hehndeh a treh akpokpo atsifi, tasa za ka leh a nga wuwa agohsoh ma kyangwri mboh na vara tsifa mboh. A treh feh sa ka aniye ma inzi Hellas. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Ablusu ka a te nara atatoh ma Hellas. Ibi-anyi ŋoh ka a nati a na ŋoh Suriya ma gbogblondo amwo. Ŋoh neh ka a sehreh la, Yahudawa amboh anyi ma a kira la mata a mla ŋoh kwo ma aki hende a ŋoh reh. Ŋoh neh ka a gyuru a gǝga aki Makidoniya a ba ŋoh Urushalima. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />amboh ata nza ma a wa ŋoh a gya ma aki reh ma bu Sufata amehreh Farus anyi inzi Biriya, mboh ma Aristarku tasa Sakundus, ma bu kyangwri Tasalonika mboh, tasa Gayus nza anyi Darbe, tasa Timoti, tasa za Tikikus tasa Tarofimus, amboh areh ma bu kyangwri Asiya mboh. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Kyangwri amboh areh ma a jiji a na amoh, maka a na na a bana reh ma Toruwas. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Mbohroh feh meh hinga nyi Filibi ma gbogblondo amwo, neh kira rya Afohfohnoh Yahudawa mboh ata yisti nza a yama kpeh reh kǝ gǝga. Meh kǝ na ni hunji mboh ma Toruwas neh ibi atungu kǝ gǝga. Meh na ni hunji mgbiri kyangwri mboh ma a huru, meh kǝ tuma ibi atehrehkifi na anyi ma a huru.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dohsohna Ablusu mboh ma amboh tufa mboh Ma Toruwas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Ibi ata anyimbehreh ata sati, meh dohsohna Mbohroh ma amboh tufa mboh. Meh kǝ leh kya afohfohnoh gafa ma itoh ambohroh. Ablusu ka a leh a bleh tsifa ma kyangwri mboh reh. La ŋoh wa a nati a te na nerebi a na ŋoh. A ka a bleh mboh tsifa a gu a na na atsitsifi shini agba. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Ma a mloh shira afitila mboh gaga a gya ma ida inza ata Mbohroh nza meh bu nimeh reh. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Amehreh nyifa anyi sa a ŋoh a bu Yutikus a tuma ni kpi nvitsi ida reh, mla ka a wa a ŋoh aniye gaga ameh ta Ablusu nza ka a leh a bleh vara tsifa reh. Mla nza ka a keh ŋoh ka a nina neh a ka a fufana a hwa anyi ma ida inza a tamba ta ka a kwo ma a huru heriheri. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Ablusu ka a tamba a na ma inzi, ta ka a na na a de amehreh neh ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kama kohnoh nnoh kpeh, amehreh reh a treh a bu na fene.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Nza ka a ka a na ŋoh ma ida nza reh a ka a na a gafa mboh afohfohnoh reh maka a rya mboh ma amboh tufa mboh reh. A ka a leh a yanda a bleh mboh tsifa mboh reh a gu a na nerebi anyi, a treh feh sa ka a na ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Kyangwri mboh reh maka a gu amehreh kafa reh ka a na afiya ni fene, nana agohsoh nza ma a bu na wohroh reh a bu veve kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu A hehndeh Anyi Toruwas A na Miletus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Mbohroh meh kǝ bu ma tohmoh atsi niye ma gbogblondo amwo reh, meh kǝ na ambohroh Asus la timi na ni gu Ablusu ma a huru, la ŋoh tana atsifa a gya dehreh, ŋoh tana a kira ta a na ŋoh na hwana. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />nza ka a hunji reh ma Asus reh, mbohroh meh kǝ gu ŋoh nimeh gbogblondo amwo kǝ na mbohroh Mitilin. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Anyi ma a huru reh mbohroh meh kǝ rya tohmoh na hende nimeh gbogblondo amwo. Ibi nza ka a yanda neh mbohroh meh kǝ bu ma akachi Kiyos. Ibi ka a yanda neh nza mbohroh na Samos, Ibi anyi ka a yanda nza mbohroh na Miletus. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Ablusu reh na a gya agohsoh a ŋoh la wa nati a tamba ma Afisa kpeh, la ŋoh ta a yanda ma Asiya kpeh. La ŋoh a kira ta a na na aniye ma Urushalima feh ibi kira Fentiko sa a ba. Ablusu ka atsifa na agbugba amboh tufa mboh ma Afisa ka a treh feh sa ka a na ŋoh.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Anyi Miletus, Ablusu ka a tohmoh a na na agbugba amboh tufa mboh ma ida Nnoh nza ma a yama ma Afisa. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Nza maka a ba na a ŋoh reh, a ka a bleh mboh la: &lt;&lt;mohnoh ni kpi ma amohnoh ni wina noh biroh tuma ata meh ti kǝ tuma nimeh amohnoh, nza a gu nyi ibi ata meh ti kǝ gya hwana amya ma inzi Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Mya meh te ndohmoh ma Ada amya na kuku agohsoh tasa na mwueneh. Mya meh shi wuwana na agugu tsara mboh nza ma a leh a ba meh ma atsetse ata Yahudawa mboh nza ma a leh a de a ba meh reh. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Meh nyiri meh ti bleh noh awumu ata nza a nati a shingi nnoh kpeh. Meh tsana noh awumu mboh reh nambri ata nza a nati a shingi nnoh reh. Meh lisa mboh ma inziyo la kyangwri mboh mata a sehreh. Tasa za meh gyuru tsana noh ma afiyafiya amohnoh mboh. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Meh kpi ashotoh Yahudawa mboh tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, ma ikpi la mata gyuruna ta agugu amoh mboh reh mata a gyuru a ba amoh ni Nnoh, tasa za la mata a nga agohsoh amoh na tsifa Ada Yeso reh a kira. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />&lt;&lt;Nza nehnehreh wuwana huru a leh a yiyi meh, meh nati na amya Urushalima, meh wina andromboh ata nza a nati hunji meh ma a huru kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Mya meh wina la ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh reh nambri, Huru zanana reh tana a kpi meh ashotoh la, ida ka tasa iya agba a bana meh. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Mya neh meh gu fene amya la bu andromboh kpeh, nza meh nati wina lisa andromboh ata nza a bu ma tohmoh amya reh, tasa za meh ti te ndohmoh ata Ada Yeso nza a nga reh, meh ti bleh tsifa nana Nnoh reh.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />&lt;&lt;Nehnehreh meh wina la nambri ma amohnoh ni nati nza ma nnoh za kpeh, mohnoh amboh ata mya nza ni hende hwra tsifa akpo afiya Nnoh bleh noh reh. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Nza a bu dehreh mya meh bleh noh andrehmeh areh la, meh za bu na vari imya akyo amohnoh ma ikpi amya za kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />La meh tsana noh kohnoh Nnoh reh nambri. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Mohnoh agbugba mboh reh, lisa de noh ikpi amohnoh, tasa ata vara kyangwri amboh ata Huru zanana nza a fira nnoh a gya la ti nza mboh nnoh reh, ti rya nnoh tohmoh atsi de noh kyangwri amboh tufa mboh amboh ata Nnoh nza a hunji mboh na imya amehreh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Meh wina la nza meh gyuru na amya, agugu kyangwri ma a nati a ba tama a tsana noh tsana ata huru tsifa. Ma a nati a de agǝshi a ba ma amboh tufa mboh reh tswanza wo aye abibi ata ka a mla atashi mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Nimeh amohnoh za mgbiri kyangwri mboh ma a nati a ba na tsifa ata huru tsifa, la mata a landa amboh tufa mboh reh a na ni mgba amoh. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Nza a bu dehreh tuma ti lisa nza noh! Kohnoh nnoh la a bu ahushi atatoh nehnehreh, ni nnoh tasa shini, meh leh bleh noh tsifa mboh reh ni mwueneh.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />&lt;&lt;Nehnehreh meh ta nnoh ma ivoh Nnoh, Ta tsifa alindeh Nnoh reh ta a lisa a nza noh. Wohroh reh a nati a lisa nnoh ta a nga noh awumu alilehndeh ata nza a lisa a gya ma kyangwri a ŋoh mboh amboh nza ma a bu na zanana reh. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Mya meh te akohkohroh iyo na kpakpa hungroh ata ahungwri ha akuri akyo kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />mohnoh ni ikpi amohnoh ni wina noh la meh te ndohmoh na ivoh amya meh ti fyoh ikpi amya tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu na amya. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Ma aki amboh areh, meh tsana noh akeki ata ni nati tufa nnoh reh. Te nnoh ndohmoh alindeh ti shingi nnoh amboh ata ma a bu na wuwana kpeh. Ti kohnoh na tsifa Nnoh ata nza a bleh la,&lt;Te atoh gaga a bu na akyo ata ka ngǝnga a keh ata maka a nga ŋoh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ablusu nza a ka a bleh dehreh, ka a dafa a gboro a ŋoh ma inzi ta ka a kwere Nnoh mboh ma agbugba amboh tufa mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Maka a kpanga nambri ma amwo, maka a de ŋoh ka a ba ma agohsoh amoh maka anvivi aniye ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Andromboh ata nza a wa mboh aniye a bu tsifa ata ŋoh nza a bleh mboh la, ma a nati a gyuru anzoh ŋoh za kpeh. A ka nyi ma a huru maka a wa ŋoh a na atsi ata ŋoh nza a nati aniye ma gbogblondo amwo reh.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Hende Ablusu Na Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Mbohroh Nza meh kǝ ta mboh, meh kǝ niye ma gbogblondo amwo na ambohroh Kos. Ibi nza ka a yanda neh meh kǝ na ambohroh Rodes anyi ma a huru neh meh kǝ gyuru na ambohroh Fatara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Nza meh kǝ hunji gbogblondo amwo ata nza a nati a hwana a na afiya Finikiya, meh kǝ niye na ambohroh. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Mbohroh nza meh kǝ jiji nza Sayifurus, meh kǝ ta ni mgba ivoh a mina, meh kǝ rya tohmoh ni hende reh na ambohroh Suriya, meh kǝ tamba ma Taya, la neh gbogblondo amwo reh a nati tamba na awumu amwo. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Mbohroh Nza meh kǝ hunji amboh tufa mboh ma a huru reh, meh kǝ tuma na amoh ibi atehrehkifi na anyi. Huru ka a bleh ma amboh tufa mboh reh la ma a bleh Ablusu ta za a na Urushalima reh za kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ameh hinga mbohroh nza ka a ba, mbohroh meh kǝ leh rya tohmoh na hende ambohroh. amboh tufa mboh reh mboh ma fiya amoh tasa mara amoh mboh maka a wa reh a kate ma akpo afiya a gya ma aki. Meh kǝ tuma ma a huru na a gboro kwere Nnoh ma akachi fini reh. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Anyima ka a bleh ma atohngoh la na alindeh, mbohroh neh meh kǝ niye ma gbogblondo amwo mboh neh maka a na amoh afiya.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Mbohroh meh gu hende ambohroh nyi Taya, a treh feh meh sekǝ ba Tolemayis, meh kǝ leh tsifa na amboh tufa mboh ma a huru gu ibi anyimbehreh na amoh. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ibi nza a yanda neh meh kǝ na ambohroh Kaisariya, meh kǝ tamba ma afiya Filibus kyangwri bleh tsifa Nnoh, ŋoh nza bu anyimbehreh nimeh atehrehkifi na anyi tama ka a seh mboh la tama a nza amboh tufa mboh ma Urushalima reh. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />A bu na nyifa mboh anneh amboh ata ma a hehreh a sa tsifa mboh kpeh. ma a bu amboh nza tohmoh wina. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Neh mbohroh meh kǝ yanda shidi ma a huru, kyangwri sa tohmoh anyi a yama ma a huru sa a ŋoh bu Agabus, ŋoh reh anyi mgba nza ni Yahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Agabus reh nza a ka a ba na ambohroh reh, a ka a gu rishi ata Ablusu ka fla chuhu yira na wohroh reh ka a lafa ivoh a ŋoh mboh tasa hwana a ŋoh mboh ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza andromboh ata huru zanana nza bleh reh la, &lt;A bu dehreh Yahudawa amboh Urushalima ma a nati a lafa kyangwri rishi fla chuhu yira ata areh, mata a de ŋoh nga amboh ata nza ma bu yahudawa mboh kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Mbohroh nza meh kǝ sehreh de reh, mbohroh kyangwri amboh ata ma a yama ma a huru reh, meh kǝ kwere Ablusu la ta a na Urushalima za kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Ablusu ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni sangra nnoh mwueneh ti kputu ma nnoh agohsoh tsifa umbo? mya nehnehreh meh kira meh nati na mata a lafa meh tsene kpeh, mata a mla meh a mishi za ma Urushalima reh ma ikpi sa Ada Yeso reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Mbohroh meh wina sehneh ŋoh agohsoh a ŋoh za kpeh, meh kǝ bu gbalala, meh kǝ bleh la, &lt;Kohnoh Ada ta a bu na anzoh.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />A yanda kpeh, mbohroh meh kǝ na mbohroh Urushalima. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Mgbiri amboh tufa mboh nza ma a yama ma Kaisariya reh, maka a wa reh ka a na afiya Manason ata mbohroh meh nati tamba ma afiya a ŋoh reh, ŋoh bu kyangwri Sayifurus, ŋoh bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa ata jiji reh.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu A na Hende Ma Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Mbohroh nza meh kǝ ba Urushalima, ambohroh mboh ma a ka a sa reh ni johjoh. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Ibi nza ka a yanda neh Ablusu ka a wa reh meh kǝ na ni Yakubu, agbugba amboh tufa reh nambri ma a yama ma a huru. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Ablusu nza ka atsifa na amwo a treh neh, ka a tsana mboh awumu ata Nnoh nza a lisa ma amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh ma aki te ndohmoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Nza ma a ka a sehreh dehreh, maka ariri Nnoh. Maka a bleh ma Ablusu la,&lt;Atsi, nnoh nza nehnehreh, kyangwri mboh nimeh Yahudawa ma a kira na tsifa mboh reh gaga, nambri ma amoh ma a kira mata a tufa akpi reh Yelele. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Ma a bleh mboh tsifa anzoh, la ni leh tsana ma Yahudawa mboh nambri nza ma a bu nimeh amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh la ma a kira na tsana Musa kpeh. La ni leh bleh mboh la ma a kama a shimba kpa ma mara amoh mboh kpeh, ha la mata a tufa lomo ambohroh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Nehnehreh meh nati lisa lele? Ma a nati a sehreh tsifa ba anzoh reh kwikwi. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Nza ka a bu dehreh lisa andromboh ata mya nza ni bleh noh reh. Meh bu na kyangwri anneh ma mareh amboh ata maa a gu faku ma ikpi amoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />La ti fira mboh na anzoh, tama tufa lomo ata ni nati hwara mboh nnoh nambri, ti fanga mboh nnoh hungroh ata ma a mla reh, mata a fa mboh shina ikpi. Ma aki wohroh a nati a wina awumu nza ma a bleh mboh ma ikpi anzoh reh a bu zizi kpeh. Ma a nati a bleh la ni tufa tsana lomo amgbasho Musa reh. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Neh amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, mboh amboh nza ma nga agohsoh amoh reh, mbohroh meh ŋa amgbasho na mboh ma ikpi la meh kohnoh nza la mata a kama a rya irya ata nza ma a nati a nga ma nnoh ata nza ma a lisa na ivoh kpeh, ha imya, ha iwo andromboh ata nza ma a de a kama agba ata nza a sangra imya a ŋoh akpeh ha la ti leh ahohndoh na afya ata nza a bu anzoh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />A te na nerebi, Ablusu ka a wa kyangwri mboh reh a na na a hwara itoh a ŋoh mboh ma amoh, feh sa aniye a na ida Nnoh atsi bleh mboh ibi ata hwara itoh reh a nati a su, wohroh ka a nati a bu ibi were hungroh tsifa amoh ma anyinyimbehreh.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma a de Ablusu Nimeh Ida Kwere Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ibi atehrehkifi na anyi reh Nza ka a ba nda ta a su, Yahudawa amboh anyi ma anyi Asiya maka a nza Ablusu ni Ida kwere Nnoh reh. ma a ka ata duma mboh reh na aniye ma a ka a de ŋoh, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Maka a te kpiriga la, &lt;&lt;Ambohroh mboh kyangwri Israila mboh, shingi turoh! Nza nnoh kyangwri ata areh nza ka a hehndeh a treh atsifi a tsana la tama a rina kyangwri ambohroh mboh tasa akpi Musa, tasa ida Nnoh. Tasa za a wa kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh a ba nimeh ida Nnoh tasa za ka a chakafa atsifi ata nza a bu na zanana ata areh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Maka a bleh la tana bu dehreh tama a nza Ablusu reh mboh ma Turofimus, nza bu kyangwri Afisawa reh, nimeh akpo afiya reh. A bu wohroh reh mboh nza maka a gu la Ablusu kǝ wa kyangwri reh ba nimeh ida Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Agǝshi ka a hwa, ma kpo afiya reh nambri, tasa duma mboh reh ma a ka hinga a gbo nyi akpokpo atsifi mboh atsetse. Maka a ba ba a de Ablusu ka a kpikpi ŋoh a kate anyi nimeh ida Nnoh reh, maka a hama anida mboh reh ma hwana anyimbehreh. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Maka buti nati mla ŋoh tavoh, tsifa reh ka a na na a hwa na agba kyangwri amboh de ita mboh reh la, Kyangwri Urushalima mboh ma a buti hwa agǝshi. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Ma a huruhuru ka a fira amboh de ita mboh tasa agbugba amboh de ita Roma mboh reh, maka a na a huru na gbo. Duma mboh reh nza ma a ka a nza agbugba mboh tasa amboh de ita mboh reh. maka a yi mla Ablusu reh ata. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Agba amboh de ita mboh reh ka a ba a de Ablusu, ka a bleh mboh la, ma a lafa ŋoh na njehnjehreh afri. Neh ka luhu la, &lt;&lt;ŋoh ka a bu anyi, tasa za a ka a lisa umbo? <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Duma mboh reh maka a bleh alulu tsifa mboh ma atsetse areh wa a bleh ata ri. Agǝshi agba nza ka a hwa reh, Agba amboh de ita reh a sohroh a wina chuhu tsifa reh kpeh, a ka a bleh la mata a gu Ablusu a de a na atsi tuma amboh de ita mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Ablusu nza ka a ba ma anida gya hwana a tamba reh, agǝshi ka a keh, amboh de ita mboh reh maka a gu ŋoh a kate na ikpi amoh. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Duma mboh mata ka a tufa ŋoh reh, maka a leh te kpiriga a nina la, &lt;&lt;Mla nnoh kwo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Amboh de ita mboh nza maka a na ti a gu Ablusu aniye nimeh atsi tuma amboh de ita mboh reh, a ka luhu agba amboh de ita reh la, &lt;&lt;Meh tswa meh ti bleh noh andromboh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">&lt;&lt;Agba reh ka a bleh la,&gt;&gt;Ni tsifa mgba Helenawa? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />A bu kyangwri masar wohroh ŋa na ahushi ata nyina ŋoh mboh reh ti kǝ de fi akpi ba reh kpeh? ata ti kǝ wa akpi kyangwri mboh dubu aniye amboh nza maka a mla kyangwri mboh a kwo na hohroh bini reh kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Ablusu ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu kyangwri Yahudawa mi, meh nyi Tarsus ma inzi Kilikiya. Meh bu amehreh akpo inzi wohroh ma a zizi bu ata wusu ŋoh kpeh. Kavohshama, ta meh ti tsifa na kyangwri mboh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Agba amboh de ita nza ka nga ŋoh kira reh, Ablusu ka a shi ma anida gya hwana reh, ka a gu ivoh a ka ma duma mboh reh, maka a shimba gbalala nambri ma amoh. A ka atsifa na amoh na mgba Ibraniyawa.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />&lt;&lt;Atsi amya mboh tasa ada mboh, sehreh noh tsifa mya nza ni nati bleh kehsheh ikpi amya reh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Nza maka sehreh ŋoh atsi tsifa na amoh na mgba Ibraniyawa, maka shimba shatata. Ablusu neh ka a bleh mboh la: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />&lt;&lt;Mya meh bu kyangwri Yahudawa, ma a mara meh ma Tarsus ata Kilikiya, mya neh meh te agba ma mareh. Meh kpehkpehteh amgbasho nyi na Gamaliyel, nza na a tsana meh tufa akpi ada mboh reh nambri. Meh bu na kira te ndohmoh Nnoh tswanza mohnoh nza ni te nnoh andrehmeh areh. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Meh de amboh tufa aki ata areh te iya, meh kǝ mla mboh kwo, meh kǝ de fiya amoh mboh tasa tsifa mboh na ni ka ma da ka, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Agba Firist tasa amboh tuma ma atita mboh reh ma a wina tsifa ata areh a bu zizi. Meh sa amgbasho ata areh nyi na amoh, na ni ambohroh mboh Yahudawa mboh ma Dimashku, meh kǝ wa mboh ba ida ka ma Urushalima mata a de mboh a te iya.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Ndo 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />&lt;&lt;Na atsitsi fi noh ibi anyi mya nza ni kǝ ba ma nda na Dimashku, shira anyi ka rya a nza anyi Inza a ba ba a goh meh. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />meh kǝ hwa ma nza ni meh kǝ sehreh agba anyi ka atsifa na amya la, &lt;Shawulu! Shawulu! ni kǝ leh de meh te iya tsifa umbo?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />meh kǝ luhu ŋoh la, &lt;A ka bu noh anyi, Ada?&gt; Ka a bleh meh la, &lt;Meh bu Yeso ata Nazaret, ata nnoh nza ni leh de te iya reh&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />amboh nza ma a tufa meh ma a nza shira reh dehreh neh, ma a sohroh a sehreh agba ata nza tsifa na amya reh a wina kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Meh kǝ luhu ŋoh la, &lt;Ada meh ti lisa lele?&gt; Ada reh ka bleh meh la, &lt;Hinga shi,&gt; te nina ma Dimashku. Nza ni niye a huru ma a nati a bleh noh andromboh ata nza ni nati lisa reh nambri.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Amboh nza ma a yama na amya reh, maka a wa meh a de na ivoh a na Dimashku, iyo amya tana a za a nza atsifi kpeh tsifa la zanana ata nza anyi Inza reh tana a hama meh iyo<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri anyi ma a fi isa ŋoh la Hananiya, tana bu kyangwri tufa Nnoh tasa za tana ka tufa amgbasho Musa reh, tasa za Yahudawa amboh nza ma tuma ma huru reh maka bleh tsifa alilehndeh ma ikpi ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ka a ba ba a shi na nda amya ka a bleh meh la, &lt;Atsi amya Shawulu, iyo anzoh ta a gyuru a nza atsifi yama!&gt; Na wohroh heri iyo amya ka nza atsifi yama meh kǝ nza ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />&lt;&lt;Neh ka bleh meh la: &lt;Nnoh ata Ada ambohroh mboh Yahudawa mboh Kǝ seh nnoh la te wina kira a ŋoh tasa te nza ata nza a tufa Nnoh Yehlehleh tasa te sehreh lomo nyi na aniye a ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Ni nati bu kyangwri bleh tsifa a ŋoh ma kyangwri mboh kanga nambri ma ikpi andromboh ata nza ni nza ti sehreh reh. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Nehnehreh ni tre bana umbo? Hinga, meh ti wra nnoh Batisma, tasa Nnoh ta a hwara kpakpana anzoh a sangra ma aki fi isa a ŋoh.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Mya nza ni kǝ gyuru na amya Urushalima, meh kǝ na atsi kwere Nnoh nimeh Ida Nnoh, Nnoh ka vuru meh iyo meh kǝ nza wono, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />meh kǝ nza Ada atsi tsifa na amya la, &lt;Hinga fifi! ti yi Urushalima reh ta heri, tsifa la kyangwri mboh reh ma a nati a kira na tsifa anzoh ma ikpi ma ikpi amya reh kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />&lt;Meh kǝ kira ŋoh la&lt;Ada,&gt; Kyangwri amboh areh ma a wina la mya meh hende tre ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh nambri atsi fa amboh nza ma nga agohsoh ma tsifa anzoh. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Tasa ma ta ka a sangra mya Istifanus kyangwri hwra tsifa anzoh bleh reh, mya na ikpi amya meh tini shi ma a huru meh ti kǝ nga mboh kira meh ti kǝ shwa akuri amboh ma ta ka a mla ŋoh a kwo reh. <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Ada neh ka bleh meh la, &lt;Na;&gt; &lt;Meh nati tohmoh nnoh na gbugba na Amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu kyangwri Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Duma mboh ma a shi a sehreh a bana Ablusu ka a ba ba a bleh tsifa anyi la ada a tohmoh ŋoh a na na amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh. Maka a vuru agba amoh mboh maka a te kpiriga la, &lt;&lt;Mla kyangwri areh kwo nnoh! A sohroh a tswa kyangwri ika ata areh ta a tuma ma inziyo kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Nza maka buti te kpiriga tasa ma ta ka shebiri akuri amoh mboh ma ta ka ata huru a ka ma inyo. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Agba amboh de ita mboh reh ka a bleh kyangwri a ŋoh mboh la, ma a de Ablusu a na atsi tuma amboh de ita mboh reh, ka a bleh mboh la mata mla ŋoh tasa za la mata luhu ŋoh tsifa ata Yahudawa mboh nza ma a leh a sesenge ma ikpi a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Nza maka a lafa ŋoh na rishi la mata a mla ŋoh reh, Ablusu ka luhu agba amboh de ita mboh reh anyi nza a shi a na ma nda a ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A zohhoh ti mla kyangwri Romawa ata nza ma a sohroh a hunji ŋoh na kpakpana kpeh reh na amviri?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Agba amboh de ita reh nza ka a sehreh dehreh, ka a na na a bleh ma kyangwri de ta reh. Ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ nati lisa lele?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kyangwri areh a bu kyangwri Roma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Agba amboh de Ta reh ka a na na luhu Ablusu la, &lt;&lt;Bleh meh, noh ni bu kyangwri Roma mi?&gt;&gt; Ka kira ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Ha a bu dehreh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Agba amboh de Ta reh ka bleh ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Mya meh fanga hungroh gaga feh misi te kyangwri Roma.&gt;&gt; Ablusu neh ka bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mya feh ma a mara meh na mareh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Amboh ma ta ka a nati luhu ŋoh tsifa mboh reh maka kpina a kate heri. Agba amboh de ita reh nza ka a wina la Ablusu a bu kyangwri Romawa nyiri la ŋoh kǝ de kyangwri Roma tsitsiya ka.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu ma Tomo Agbugba amboh Bleh Amgba Asho Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Ibi na afri neh, agba amboh de Ta nza ka a kira ta a wina ha a ka bu umbo bu chuhu tsifa reh feh Yahudawa mboh nza maka leh a kya ŋoh reh, ka ta ŋoh avoh neh ta ka a fi Agba Firist mboh tasa agbugba mboh maka a dohsohna. Ka a wa Ablusu reh a de a ba ba a gya ma tohmoh amoh.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Ablusu ka nza amboh tsana akpi Musa ni iyo welele ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Atsi amya mboh, mya meh tre ndohmoh amya ma tohmoh Nnoh ma akeki alilehndeh nambri na de ikpi alindeh tasa agohsoh alindeh a gu a ba ba a te andrehmeh areh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Nza ka a sehreh dehreh Hananiya nza bu agba firist reh ka a ble ma amboh ata nza ma a shi ma nda a ŋoh Ablusu reh la mata a mla ŋoh ma aniye. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Ablusu neh ka a bleh ŋoh la, Nnoh a nati a mla nnoh, nnoh iji ida ata nza ma awo a mla atasaa! nnoh ni gu akpi tuma hwra meh akpi, nnoh neh ni gyuru kputu akpi Nnoh nza ni bleh la mata a mla meh reh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Amboh nza ma a shi ma nda Ablusu reh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Noh ni kya Agba firist ata Nnoh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Ablusu ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Atsi mboh, mya meh sohroh wina la ŋoh a bu agba Firist kpeh; A bu ŋa gya la: &lt;kama kya Agohmoh kyangwri mboh kpeh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Ablusu neh, nza ka a wina la amboh tswa nza ma a shi na a huru reh ma bu Farisiyawa tasa sadukiyawa mboh, ka a vuru agba a ŋoh ka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Atsi amya mboh, mya meh bu Farisiyawa mi, amehreh Farisiyawa. Ma hwra meh akpi tsifa la, meh gya agohsoh amya la gyuru hinga na afri a nati a yama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Nza ka a bleh dehreh, agǝshi ka a hwa ma Farisiyawa mboh tasa Sadukiyawa mboh, maka a gafana a te afri ma aki dohsohna reh. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(sadukiyawa mboh maka a bleh la tsifa hinga na afri a nati a sohroh a yama kpeh, tasa za la Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh tasa huru mboh ma a yama kpeh, Farisiyawa mboh neh ma a kira la ma a yama na atatoh ma.) <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Maka a hwa aniye gaga, amboh tsana akpi Musa amboh ata ma ta ka a bu Farisiyawa mboh maka a hinga a shi maka a leh a keh na aniye gaga. &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh sohroh hunji kyangwri areh atsi lisa andromboh abibi kpeh,&gt;&gt; Handuhwa a nati a bu huru ha amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ka a tsifa na a ŋoh neh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Agǝshi reh ka a lisa a keh agba amboh de Ta reh ka nyiri la mata kama a mla Ablusu reh a te abibi kpeh. Ka a bleh ma amboh de Ta reh la mata a na na a sa Ablusu reh a hwana anyi na amoh ni wuwana mata a de ŋoh a ba nimeh atsi tuma amboh de ita mboh.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Shini na afri neh Ada ka a shi ni nda Ablusu ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;De agohsoh anzoh reh wuwana dehreh tswanza nza ni bleh mboh tsifa amya ni Urushalima reh, dehreh za nnoh nati bleh mboh ma Roma kanga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A dohsoh Aniye la mata A mla Ablusu A kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Ibi na afri nza ka a yanda Yahudawa mboh maka a dohsoh aniye maka a gu fa aku la mata kama a rya ha mata a wa kpeh la tama a mla Ablusu a kwo feh. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />kyangwri nza ma a keh agrumavoh adada Aniye ŋa nza ma ahwra agugu reh. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Maka a na na a hunji Agba Firist mboh tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh maka a bleh mboh la, Mbohroh meh gu fa aku la meh nati mla Ablusu reh kwo feh misi rya ha meh ti wa amwo <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Nza a bu dehreh na ni luhu agba amboh de ita yahudawa mboh reh la, ta a de Ablusu reh a ba nnoh, ti huru la ni nati lisa luhu ŋoh ma ikpi tsifa a ŋoh reh, mbohroh meh bana meh ti mla ŋoh kwo ma aki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Amehreh asra Ablusu nza ka a sehreh agugu nza maka a bleh a gya ma ikpi Ablusu reh neh, ka a na na a bleh ma Ablusu ma akpo afiya amboh de ta mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Ablusu neh ka a fi agbugba amboh de ta mboh reh anyi ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Wa amehreh areh na na agba amboh de ita reh; a nati a bleh ŋoh tsifa andromboh anyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Avoh dehreh ka a wa ŋoh a na na agba amboh de ta reh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:18">Agba amboh de ta reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ablusu, nza a bu ni da ka reh, a fi meh ka a bleh meh la meh ti wa amehreh areh ba na anzoh la a nati a bleh noh tsifa anyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Agba amboh de ta reh ka a wa amehreh reh a de na ivoh a na na nda ka luhu ŋoh na ayuhu la, &lt;&lt;A bu tsifa mboh nza ni bleh la nnoh nati bleh meh reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Ka bleh ŋoh la: Yahudawa mboh maka a dohsoh aniye la ma a nati a bleh noh ti wa Ablusu reh ba na tohmoh amoh na atita ikya ma a nati a huru la mboh ma a nati a lisa a luhu ŋoh tsifa mboh ni ikpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Kama kira mboh kpeh, tsifa la ma bu mboh vara agba, ma a handa kyangwri agrumavoh dida anneh maka a leh feh a bana la mata a mla ŋoh a kwo. Ma a gu faku la ma a nati a mla ŋoh a kwo feh masa a rya ha mata a wa amwo. Maka a buti bana nehnehreh, la ti nga mboh kira ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Agba reh ka ata amehreh reh avoh ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, kama bleh akyo la nnoh ni bleh meh tsifa ata areh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agba amboh de ita A tohmoh Ablusu A na na Agohmoh Felis ata Gomnati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Agba amoh reh ka a fi agbugba amboh de ita a ŋoh mboh afri ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Na ni fira nnoh amboh de ita deri afri, amboh ka ma nyama agrumavoh dida atehrehkifi na anyi, tasa amboh mla na na mbeh deri afri, mata a tuma a bana mata a hinga na shini na ameh atsiyatsiya na anyi mata a na Kaisariya. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Fa noh nyama amboh anyi ma Ablusu ta a ka a na na a tamba na Felis alindeh. <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Ka ŋa amgbasho a bleh la:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Anyi na Kalaudiyus Lisiyas,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:26">a na na kyangwri agba Felis ata nza a bu Gomna:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:26">Meh tsifa na anzoh.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Kyangwri areh Yahudawa mboh ma a de ŋoh la ma a nati a mla ŋoh a kwo, mya neh mbohroh ma amboh nza ma a tufa meh maka a ba ba a sa ŋoh a hwana, tama a bleh meh la kyangwri reh a bu kyangwri Romawa. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Mya nza ni kǝ kira meh ti wina ha maka a leh a ŋa Ablusu reh tsifa mboh, meh kǝ wa ŋoh na na atita amoh. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Meh kǝ wina la a bu ma ikpi tsifa amgbasho tsana amoh, tsifa reh neh a sohroh a tswa ti mla a kwo ha mata a de ŋoh a ka kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Nza maka a bleh meh la ma ahwra agugu na ikpi a ŋoh, meh kǝ tohmoh ŋoh ba na anzoh heri. meh kǝ bleh ma amboh nza ma a ŋa ŋoh reh la mata a bleh noh andromboh nza ma a leh a ŋa ŋoh reh na tohmoh anzoh.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Amboh de ita reh maka a wa Ablusu a de a na moh na Antifatiris na shini. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Ibi na afri maka ata amboh de ta amboh ata nza maka a ka na nyama mata a wa ŋoh a rya tohmoh, mboh neh maka a gyuru a ba amoh atsi tuma amboh de ita mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Amboh de ita ata nza maka a ka ma nyama reh nza maka a niye ma Kaisariya, maka nga Agohmoh ata Gomnati reh amgbasho reh tasa Ablusu. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Agohmoh ata gomnati nza ka a bleh amgbasho reh a nza ka a luhu Ablusu la ni kǝ nyi mgba atamaa. nza ka a wina la anyi kilikiya neh, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati sere tsifa anzoh ameh ata amboh nza ma a de tsifa a ba ma ikpi anzoh tama a ba reh.&gt;&gt; Ka a bleh a de aniye a wuwa la mata a shwa Ablusu a gya ma afiya Agohmoh Hirudus.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Ma ŋa Ablusu na tomo Felis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ibi na atungu nza ka a gǝga neh agba Firist ata isa ŋoh nza bu Hananiya ka na Kaisariya mboh ma agbugba kyangwri mboh tasa kyangwri hwra akpi anyi maka a fi isa ŋoh la Tartulus, maka a ba ba a bleh tsifa amoh ni ikpi Ablusu ni tohmoh Agohmoh ata gomnati reh.<verse eid="ACT 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Nza maka a fi Ablusu a na nimeh, Tartulus ka bleh tsifa a ŋoh ni ikpi Ablusu la kyangwri agba: mbohroh meh nza nana tuma alindeh nnoh nza ni bu Agohmoh ambohroh, wina lomo anzoh a de sehneh a ba reh gaga ma akpo afiya ambohroh. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />ka a treh atsifi tasa ma akeki atsetse, nnoh agbagba Felis, kyangwri ambohroh ma nza areh a wina, a treh atsifi ma ta ka a kwende Nnoh gaga. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Meh ti kama rya tsifa gaga kpeh, meh kwere noh nimeh lisa alindeh anzoh ti soh ivoh yira neh ti sehreh tsifa ambohroh shidi. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri areh a bu kyangwri fa akpi, ka a dohsoh kyangwri Yahudawa mboh mata a fi akpi ni inziyo nambri. Ŋoh a bu agba amboh agugu nza maka a fi mboh la Nazaret reh <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />tasa za la ŋoh ta a de ida Nnoh a chakafa neh; mbohroh meh kǝ de ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Lisiyas nza neh a bu agba, ka a ba na wuwana ka a ba ba a sa ŋoh a hwana <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Nza nnoh ti luhu ŋoh nnoh nati sehreh tsifa a ŋoh ti wina awumu mboh mbohroh nza meh bleh noh na ikpi a ŋoh reh la a bu zizi nambri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Yahudawa mboh nambri ma a dohsoh aniye a te bleh ŋa Ablusu reh, maka a bleh a de aniye a wuwa la tsifa amboh areh a bu zizi.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Agohmoh ata gomnati nza a ka a bleh ŋoh la ta tsifa, ka bleh la: &lt;&lt;Meh wina la a bu noh ni bu kyangwri hwra akpi ni mareh ahushi gaga; meh nati tsifa na agohsoh anyimbehreh. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Nza ti luhu nnoh nati sehreh la kǝ hehreh te ibi agrumavoh a hwa afri kpeh meh ti kǝ na Urushalima aki riri Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />amboh nza ma a ŋa meh ma a sohroh a hunji meh atsi keh na aniye na da Nnoh kpeh, ha ni ida dohsohna ha na akpo anyi nimeh akpo afiya reh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Tasa za ma a nati a sohroh a wina bleh noh la areh a bu a zizi chuhu tsifa ata mboh nza ma a leh a ŋa meh reh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Imya meh kira la, meh riri Nnoh ata ada ambohroh mboh ma aki ata nza maka a fi la amboh lisa amoh tse. mya meh nga agohsoh amya ma andromboh ata nza ma a ŋa a gya ma amgbasho Musa tasa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh, <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />tasa za meh gya agohsoh amya na Nnoh tswanza kyangwri amboh areh nza ma a lisa reh, la a nati a gyuru a yiri amboh kwo mboh reh a hinga, amboh tufa yehlehleh tasa amboh ata nza ma a sa tsifa a kira kpeh reh. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Meh kǝ mlana ni tutu meh ti nza la kohnoh ma agohsoh amya a bu sehsehseh ma tohmoh Nnoh tasa kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />&lt;&lt;Ahushi amboh anyi nza maka a gǝga, meh kǝ gyuru ba amya Urushalima mya la meh ti de awumu ngǝnga ba ma kyangwri amya amboh nza ma a bu ni wohroh kpeh tasa meh ti nga awumu nana agohsoh ma Nnoh. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Tama a hunji meh nimeh ida Nnoh atsi leh hwara itoh amya sehsehseh. Duma tama a sohroh a yama na amya ma a huru kpeh, tasa za mya meh tini bu nimeh amboh fi agǝshi kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Yahudawa amboh anyi tama anyi akpo afiya Asiya, mboh ŋa ma a tswa atsi shi ni tohmoh anzoh mata a ŋa meh nza mata a bu ni tsifa andromboh na ikpi amya. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Ha amboh nza ma a yama ni mareh mata a bleh ha tama a hunji meh ni kpakpana meh ti kǝ shi ni tohmoh agbugba mboh na atita reh <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />tana a bu ni ikpi tsifa anyimbehreh areh ŋa meh ti kǝ shi bleh ni tohmoh amoh reh: &lt;A bu ni ikpi tsifa hinga na afri ata amboh nza ma a kwo ŋa nza ma a shi ahwra meh akpi ni tohmoh anzoh andrehmeh areh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Felis neh, nza a wina gaga ni ikpi aki reh, ka a gu tsifa reh a na tohmoh. &lt;&lt;Lisiyas agba amboh de ita tana a ba feh,&gt;&gt; ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati lisa kohnoh nza ma ikpi hwra akpi anzoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Ka a bleh ma agba amboh de ita reh la mata a de Ablusu reh a ka a gya neh mata a hehreh ata ŋoh avoh shidi iziza a ŋoh mboh ma ta ka a ba a lisa ŋoh andromboh nza a kira.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ibi amboh anyi nza maka a gǝga, Felis mboh tama a ba mboh ma afya a ŋoh Durusila nza a bu Yahudiya reh. Ka tohmoh la mata a fi Ablusu la ŋoh ta a tuma a sehreh ŋoh atsi tsifa na ikpi nga agohsoh ma kristi Yeso. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Ablusu nza ka atsifa ma ikpi tufa yehlehleh, de ikpi alindeh tasa hwra akpi ata nza a nati a ba, Felis ka nyiri tasa ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kǝ tswa dehreh! kǝ na anzoh. Meh ti hunji avu feh misi fi noh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Ŋoh Felis neh tana ka a gya agohsoh ŋoh la Ablusu a nati a nga ŋoh hungroh ta a hama ŋoh aniye, ka a leh a fi ŋoh na tutu la ta a ba ba a tsifa na a ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Ahushi afri nza a ka a gǝga, maka a sehneh kpra Agohmoh reh nga Fokiyus Festus, Felis nza a ka kira la Yahudawa mboh mata a kira na a ŋoh neh ka ta Ablusu ma da ka.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Hwra Akpi ma tomo Festus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ibi na atatoh Festus nza a ka a ba atsi de ndohmoh gwamnati, ka a hinga anyi Kaisariya a na Urushalima, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />agba firist mboh tasa agbugba Yahudawa mboh maka a ba na a ŋoh maka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh tsifa mboh ma ikpi Ablusu. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Maka luhu Festus na gbugbo la, ta a gyuru a tohmoh Ablusu reh a na Urushalima, mboh neh maka atsifa a gya la ma a nati a nana a leh a bana ma aki mata a mla Ablusu reh a kwo <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Festus ka bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Ma a leh a sumu Ablusu ni Kaisariya, kǝ hwa shidi ma mya za meh nati na a huru. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Ta agbugba amohnoh amboh anyi mata a ba ba a wa meh mata a nana a bleh tsifa mboh na ikpi a ŋoh na a huru, nza a lisa andromboh abibi reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Nza ka a te ibi atsiyatsiya ha agrumavoh na amoh, ka na a ŋoh Kaisariya. Ibi na afri ka a tuma na kpra hwra akpi ka a bleh la mata a wa Ablusu reh a ba ma tohmoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Ablusu nza ka a ba, Yahudawa amboh nza maka anyi Urushalima maka a shi a goh ŋoh, maka a leh a bleh tsifa abibi gaga na ikpi a ŋoh, mboh neh ma a sohroh a wina bleh ha a bu zizi ha a bu huru tsifa kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Ablusu neh ka a bleh tsifa a shwa ikpi a ŋoh la: &lt;&lt;Mya meh sohroh lisa androhmboh abibi na ikpi amgbasho Musa ha na ikpi ida Nnoh ha na ikpi Kaisar kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Festus neh a kira la Yahudawa mboh reh mata a hunji nana agohsoh, ka bleh ma Ablusu la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh nati kira ti wa meh na Urushalima mata a nana a hwra noh akpi ma tohmoh amya na a huru na ikpi tsifa amboh areh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Ablusu ka bleh la: &lt;&lt;Meh bu ma kpra hwra akpi Kaisar, ma mareh ŋa a bu yehlehleh mata ahwra meh akpi. Meh sohroh lisa andromboh abibi ma yahudawa mboh kpeh, noh za na wina dehreh. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Nza mya meh bu kyangwri kpakpana, meh lisa andromboh ata nza a tswa atsi kwo, meh sohroh leke kwo kpeh. Nza tsifa mboh nza ma a de a ba ni kpi amya reh a bu zizi kpeh, akyo a sohroh a tswa ta a de meh a nga mboh kpeh. Meh kwere mata a gu tsifa amya a na ni tohmoh Kaisar.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Festus nza ka atsifa ni kyangwri a ŋoh mboh a treh neh ka a bleh la: Nnoh kwere la mata a de tsifa anzoh a na ni tohmoh Kaisar. Nnoh nati na ni Kaisar!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Festus A luhu Agohmoh Agiriffa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ibi amboh anyi nza ka na tohmoh shidi Agohmoh Agiriffa tasa Banis maka a na Kaisariya la mata a nana a nga Festus agba. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Nza maka a nati a te ibi vara ma a huru neh, Festus ka a gu tsifa Ablusu reh a kate ma tohmoh Agohmoh reh. Ka a bleh la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri anyi a yama na mareh Felis tana a yi ata ma ida ka. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Meh ti kǝ na Urushalima reh, Agba Firist mboh tasa agbugba Yahudawa mboh maka a de tsifa a ba ma ikpi a ŋoh, maka a kwere meh la meh ti shimba ŋoh akpi. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />&lt;&lt;Meh kǝ bleh mboh la, Romawa mboh maka a hehreh ahwra akpi ma kyangwri kpeh, maka a jiji a de ŋoh a ba ma tohmoh amboh nza ma a de tsifa a ba ni ikpi a ŋoh reh mata ata ŋoh ta a bleh aniye a ŋoh ni ikpi tsifa reh feh. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Nza maka a ba ma mareh na amya, meh sohroh sa tsifa reh gya kpeh, ibi na afri neh meh kǝ tuma ma kpra hwra akpi tsifa reh meh kǝ bleh mboh la mata a de kyangwri reh a ba. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />amboh nza ma a ŋa ŋoh nza maka a hinga a shi a nati atsifa reh, meh kama bleh amya la ma a nati a bleh tsifa andromboh abibi na ikpi Ablusu, ma a sohroh a bleh wohroh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Mboh neh ma a bu na tsifa amboh anyi, ata nza ma a sohroh kira na Ablusu ma ikpi aki tufa Nnoh amoh reh kpeh, tasa za la Yeso tana a kwo, Ablusu a leh a nata la a treh a yama na fene. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Meh kǝ klombohsona ha meh ti kǝ chehcheh tsifa reh lele; meh kǝ luhu ha a nati a kira ta a na Urushalima mata ahwra ŋoh akpi ma a huru na ikpi tsifa amboh areh. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ablusu neh kwere la mata ata tsifa reh la Agohmoh agba Kaisar ta a shimba ŋoh akpi feh, meh kǝ bleh la mata sumu ŋoh a bana meh ti tohmoh na na Agohmoh Kaisar feh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agiriffa neh ka a bleh ma Festus la, &lt;&lt;Meh kira meh ti sere kyangwri areh na ikpi amya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Ka a bleh ŋoh la&lt;&lt;Ikya ni nati sere ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu Ma Tohmoh Agiriffa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ibi na afri neh, Agiriffa mboh ma Banis maka aniye a ba ma a jimi alindeh ikata agbugba mboh, ma a ba aniye nimeh ida dohsohna mboh ma agbugba amboh de ita mboh tasa agbugba kyangwri amoh mboh. Festus ka a bleh la mata a wa Ablusu reh a ba. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Festus ka bleh la: &lt;&lt;Agohmoh Agiriffa, tasa amboh nza ma a yama na ambohroh na mareh, nnoh nza noh kyangwri areh! Yahudawa mboh nambri ma, ma a de tsifa abibi a ba na amya ni ikpi a ŋoh na Urushalima tasa ni Kaisariya mareh, ma a gu agba amoh mboh a ka la a sohroh a tswa ta tuma ni fene za kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Mya feh meh sohroh hunji kyangwri reh ni kpakpana ata nza a tswa atsi kwo kpeh, Ŋoh ni ikpi a ŋoh a fa la mata a de hwra akpi a ŋoh a na ni tohmoh Kaisar meh kǝ tohmoh ŋoh na Roma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Meh sohroh bu na andromboh ata mya nza ni nati ŋa na Ada ma ikpi a ŋoh kpeh. Dehreh neh meh kǝ wa ŋoh ba na tohmoh amohnoh nambri tasa za la nnoh Agohmoh Agiriffa, la nimeh chehcheh tsifa anzoh neh meh ti hunji andromboh ata mya nza ni nati ŋa ba na anzoh. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Meh nza a sohroh a nati a zohhoh mya ti tohmoh kyangwri nza ma a de a ka meh ti sohroh bleh chuhu tsifa ata nza ma a de a ba ni ikpi a ŋoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agiriffa neh ka bleh ma Ablusu la, &lt;&lt;Maaka ta nnoh ti tsifa shwa ikpi anzoh.&gt;&gt;Ablusu ka a gu ivoh a ŋoh a ka, ka tsifa na a ŋoh la:<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;Agohmoh Agiriffa, meh nza nana andrehmeh areh mya nza ni nati shi ni tohmoh anzoh meh ti shwa ikpi amya ni ikpi tsifa mboh Yahudawa mboh nza ma a ŋa meh reh, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />tasa za nnoh ni wina lomo Yahudawa mboh nambri tasa awumu amboh ata mboh nza maka sa a leke ni itoh amoh reh. Nza a bu dehreh meh kwere nnoh ti soh ivoh yira ti sere tsifa amya.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />&lt;&lt;Yahudawa mboh nambri ma a wina biroh tuma amya ata meh ti kǝ bu na wohroh nyi ma akehreh reh, meh ti kǝ tre bu akpo afiya amya, tasa ma Urushalima. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Ma a wina meh anyi avoh kiri tasa ma a nati a wina tsifa ni ikpi amya, nza tama a kira, la nimeh aki ata nza a keh te iya nimeh aki tufa Nnoh ambohroh, mya mi tufa aki Farisiyawa mboh. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Nehnehreh meh shi ma tohmoh amohnoh la mata a hwra meh akpi tsifa nga agohsoh amya ma ikpi tsifa bleh gya ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh ma Ada ambohroh mboh reh. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Areh ŋa a bu gu faku ata alohsoh ambohroh agrumavoh a hwa afri nza ma gya agohsoh la a nati a su nza mboh tama tufa Nnoh alindeh ibibi a wa shini. Agohmoh, a bu tsifa gya agohsoh wohroh ŋa Yahudawa amboh areh nza ma a leh a ŋa meh reh. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Tsifa mboh feh anyi nimeh amohnoh ta a kohnoh la a nati a te iya Nnoh ta a yiri kyangwri anyi ni ikpi nyifo?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;Mya za na kpikpi meh tini nza amya la a bu yehlehleh meh ti tufa akeki nambri meh ti ha rya tohmoh tsifa Yeso ata Nazaret. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />A za ka a bu wohroh ŋa mya nza ni lisa ma Urushalima. Meh sa kira nyi na Agba Firist mboh meh kǝ fira amboh tufa yehlehleh na nimeh ida ka, tasa nza ma a mla mboh a kwo neh, meh kǝ kira la a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Meh kǝ tufa atsi dohsohna amoh mboh meh ti kǝ de mboh nga iya, tasa meh kǝ kira meh ti de mboh na wuwana mata a bleh tsifa abibi mata leke Yeso. Nimeh gofo amya ma ikpi amoh, meh kǝ na akpo afya amboh tswa meh ti de mboh te iya.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa na Ikpi Ablusu Nza Gyuruna A nga Agohsoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />&lt;&lt;A bu nimeh hende wohroh ŋa meh kǝ buti na Dimashku na kira Agba Firist mboh tasa amgbasho kira amoh. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Agohmoh, a bu na mgba atsitsi fi noh, mya nza ni kǝ bu ma aki, meh kǝ nza zanana anyi inza, a zanana a keh nnoh, ka rya a nza a goh meh Mbohroh ma amboh tufa meh. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Meh kǝ hwa ma inzi nambri ma ambohroh, meh kǝ sere agba anyi ka tsifa na amya na Aramaya la, &lt;Shawulu, Shawulu, nnoh leh de meh ti iya tsifa umbo? a bu duduna te mla na na kyangwri agba anzoh.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />&lt;&lt;Meh kǝ luhu ŋoh la, a ka bu noh anyi Ada?&gt;</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 26:15">Ada ka a bleh meh la, &lt;&lt;&lt;Mya meh bu Yeso, ata nnoh nza ni leh de ŋoh te iya reh.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Hinga nehnehreh ti shi na hwana anzoh. Mya meh kate nnoh meh ti seh nnoh ti bu ahwra tasa za ti bu kyangwri bleh tsifa mboh ma ikpi amya, tasa awumu amboh ata mya nza ni nati tsana noh ma tohmwo reh. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Meh nati sa noh hwana nyi na kyangwri anzoh mboh Israila tasa nyi na amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. Meh nati tohmoh nnoh na na amoh. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Ti vuru mboh iyo tasa ti gyuru mboh nyi nashi ni ba ni zanana, tasa mata anyi na wuwana agugu a ba amoh na Nnoh, la mata a gu kpakpana amoh mboh a te kohhroh tasa mata a hunji atsifi nimeh amboh ata nza ma a lisa mboh mata a bu na zanana ma aki nga agohsoh amoh na amya.<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu A bleh Tsifa ni Ikpi Ndohmoh A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />&lt;&lt;Ka a bu dehreh, Agohmoh Agiriffa, Meh sohroh wuwa agohsoh amya na tsifa nza ma a bleh meh anyi inza reh kpeh <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />meh kǝ jiji bleh mboh ma Dimashku, neh meh kǝ bleh mboh ma Urushalima tasa ma Yahudiya nambri tasa ma amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh za, meh kǝ hwra bleh mboh la mata a yi aki agugu amoh ata mata a gyuruna a ba na Nnoh tasa mata a lisa awumu ata a nati a tsana la mboh ma a yi aki agugu amoh mboh reh ata. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />A bu tsifa wohroh ŋa Yahudawa mboh nza ma a de meh na ida Nnoh reh tasa la mata a mla meh a kwo. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />A bu Nnoh ŋa a shingi meh a ba ba a te andrehmeh areh, a bu dehreh ŋa mya nza ni shi na mareh leh hwra bleh ma akǝkehreh tasa agbugba mboh. Meh sohroh bleh tsifa anyi tse kpeh, a bu tsifa ata Musa tasa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ma ta ka a bleh la a nati a su reh <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />la kristi reh a nati a te iya kanga tasa, tswanza ŋoh nza a bu na anyimbehreh ta ka a gyuru a hinga anyi ikpi nyifo, a nati a tsana aki zanana ma kyangwri a ŋoh mboh tasa amboh nza ma a sohroh a wina Nnoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Ablusu nza a ka a buti tsifa a shwa ikpi a ŋoh neh Agohmoh Festus ka a gu agba a ŋoh a ka ka bleh ŋoh la, Ablusu ni te a kwere!&gt;&gt; Kpehkpehteh anzoh gaga reh a de noh a te a kwere.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Ablusu ka bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Festus kyangwri agba meh sohroh te a kwere kpeh,&gt;&gt; A bu tsifa a zizi mya nza ni shi bleh areh tasa a bu lomo. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Agohmoh a wina tsifa amboh areh, meh nati wina tsifa na a ŋoh na agohsoh anyimbehreh. Meh wina la a sohroh a gu tsifa anyi a te kohhroh kpeh, tama a sohroh a lisa na ayuhu kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Agohmoh Agiriffa, nnoh ni sa tsifa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh? Meh wina ni kira.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agiriffa neh ka bleh ma Ablusu la, &lt;&lt;Ni nza anzoh la shidi dehreh ma nnoh nati wina de meh gyuru te Kirista?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Ablusu ka bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ha ta yanda, ha ta kama a yanda kpeh meh kwere Nnoh la a bu noh tsinzo kpeh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a shi a sehreh meh andrehmeh areh ma a nati a bu tswanza mya, ta a sohroh a bu na rishi nza ma a lafa meh reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Agohmoh a ŋoh ka a hinga, tasa gomna za na a ŋoh mboh ma Banis, tasa amboh nza ma a tuma mboh ma amoh. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Maka a yi ida reh ata, nza maka atsifa na itoh amoh, maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri areh a sohroh a lisa andromboh ata nza a tswa atsi mla a kwo ha mata a de ŋoh a ka kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agiriffa ka a bleh ma Festus la,&lt;&lt;Ablusu reh a tswa mata ata ŋoh avoh, bu ma a bleh la a sohroh a gu tsifa reh a na na Kaisar Agohmoh Roma reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Ablusu A tufa gbogblondo Amwo a na Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Nza maka atsifa a gya la meh ti tufa gbogblondo amwo na ambohroh Italiya reh, maka a fira Ablusu tasa amboh leh ma ida ka amboh anyi, maka a fira mboh a nga agba amboh de ita anyi isa a ŋoh a bu Yuliyus, nza anyi na amboh de ita ata Kaisar Augustas la mata a hwra akpi amoh. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Meh kǝ niye nimeh gbogblondo amwo anyi ata nza anyi Adirametiyum, ata kǝ ba whiri ta hinga a na akpokpo afiyafiya amboh anyi nza ma a bu ma Asiya, meh kǝ na hende ambohroh. Aristarku, a bu kyangwri anyi ata nza anyi Tasalonika ata akpo afiya Makidoniya za, a yama na ambohroh. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Ibi na afri meh kǝ tamba ma Sidon; Yuliyus neh nza ka a lisa ma Ablusu alindeh, ka ata ŋoh ta a na na ziza a ŋoh mboh la mata a lisa ŋoh awumu nza a kira. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Nyi ma a huru meh kǝ hinga na ambohroh fini yama inyo tana a keh gaga neh meh kǝ gǝga aki Sayifurus inyo tana a bu veve na mgba wohroh <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Nza meh kǝ te hwana fini akre ata nza a bu ma nda akpo afiya ata kilikiya tasa Famfiliya, meh kǝ na ambohroh Mira ata akpo afiya Likiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Ma a huru agba amboh de ita ata Roma ka a hunji gbogblondo amwo Alekzandiriya anyi waka a na a ŋoh Italiya maka a were reh nimeh.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Meh kǝ hende ve te ibi vara meh kǝ te iya feh misi na ni niye ma nda Kinidus. Inyo agba nza ka a ha reh rya tohmoh ma aki wohroh neh meh kǝ gona gǝga mgba ata inyo nza a yama kpeh reh, wohroh a bu mgba nyina atsifi ata amwo nza a shimba a gya kaekaereh ma Kirit nza a bu ma nda Salmoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Meh kǝ mehheh kavoh atsi kama gbogblondo amwo tufa akachi fini reh, meh kǝ ba bu niye ma akpo anyi maka a fi la, Atsi nvara, a bu ma nda akpo afiya Lasiya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Mbohroh timi yanda ma a huru shidi, kama gbogblondo amwo reh ka a bu na nyiri, na ameh wohroh reh ahushi tana a na gbugba, tasa de aniye ata gu vari kpakpana kǝ gǝga. Ablusu ka bleh mboh la, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri mboh, sehreh noh, meh nza la hende ambohroh nimeh amwo reh a nati a bu na nyiri tasa awumu ambohroh mboh za a nati a kasa nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh, tasa fene ambohroh mboh za.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Agba amboh de ita Roma reh, a leke ta sehreh tsifa ata Ablusu nza a bleh reh, ka tufa tsifa kyangwri kama gbogblondo amwo tasa kyangwri gbogblondo amwo reh. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Atsi tamba nvara ata Lasiya mboh reh ka a sohroh a zohhoh gbogblondo amwo mboh mata a tamba ma a huru na ameh awi kpeh, amboh tswa tama a kira la mata a rya tohmoh na hende reh, tasa za la mata a na na aniye ma Finiks, la nza a nati a zohhoh reh neh mata a rya ameh awi ma a huru. Finiks reh tana a bu atsi tamba gbogblondo amwo ata nza a bu ma amwo kaekaereh ata Kirit reh, ata nza a shi a nza mgba afo ata nnoh nvishi tasa mgba shwa ata nnoh nvishi.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyo agba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Inyo nza ka a jiji a fo anyi mgba afo, maka a nza amoh la mboh maaka a hunji andromboh ata mboh nza ma a kira reh; maka a fufa karafi ata nza a de gbogblondo amwo reh, maka a gu aki Kirit a na ma nda akachi fini. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />A sohroh a yanda kpeh, Inyo agba ka a fo, maka a fi la &lt;&lt;Inyo a fo nyi mgba nnoh nerebi,&gt;&gt; ka a fo a tamba a gu anyi ma kpra Agohmoh ata amwo nza a shimba a gya ma atsitsifi reh. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Inyo nza ka a keh wuwana gbogblondo amwo reh, ka a sohroh a wina gu aki inyo reh kpeh; meh kǝ tufa nyo reh ka alindeh a na ni nda. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Nza meh kǝ tufa mgba nyina ameh akpo afiya Kauda ata amwo nza a shimba a gya ma atsitsifi reh, atsi ata inyo reh kǝ nyinana, meh kǝ wa iya atsi wina gu gbogblondo amwo akehreh gya nimeh agbaa reh. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Nza kyangwri mboh maka kpi a na akachi, maka a tsitsiya gbogblondo amwo reh na rishi la ta a de ŋoh a gya. Ma lisa dehreh tsifa nyiri la mboh mata sohroh a gǝga a gbo aniye nimeh asehngeh Sirtis nza a ka a mina awumu nambri reh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Fini reh ka a te a kwere gaga, ibi na afri maka a buti fira awumu a sangra a kate anyi ma gbogblondo amwo reh a na nimeh amwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Ibi na atatoh, maka a fira mgbiri awumu ndohmoh gbogblondo amwo reh a sangra ni ivoh amoh. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Nza meh kǝ te ibi vara meh sohroh nza nnoh ha akpukpa kpeh, tasa inyo agba reh ka akǝkeh ma, meh kǝ fufa gya agohsoh ambohroh kate la meh nati za nvara kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Nza maka a te ibi vara ma sohroh a rya andromboh kpeh, Ablusu ka a hinga a shi na atsitsifi amoh ka a bleh mboh la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri, tama a bleh la ni sehreh noh tsifa amya mya nza ni bleh noh la ti kama hehreh hinga nyi nnoh Kirit kpeh reh; Neh bu mohnoh ni sohroh kasa nnoh na awumu amohnoh ha awumu amohnoh ta a te abibi kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Nehnehreh neh meh bleh noh ti bu noh na wuwa agohsoh, akyo amohnoh anyi a nati a sohroh a wina kasa na fene ŋoh kpeh; A bu gbogblondo amwo reh ma a nati a te abibi. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ni shini nza a gǝga areh Nnoh ata mya nza ni bu ahwra a ŋoh a tohmoh Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh a ŋoh ka a ba ba a shi na nda amya <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />ka bleh meh la, &lt;Ablusu, kama nyiri kpeh. Nnoh nati shi ma tohmoh Kaisar Agohmoh Roma ta hwra noh akpi; Tasa tsifa anzoh Nnoh kǝ nza kwini kyangwri amboh nza ma a yama na anzoh nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh la mata nvara nambri.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Nza a bu dehreh rya nnoh tohmoh na wuwa agohsoh amohnoh, kyangwri mboh, mya meh nga agohsoh amya na Nnoh la a nati a bu tswanza ŋoh nza a bleh meh reh. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Dehreh neh, inyo a nati a yi reh a fi ma kpra Agohmoh anyi nza a bu ma atsitsifi fini reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gbogblondo Amwo A hwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Ibi na Agrumavoh a hwa anneh nashi ni inyo ka a treh a leh a yiyi reh na fini akre ata Meditereniya reh. Na atsitsifi shini neh amboh kama gbogblondo amwo reh maka a nza amoh la ma a ba whiri na akachi fini reh. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Maka a gu rishi, maka lafa ma kpakpa maka tsara amwo reh a nza maka a nza a treh a bu ma atsi niye ŋoh hwana agrumavoh adada agrumavoh a hwa afri. Nza maka a na ma tohmoh shidi, maka a gyuru a tsara za, maka a hunji hwana agrumavoh adada atsiyatsiya na anyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Maka a nyiri la gbogblondo amwo amoh reh ta a sohroh a kpa kpakpa mboh kpeh, maka a huya karafi amboh anyi anneh ka a goh a dohsoh na mgba inyina la gbogblondo amwo reh ta kama a hehndeh kpeh tasa maka a kwere Nnoh la nerebi ta a yanda fifi. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Amboh kama gbogblondo amwo reh maka kira la mboh mata a gbo a na amoh, maka a gu gbogblondo amwo akehreh ŋoh a kate mata ka a landa la mboh ma a nati a gu hwana gbogblondo amwo reh a tamba na mgba tohmwo gbogblondo amwo agba reh. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Ablusu neh ka a bleh ma agba amboh de ita tasa amboh de ita reh la, &lt;&lt;Nza kyangwri amboh areh mata a shi nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh kpeh, ni nati sohroh hunji noh nvara kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Amboh de ita mboh reh maka a shishimba rishi nza a de gbogblondo amwo akehreh ŋoh reh maka a yi ŋoh ata ta a hwa a na a ŋoh.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Na mgba atsitsifi nerebi Ablusu ka a bleh la mata a rya irya nambri ma amoh. Ka a bleh mboh la &lt;&lt;Ibi agrumavoh a hwa anneh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ni sohroh rya nnoh awumu rya kpeh ni kasa nnoh atsi kohnoh. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />nehnehreh mi bleh noh te rya nnoh rya. rya nnoh te nvara nnoh. Anyimbehreh nimeh amohnoh a nati a sohroh a te iya kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Nza ka a bleh dehreh a treh, Ablusu ka a gu afohfohnoh ka a kwende Nnoh ni tohmoh amoh nambri. Ka a kya neh ka a buti rya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Nambri ma amoh maka a hunji wuwa agohsoh maka a rya irya na ikpi amoh. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Nambri ma ambohroh timi bu 276 nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Nza maka a rya a hunu, maka a fira mgbiri awumu yohroh irya reh ata a sangra nimeh amwo la gbogblondo amwo reh ta kama arishi gaga za kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Nerebi nza a ka a yanda, maka a sohroh a nza akpo inzi reh a wina kpeh neh, maka a nza asehngeh ma hroh anyi, maka a nza dehreh maka a kama gbogblondo amwo reh a na a huru. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Maka a shimba rishi ata nza a de karafi gbogblondo amwo reh a gohdohsoh, maka a yi mboh ata ma fini akre reh tasa za maka a hingre rishi ata nza a de akroh kama gbogblondo amwo reh. Maka a gu kuri a ka ma tohmwo gbogblondo amwo reh la inyo ta a yi mboh a na ni nda kpeh, maka a na amoh ma akachi fini. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Gbogblondo amwo reh ka a na na a kpa asehngeh ka soh ikpi a ŋoh ma asehngeh reh ka za a wina susuna za kpeh, tohmwo gbogblondo amwo reh ka a hwrana anyi mgba inyina tsifa ata amwo nza a leh a te a kwere reh. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Amboh de ita mboh reh maka ahwra a gya la mboh ma ta ka a mla amboh ata ma ta ka a de mboh a ka reh la anyi amoh ta a kama a huda a na a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Agba amboh de ita reh neh ka a kira la ŋoh ta a shwa fene Ablusu a gya, ka a shwa mboh. Ka a bleh mboh la akyo ata nza a wina huda ta a tsyumuna a kate anyi ma gbogblondo amwo reh ta a huda a na a ŋoh akachi fini reh. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Mgbiri tama a na a huru na hwashi agbeh ha na hwashi gbogblondo amwo reh. Ma aki wohroh maka a na na aniye na akachi fini alindeh.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Ablusu Ma Malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Mbohroh nza meh kǝ tamba alindeh, meh kǝ sehreh la maka a fi sa atsifi reh la Malta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Achifi kyangwri amboh ata nza ma yama ma atsi tamba reh ma a lisa reh alindeh gaga. Awi tana a ba tasa za atsifi ka ananana maka ava reh shira tasa za maka a ringa reh nambri. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Ablusu nza ka a na na a fira ishi a ba ba a were ma shira reh, anu anyi, shira ka hwene ka a katsi ŋoh a kate ta ka a ha ivoh a ŋoh a de. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Achifi kyangwri mboh nza ma ka a nza iyoh atsi kohrona ma ivoh Ablusu reh, maka a bleh ma itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri areh a bu kyangwri mla kyangwri mboh kwo; neh vari a nati a nga ŋoh fene kpeh, ha a nvara anyi ma fini akre.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ablusu neh ka a basa iyoh reh a fi ma shira tasa za andromboh ka a sohroh a te ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Kyangwri mboh tama ka a nza amoh la a nati ashwi ha ta a hinga a hwa a kwo mi, nza maka bana yanda tasa za ma a sohroh a nza andromboh anyi tse a te ŋoh kpeh neh, maka a gyuru agohsoh amoh maka a bleh la&lt;&lt;Kyangwri reh a bu noh mi.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Kyangwri anyi isa a ŋoh a bu Fubiliyus tana a bu na adada mboh gaga ni nda a huru, ŋoh a bu agba nimeh amboh akpo afiya reh. Ŋoh ka a sa reh ivoh afri a gya a te ibi atatoh. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Alehmeh Fubiliyus reh tana a wuwana kpeh, bishi avoh tasa were abi tana a wa ŋoh aniye. Ablusu ka aniye a na ida ŋoh, ka kwere Nnoh tsifa a ŋoh, ka a gya ŋoh ivoh ma ikpi ta ka nga ŋoh wuwana. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Nza ka a bu dehreh, mgbiri amboh bishi mboh ma a huru maka a ba maka nga mboh wuwana. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Maka nga reh agba ma akeki gaga, tasa mbohroh nzimi kǝ nati na ambohroh, maka nga reh awumu mboh nza mi kira.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu A na na Aniye ma Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Anara atatoh nza maka a gǝga meh kǝ hinga nyi Malta nimeh gbogblondo amwo ata nza anyi Alekzandiriya ata ta ka a tuma ma a huru a treh ameh awo reh. Tama a lisa ŋoh kpra yafa isehfeh nnoh mboh, ata maka a fi la Kasto tasa Polluz <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Nza meh kǝ na ni te ma Sirakus meh kǝ te ibi atatoh ma a huru. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Meh kǝ niye ma gbogblondo amwo na ni niye ma Rigiyum. Ibi na afri ŋoh inyo ka afo anyi mgba afo a ba, ibi na afri na tohmoh neh meh kǝ niye ma Futiyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Ma a huru meh kǝ hunji atsi amboh anyi nza ma a bu amboh tufa mboh ma Roma. Maka a fi reh la meh ti na ni te ibi atehrehkifi na anyi na amoh. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Amboh tufa mboh ma Roma nza ma ka a sehreh tsifa ma ikpi ambohroh reh, maka a ba anyi akpo afiya ata kpakpranda Affiyus, tasa akpo anyi nza maka a fi la afiya tamba sehneh mboh atatoh, a ba ba a hunji reh ma a huru. Ablusu nza ka a nza mboh reh, ka a kwende Nnoh tasa za ka a hunji wuwa itoh. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Mbohroh nza meh kǝ na ni te ma Roma, maka ata Ablusu ta a na na a tuma a ŋoh, tasa amboh de ita ta a tuma a sumu ŋoh.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu A bleh Tsifa Nnoh Ma Roma Maka A sumu ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ibi atatoh nza a ka a gǝga, ka a fi agbugba Yahudawa mboh. Nza maka a dohsohna, Ablusu ka a bleh mboh la: &lt;&lt;Atsi amya mboh, meh sohroh lisa andromboh abibi ma kyangwri ambohroh mboh ha na ikpi a soh ada mboh kpeh, ma a de meh na Urushalima nga kyangwri Roma mboh. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Kyangwri Roma mboh nza maka luhu meh tsifa, tasa za maka kira la mboh mata a yi meh ata, tsifa ata nza ma a sohroh a hunji meh na kpakpana ata nza a tswa atsi mla a kwo kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Yahudawa mboh nza maka a sa a leke reh, maka a de meh na wuwana la meh ti kwere Agohmoh Kaisar, a sohroh a bu la meh bu na tsifa ma ikpi kyangwri amya mboh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ma a lafa meh na njehnjehreh ata areh tsifa ata kyangwri Israila mboh nza ma gya agohsoh amoh na amya reh, a bu wohroh ŋa ata mya nza ni kwere la meh kira meh ti nza noh meh ti tsifa na anzoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Maka a sa aniye la, &lt;&lt;Meh sohroh hunji amgbasho nyi ma Yahudiya na ikpi anzoh kpeh, tasa anyi nimeh atsi mboh nza ma anyi a huru a ba ta a bleh andromboh abibi na ikpi anzoh kpeh. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Neh meh kira meh ti sehreh ha nnoh nati tsifa lele, mi wina la kyangwri mboh a treh atsifi nambri ma atsifa na ikpi amboh ata areh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Maka a bleh a gya la mata a hunji Ablusu ibi anyi, tasa maka a ba ba a dohsohna ma ida sene mboh ma atsi ata Ablusu ta ka a yama reh. nza ka anyi na nerebi a na na a te na Nvishi ka a leh atsi a bleh tsifa ata de Agohmoh Nnoh, tasa za ka a kira ta akpi mboh a ba na Yeso ma atsi tsana akpi Musa tasa amgbasho ata nza anyi na amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Agbugba amboh tswa maka sa tsifa ŋoh kira, amboh tswa neh maka sa tsifa leke. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Maka a sa a leke ni itoh amoh tasa maka a buti na amoh Ablusu nza a ka a bleh tsifa ata trina ŋoh: &lt;&lt;Huru zanana Nnoh a bleh tsifa a zizi ma ada amohnoh mboh nza ta ka a bleh ma aniye Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh la: <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Ka bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">&lt;Na ni bleh kyangwri amboh areh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">&lt;&lt;Ni nati kǝ sehreh noh dehreh neh ni nati sohroh wina noh lomo reh kpeh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">nnoh nati kǝ nza noh dehreh neh nnoh nati sohroh nza wina noh kpeh.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Agohsoh kyangwri amboh areh kǝ wuwana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Ka a te mboh iya mata a sehreh na ashotoh amoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">tasa za maa a hama ashotoh amoh mboh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Kavoh kpeh reh neh tama a nza na iyo amoh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">mata sehreh na ashotoh amoh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">mata a wina na agohsoh amoh mboh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">tasa mata a gyuruna, la meh ti nga mboh wuwana. &gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Tsifa Ablusu ata trina reh la, &lt;&lt;Meh kira ti wina noh la nvara Nnoh reh maka a tohmoh a na na amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh, tasa za ma a nati a sa a kira!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Nza ka a bleh dehreh a treh, Yahudawa mboh maka a na amoh maka a leh a sa a leke na itoh amoh abibi ma ta ka agohroh.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Ka a te ahushi afri Ablusu ka a tuma na afiya a ŋoh ata ŋoh ta ka a hehreh a de kohfoh ma reh ta ka a sa sehneh mboh nza ma a ba na a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Nza maka a sohroh a ha ŋoh kpeh ka ahwra tsifa de Agohmoh Nnoh a bleh tasa za ka a tsana mboh ma ikpi Ada Yeso kristi reh na agohsoh anyimbehreh.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>